<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">YESƆ JASHONƐ Lamma: Ruu tɔ̃vɨng Riinɛ.</book>
  <para style="toc1">Yesɔ jashonɛ i vishonɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Vishonɛyi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Vish</para>
  <para style="mt1">YESƆ JASHONƐ I</para>
  <para style="mt2">Vishonɛ</para>
  <para style="imt">Yutasinɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk" closed="false">Yesɔ jashonɛ i vishonɛ ukɔ yɛ ɗekɨn rɛ a ruu tɔ̃vɨn au shɛ a Lukka naani. Vi pɛ̃niba gbete shɔ kasirɛ nɛ shɔu zɛyɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔu geli shɔ laabeenɛ ɓalinɛm nɔgbete Yesɔ jashonɛyi yuu gbete gaa a yini ɗekɨn, nogbete a Suru Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ gɨn a yini yɛ, i nwanya tɔ̃vɨn tɔ au yuu ni a ɗɔ i sãti ruum aɗɔ tot-tot&lt;&lt;a Urushalima, a Yahudiya a Samaritani kpai, a ɗɔgbete koo doo nya yɛ&gt;&gt;(1.8). N nogbete shɔ kɔri ruu a Kirisayi yuu ai ranɛni, a nogbete i gaa a tete Yahudawayi a shɔgbete i ɓa Yahudawa ɓa yuu kɛɗɔn a yɛ ɗekɨn a rikɛ vi sisɨnãnɛ a koo tipi kpai. Shɔ vi beenɛu pɔ̃ sisɨn sɔ̃njo nɛn tasi u shɔ laa ɓalinɛwi nɛ Kirisayi si ɓa shɔgbete ai kasi gɔmnati lɛsinɛ aɗɔgbete Raomayi roo kpati aɗɔnyɛ ɓa, sɔ̃n tɔti Kirisayi sisɨn ãnɛ si pɛ Yahudawayi naa vipɛlinɛ ai nyaba gɨnnɛ.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk" closed="false">Yesɔ jadɔyi vishonɛ</char>
    <char style="bk" closed="false">shɔyɛ vɔsi ɗɔɔtɔ ɗɔ taati, shɔyɛ tasi ɗɔgbete vim sha aɗɔnyɛ, a ɗɔgbete shɔ nwa ruu tɔ̃vɨn a Yesɔ yuu yɛ, a nogbete shɔ gaa Ɗalapa wɛrɛ bɛlinɛ yɛ: (1) Yɛ gaa a nogbete Kirisayi gaa ranɛ a Urushalima a pɛsikɛ nogbete Yesɔ gẽ lapayɛ; (2) Yɛ gɨnnaa kɛ yɛnɛ tipi Palasinawayi; a (3) Yɛ gɨnnaa kɛ bang yɛnɛ ɗɔɔ kpɛlɛ, yɛnɛ kotipi Meditenya a Rooma.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="ip">Vi tɔ̃vɨn gbete ɗekɨn a <char style="bk" closed="false">Yesɔ jadɔyi vishonɛyi</char><char style="bk" closed="false">ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Suru Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ vishonɛ, gbeteu a a kakani a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi yuu a Urushalima a lee pɛntikos, au yɛ ɗekɨn ai vitasinɛni, a shɔ wɛrɛ Ɗayi kaka ãnɛ ai yupɛ̃niyi ni kopileepiya a vigbete i sha a ɓuzɨn labeenɛmi. Kirisa gbete i gaa yɛ i nyaruuba shɔ otɛttɔ a nomba nyawaanɛ, a vipɛlnɛ gbete shɔ bee a Yesɔ jadɔyi vishonɛ laabeenɛ, tasinɛ nyaruubau kaka aɗɔn atette shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi ɗɔbii, a yuɓasinɛ gbete i ɓasi a wɛrɛ Ɗayɛ.</char></para>
  <para style="iot">Vi au ɓuzɨn yɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">vibiimaanɛ aru shɔshinɛkɨnti (1.1-26)</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Yesɔ nyaãsinɛ au wasinaa a ruumanɛ (1.1-14)</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Shɔ gbeteu tɛ Yahuza laa ɔ̃nɛ yɛ (1.15-26)</para>
  <para style="io1">Shɔshinɛkɨnti a Urushalima (2.1-8.3)</para>
  <para style="io1">Shɔshinɛkɨnti a Yahudiya a Samariya (8.4-12.25)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bituru ɗɔvishonɛ (13.1-28.31)</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Shɔ sisɨ ãnɛyi ɗɔyi gaa yɛnɛyɛ (13.1-14.28)</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Kirisayi ɔ̃nɛ a Urushalima (15.1-35)</para>
  <para style="io2">c. Shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi ɗɔyi pɛsi yɛnɛyɛ (15.36-18.22) d. Shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi pɛsi e taati yɛnɛyɛ (18.23-21.16)</para>
  <para style="io2">e. Bituru shɔ jahm a Urushalima, Kaisariya, a Rooma ni (21.17-28.31)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />N shɔ kasinɛ Tiyofolo: A laabeenɛ gbete n gaa beenɛyɛ, n bee vi ayuu vi gbete Yesɔ pɛliyɛ kpai a vi gbete mati shɔ piti yunɛ ɗagbete gau vishonɛyɛ <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />yɛnɛ lee gbete shɔ tuurɛ yɛnɛ kolapa. U ɓɛɛ tunɛ yɛnɛ kolapa, ãsiu jashonɛyi gbete lɔyiyɛ nya pɛli vishonɛ a Ɗa suru kaka . <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />A knti dii laa ziti au vɔyɛ tasiu yuutɔ a nyaba tottot aru u tasi shɔnɛ u doo a suruni. I zɛurɛ, a nwanyatɔ ayini aru Ɗa kpati roonɛ. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Naa i tolinyatɛ a ɗɔzɔɔ, a ãsi-nyamnɛ:&lt;&lt;Ɔ kɔɔ yaa Urushalima nɛ, ɔ ga vigbete n geliyɛ, vi gbete mayɛni mayɛ nɛn ãwɔyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Yɔhana pɛli shɔ batizima a mii, asitɛɗɔkɔ yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa dɔkɔkɔ ɓa shɔyɛ pɛlɔɔ batizima kɛ a Ɗa suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗalapa Tuu Yesɔ Yɛnɛ Kolapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Naa Yesɔ jashonɛyi i tolinyatɛ a Yesɔ ɗɔbii, i hɨunɛ,&lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa, a yɛ sɔɔri Israilayi kpati roonɛ kɛ dɔdɔrim kɔya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Yesɔ kasiyinya nɛ,&lt;&lt; Mayɛ kɔshɛli u kaka aɗɔn u pɔ̃ ɗa vi pɛlinɛ a yumusinɛni, ɓa ɔ vishonɛ ɔ zɛ lee gbete yɛ pɛliyɛ ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Ama naa Ɗa suru kaanɛ awɔ bi, ɔ yɛ kpaa kaka tɔ, a Urushalima ɔ yɛ ɔ̃kɛ shɔ gbeteyi i shi ang yuuyɛ, a Yahudiya, a Samariya ni kpai, yɛnɛ ɗɔgbete koo sɔ̃ nyayɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Akɨnti gbete yisi vim shanɛtɛ, i ɗɔgbete i biliuyɛ Ɗa tuu Yesɔ yɛnɛ kolapa, sabu kukiurɛ, i ji zeu tɔɓa. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />I ɗɔɔ nɔɔ tàànɛ a lapa, u ɗɔɔ yɛnɛ shɔwɔyi ziti i shi au ɗɔbii a fãrã puruni <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔ shɔ Galili miyi, ɔ shili piruuvi ɔ taa nɔɔ lapa viya? Yesɔn kɔ gbete Ɗa tuu awɔ ɗɔbii yɛnɛ kolapa, yɛ sɔɔ sɔ̃nji nankɔ nagbete ɔ zɛuyɛ u ɗɔɔ kolapa yɛnɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ lɔɔ Matiya u Sɔɔ Yahuza ɗɔ,ɔ̃nɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ jashonɛyi shɛ a dɔkɔpɔ Zɛtun i sɔɔkɛ Urushalima, gbete yɛ tuu shɔ mili gbete yɛnɛ komoo pɛ̃nibauni. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />I to komoo pɛ̃nibaurɛ i sɔɔkɛ yɛti jaa gbete i si a ɗɔnyɛː Shɔwiyi ikɔyi ɔ̃rɛ Bituru, Yɔhana, Yakubu, a Anduru, Filibu, Tomasi, Baitalami, Matiyu, Yakub Alifa ɓɛjaa, Siman shɔ gbete kasi ɓanɛn tipiu sɔɔ knti ɓa, a Yahuza Yakub ɓɛɛ jaa. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />I tolinya a lee-lee ɗɔzɔɔ aru Ɗa gakinɛ, a soroyini nyazɔɔ a Mariyamu Yesɔ ɓini a ɓɛzɔ̃yini. <verse eid="ACT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />A ɗawuni shɔ pɛli miti shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a Ɗa bi i si mɛnɛ laa mangbete kpai, a Bituru yulapa ai tete, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Mazɔ̃yi, ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ shɔ yisi nya vigbete Ɗa nyaruubii shayɛtɔ gbete Ɗa suru sha a Dauda nyayɛ aru Yahuza nɛ, Yahuza ukɔ yɛ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ ɗekɨn tɛnɛ aɗɔ Yesɔ sãnɛni. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Yahuda u sijo au tete kɨnkɔ, shɔ lɔurɛ aru u shovi a ukɔni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />(Yahuda woo ɗɔ a saa gbete au kpaa a nyaba kɔ̃linɛyɛ, kɛdɔn nwesi ayuu a vɔrɛ; u buru sãrɛ, u jaaburu zɔɔti ãti a ɓili kpai. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Shɔ gbeteyi ɔ̃nɛ a Urushalima kpai i nta vimtɔ, i ɓa ɗɔu nii ai nyakoo nɛ Akidama. Ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ &lt;&lt;Tipi kpaa.&gt;&gt;)<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Bitru sha sɔ̃nnɛ Shɔ bee a labeenɛ Zaburayɛ nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">Mɛnɛ u wɛrɛ u ɔ̃kɔɔ naa zãã wɛrɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">mɛnɛ shɔ wɔɔ u ɔ̃kɔɓa ɗɔmɓa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Shɔ bee sisɔ̃n tɛttɔ nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">Mɛnɛ shɔwɔ u rau vishonɛ kɔɔtɔ.<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Arumkɔ&lt;&lt;Ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ shɔ lɔɔ shɔ wɔɔtɔ, au tete a ɗa gbete yesɔ si au ukɔniyɛ, au zɛ Yesɔ tonɛ au shɛnnɛni yɛ tɛttɔ, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />yuunɛ a ɗagbete Yɔhana nwari shɔ ruu batizimayɛ pɛlinɛyɛ, anɛ ɗagbete Ɗalapa tuu Yesɔ au ɗɔbii yɛnɛ kolapa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Shɔ ɓaa shɔzɛ ziti nyarɛ: Yusufu, shɔ gbete si shɔ ɓaunɛ Barsaba (au shɔ zɛu nii a Jusitu), a Maatiya. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Kɛɗɔn i gaki Ɗa i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa, mɔkaa zɛ shɔ sisɨn rɛ kpai, a tasiu nɛ atette shɔzɛ ziti gbete a lɔɔ ɓa miyini <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />u ɔ̃ a jashonɛ u tɛ ɗɔ,ɔ̃nɛ gbete Yahuza yaayɛ, aru u yɛ ɗɔ gbete tɔ̃rɛ u ɓɛɛyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Kɛɗɔn i nta laaparɛ aru i lɔɔ shɔzɛ gbete atette shɔzɛ zitiyi, shɔ gbete laapa lɔɔuyɛ sipɛ Maatiya, shɔ tosiu kɛkn atette jashonɛyi kopi tu gbeteni.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ɗa Suru Anɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Naa lee gbete shɔ ɓaanɛ pentako atɛ, shɔ sisɨn anɛyi a Ɗa bi kpai i tolinya ɗɔ gbete. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Ɓa shɔ zɛnɛni ɓa shɔ nta yeenya wɔɔ shɛ a kunyasi a kaa naa sɔrɔ gbete au shɛ a gãgãniyɛ, a yii wɛrɛ gbete ai ɔ̃ ɗɔnniyɛ kpai. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Kɛɗɔn i zɛ viwɔɔ naa ɗɛɛti yaa au sãtirɛ ɗii kopiya a ɗɔuni. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗalapa ãi Ɗa Sururɛ i gaa nyanwanɛkɛ a nyakoo wɔɔ totot, ji nagbete Suru pɔ̃yirɛ yɛ nɛi nwayɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Shɔ Yahudawa gbete i ɔ̃nɛ a Urushalimayɛ, shɔ Ɗalapa seti ntanɛ i shɛ aɗɔ totot a kootipi. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Naa i nta yeenyamtɛ, mooyi waanɛ i tolinyarɛ. I kpai i bizaakɛtɔ, aruviya kopiya ntarɛ mooyi i kɛ nwanyanɛ ai nyakoo. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Bizaanɛ fɛ̃ɛm, i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ gbete i nwanyam kpai mɓa shɔ Galili ɓaya! <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Pɛlikɛ ruvi u ntarɛ i nyanwa au nyakoo viya? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />U pɛ shɔ patiya, a shɔ Mediya, a Elama; a shɔ Mesopotamiya, a shɔ tipi Yahudiya, a shɔ Kapadosiya; wɔsɔ̃n pɔntu a Esiya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Yunɛ Farijiya a Pamfiliya, yunɛ Masar a tipi Libiya maani a Suriyani. U shɔ gãsiyi i a tipi Rooma. <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />U shɔ Yahudawa a shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓani kpai i rikɛtɛ shɔ Judiyayi, u shɔ gãsiyi a Kireta a Arabiya a shɔni kpai u ntarɛ i ɗɔɔ nyanwanɛ au nyakoo ayuu vi pɛ̃niba gbete Ɗalapa pɛliyɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Kopiya bizaarɛ, ai yuu riirɛ, kɛɗɔn i hɨli zɔnɛ, &lt;&lt;Vim tasinɛ iviya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Ama shɔwɔyi geli shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi nɛ, Shɔmiyi ɓoomiitɛ rii yuutɛ!''<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bituru nyanwanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Bituru yulapa a gãsi jashɔnɛyini kopi a tu gbete a gaa mooyi nyanwarinɛrɛ a gãgãni a shanɛː &lt;&lt;Mazɔ̃ Yadawayi a shɔ gbeteyi ɔ̃nɛ a Urushalimayɛ, ɔ wesho pɛ ang nya ɔ nta vigbete n gelɔɔ pɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Shɔmiyi ɓa mii rii yuurɛ ɓa, ɓa nagbete ɔ pɔ̃ aa sisɨnyɛ ɓa; dɔdɔrim gadi dɔɔɗa gɨnnɛ ntatɛ mannɛɛ sheeli. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Shɔmpɛ, vigbete janyagadi Joyeli nwanya au yuuni shanɛ: <verse eid="ACT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />A lee gbete dii yɛ sɔ̃nyayɛ, Ɗalapa shanɛː</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">N yɛn tɛ̃ɛ̃riyi ko ko-piya n Suru tɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Mɛjaayi vɔshɔyi a soroyini i yɛ geli shɔ vi gbete n geliyi n-tɛ i shayɛtɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">A jakasayi i yɛ zɛ vitɔ a nɔrinɛni, wɔsɔ̃n a shɔpẽniyi i yɛ nɔritɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Ko n jawɛrɛyi, vɔshɔyi a soroyini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">N yɛn tɛ̃ɛriyi n Suru tɔ a leeuni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">ai yɛ nwan ruubiitɔ.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />N yɛn pɛli vibiizaanɛyi a kunyasi lapa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">a vitasinɛyini a kootipi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">Kpaa yɛ ɔ̃tɔ, a yaani, wɔsɔ̃n zɨnri ɓiti-ɓitini;<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Ɗalapa yɛ pɔ̃rɛ ɗaa yɛ tonya ɓa, a shɛlɛni yɛ rii naa kpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">vim yɛ pɛlipɛtɔ Uɓeyelapa dii bassinɛ ɓɛɛ anɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Kɛɗɔn, shɔu gbete kɛ ɓaanyanɛ a Uɓeyelapa bi nɛu pɔ̃sinnaa yɛ raautɔ.<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Ɔ wesho a ruum, n shɔbiiyi shɔ Israila! Yesɔ shɔ Nazara ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ gbete Ɗalapa tasɔɔ u kaka suru wasa-wasa yɛ, a nyaba vibiizaanɛ a vitasinɛni gbete Ɗalapa pɛli awɔ ɗɔbii au kabiiyɛ. Ɔ yuu ɔ zɛ vim tɛttɔ, aruviya pɛli ji awɔ tetemkɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Ji nagbete Ɗalapa kasiu vipɛlinɛyɛ pɔ̃ tɛttɔ gboti au sisɨnɛ yɛ ãwɔ Yesɔ tɔ; awɔ yɛ pɔ̃ shɔruuviniyi i nyourɛ a nyaba naɓaanɛlaa. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Ama Ɗalapa kaka kaliu naarɛ a yusiu a suruni, aruviya yɛ pɛli ɓa vɔrɔ yɛ sã ɓa u ɔ̃ naa shɔ jaahm ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Dauda sha au yuunɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">N zɛ Uɓeyelapa kopiɗaviya ang ɗekɨn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">u a nkɔni ɗɔɔli, n yɛn yɔriyuu ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Arumkɔ n nta sisɨn purutɛ fɛ̃ɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">n nya a ɗɔ soo sisɨn puru tɔ̃nɛ fɛ̃ɛm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">n yɛn ɔ̃ atette sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ a Ɗa bi,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />aruviya a yɛ yamɓa a kootipi shɔ gbete vɔtɔm ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">a yɛ yaa jagbete tɔ̃vɨn ɓa u suru u pmrɛ a sàà ni ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />A tasin nyaba gbete n ti suru tɛttɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">a ɔ̃nɛ a nkɔni yɛ pɔ̃nrɛ n ɔ̃ atette yɛti puruni. <verse eid="ACT 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />N-shɔbiiyi shɔ Isireila, ɔ̃rintɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ n nwarɔɔ nyatɔ ɓa tete ɓusinɛ ɓa, ayuu u ɓɛuru Dauda, Vɔrɛ shɔ gbãrɛ, u yusàà doo au ɗɔbiim <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />U si janyagadi, zɛ vigbete Ɗalapa ma a wuniyɛ tɛttɔ: Ɗalapa tee tɛttɔ nɛn yɛ pɔ̃ shɔzɛ gbete u ɔ̃ kpati a Dauda laduru, nagbete Dauda u si jiyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Dauda zɛ vigbete Ɗalapa yɛ pɛli a ɗekɨn, kɛɗɔn nwanya aru shɔshɔraanɛ yunɛ a sàà a shanɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">&lt;&lt;Ɗalapa ji yau ɓa a sàà ni ɓa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:31">u bi ji pm ɓa sàà ni ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Ɗalapa yuusi Yesɔm lapatɛ a suruni, u kpai ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ shinɛ akɨnti a rumni. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Ɗalapa yusiurɛ au pɔu au ka nakɨn, pɛ Ɓeye, tɛ Ɗa Suru tɛttɔ au ɗɔbii, ji nagbete ma siyɛ. Vigbete ɔ zɛ dɔdɔrim a vigbete ɔ ntayɛni pɛjiu vi ãnɛkɔ au tẽẽriu Ɗa suru ɓa bim. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Ɓa Dauda kɔ gẽ kolaparɛ ɓa; ama au yuu shanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">&lt;&lt;Ɗalapa Uɓeyelapa gelin Uɓeyelapanɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">Ɔ̃ yɛm ang nakɨn<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />setɛ n pɔ̃ a shɔnopɔ̃yitɛ aa tɛlidɔɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />&lt;&lt;Aru nankɔ shɔ Israila kpai, i zɛkɛkɨn nɛ, Yesɔ gbete ai ɓau nalaam, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ gbete Ɗalapa pɔ̃rɛ nɛu ɔ̃ Uɓeyelapa a shɔ shɔraanɛni!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Naa shɔ nta vimtɛ, ɓai a sisɨn gbikiri-gbikiri ai geli Bituru a jashonɛ gãsiyini nɛ, &lt;&lt;Nshɔbiiyi u yɛ pɛlikɛpikoviya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Bituru geliyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Kopiya awɔ tete ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ɔ kɔsi sisɨn ɔ yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛtɔ, shɔu pɛlɔɔ Batizima a Yesɔ Kirisi nii, nɔ gbete Ɗalapa yɛ yasɔɔ ruuvini kɛkn; ɔ yɛ tɛ Ɗalapa vi ãnɛtɔ, Ɗa Suru. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Ɗalapa ruu mana ji awɔ yuukɔ a mɛjayini, a shɔ gbete i kpɛlɛni kpai, shɔ gbeteyi Uɓeyelapa u Ɗalapa ɓai nya anɛ u ɗɔbii kpai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Bituru gɔ̃yi yusho, a geliyi ruu fɛ̃ɛm; a gakiyi rɛ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ rawɔɔ yuutɔ a yukɔnɛ gbete kaanɛ jakɨntimiyiniǃ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Kɛɗɔn shɔzɛ waanɛ i ã sisɨnrɛ au ruuni, shɔ pɛliyi Batizima rɛ, a leeu shɔzɛ si mɛnɛ laa ziti atu kopi ɓa taati shɔ ɓasirɛ a kn shɔ gbeteyi gɨn Ɗalapa yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />I ã yuurɛ a vimatinɛ gbete Yesɔ jashonɛyi pɛliyɛni, ai shaa- vishaanɛ ji nyazɔɔ a Ɗa gakinɛni.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃nɛ Tete Shɔ A sisɨn Anɛ a Ɗa bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Ɗalapa shovi au jashonɛyi a pɛli vibizaanɛ a vitasinɛni waanɛ, kopiya nta kɛ seeti ama shɔ Ɗalapa ɓassinɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Shɔ gbeteyi ã sisɨn a Ɗa bi kpai yɛ ɗekɨn a vi pɛlinɛ a ɔ̃nɛ nyazɔɔni, kopiya vigbete u si a wuniyɛ a vɔsirɛ ɓɛzɔyini. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />I mɛliyi vinaa ai vɔsi saa rɛ a nyazɔɔ kpai, ji nɔgbete kopiya kasiyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Ko-pi lee gbete piya i kpaazɔɔ a wɛrɛ Ɗa a sisɨn gbete, i shaa vishaanɛ ji nyazɔɔ a wɛrɛ, i shaavi a sisɨn puru a sisɨn roonɛni, <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />i ɗɔ Ɗalapa bɛlinɛ, i kpai i nta sisɨn purutɔ ai pɛli vi tɔ̃vɨn tɔ nyazɔ. Ko-pi leepiya Ɗalapa n ti shɔ gbete shɔ raayiyɛtɔ u ɓassiyirɛ ai kɨn ni.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Bituru Gati Shɔ Vigakinɛ Dɔgbutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Si lewɔɔ Bituru a Yɔhanani i yɛ wɛrɛ Ɗa gakinɛ si gɨnɗadɔɔ ntatɛ taati a niti, a ɗagbete shɔ gaki Ɗa yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />A nyebawɛrɛ Ɗa gbete si shɔ ɓaanɛ nyabawɛrɛ Kɔrinɛ Yiriri, jawɔɔ siɗɔn sãnɛ au ɗaa yeenɛ siu dɔgbutu. Ko-pi leepiya shɔ tuliurɛ shɔ pɔ̃u a nyebawɛrɛ Ɗa nɛu gaki saa a shɔ gbete i to wɛrɛ Ɗau i naa. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Naa jaau zɛ Bituru tɛ a Yɔhanani i ɗɔ tonɛ, a gaki rɛ nɛi ãng viwɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />I tanɔɔ au bi, a Bituru shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Zɛu pɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Kɛɗɔn a kɨnnɔɔ rɛ ai bi, pɔ̃ sisɨn nɛmɛnɛn kpaa viwɔɔ ai naani. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Ama Bituru geliu nɛ,&lt;&lt;N saa ɓɛɛ ɓa a naani ɓa, ama n yɛn ã ɓɛɛjo vigbete n a wuniyɛ: a Yesɔ Kirisi shɔ Nazara nii n gelaatɛ yulapanɛ a rarɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Kɛɗɔn Bituru sãu a nakɨn a yusiu laparɛ. Tɛ̃ɛ̃ti jaau dɔɔ a nɔdɔni lakirɛ; <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />jau kɔbilapa nɛ̃ɛ̃ti a shi a dɔɔ, a gaa rakinɛrɛ ɗɔuni. Kɛɗɔn a to wɛrɛ Ɗa a yini, u ɗɔranɛ a bikɔlinɛ lapa-lapa a Ɗa bɛlinɛni. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Shɔ gbeteyi si ɗɔuni i zɛurɛ a ɗɔranɛ a Ɗa bɛlinɛni, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />naa i kpaa sisɨntɛ nɛ shɔmpɛ shɔvi gakinɛ gbete si ɔ̃li a nyeba wɛrɛ Ɗa yiririukɔ, i kpai bizaatɔ ayuu vigbete pɛli jaauyɛni.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bituru Nyanwanɛ a Wɛrɛ Ɗa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Aɗagbete jaau sã Bituru naa a Yɔhanani a Solomoni jaanyabawɛrɛ, ji nɔgbete shɔ ɓaayɛ, shɔwi bizaatɔ i yurɛ i yɛyi ɗɔbiirɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Naa Bituru zɛ shɔwitɛ, a geliyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;N shɔbii Israilayi, bizaawɔɔ piruvi a yuu vinniviya? aru ivi ɔ ɗɔ gbete ɔ kɨnnɔɔ au bi viya? Ɔ tɔnɛ mɛnɛ u pɛli vim au kaka ya ko tɔnɛ mɛnɛ au sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ atette Ɗa gɨnnɛ ukɔ pɔ̃rɛ jaam rakɨnya? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Ibirayi Ɗalapa, Ishayaku Ɗalapa, a Yakub Ɗalapa, u ɓeuruyi Ɗalapa, Ɗalapa ukɔ ã Yesɔ u jawɛrɛ basinɛrɛ. Ama ɔ tuurɛ ɔ ãu Yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi a naa nɛi nyoutɔ, ɔ bɛ̃unɔni a Bilatu ɗekɨn, piti nɔgbete Bilatu kasinɛn yaau naa wese nɛu yɛrɛni. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />U si wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ wɔsɔ̃n tɔ̃vɨn, ama ɔ bɛ̃unɔni, awɔ gaki Bilatu nɛu yasɔɔ shɔyuvɔnyɔnɛ naa. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Ɔ nyo shɔ gbete n ti surutɛ, ama Ɗalapa yusiutɛ a suruni, ukɔu ɔ̃rɛ shɔshinɛ knti a vimni. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Ji sisɨn-ãnɛ gbete shɛ a Yesɔ niikɔ ukɔ ã shɔ dɔgbutum kakarɛ. Vigbete ɔ zɛyɛ dɔdɔrim pɛlivishonɛ ji a sisɨn ãnɛ au niikɔ; ji sisɨn-ãnɛ gbete shɛ Yesɔ niikɔ, ukɔ pɔ̃ jaamrɛ gatirɛ, nɔ gbete ɔ kpai ɔ zɛɓang kɔ.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />&lt;&lt;N shɔbiiyi dɔdɔrim, n zɛ tɛttɔ vigbete ɔ pɛliyɛ awɔ yupɛ̃niyi ni a Yesɔ yuu ɓa ɔ zɛnɛni ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Ɗalapa shavim tɛttɔ kpai tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ au janyagadiyi nya nɛ Shɔshɔranɛ yɛ ɓoraatɔ; a pɛlirɛ nɛu ɔ̃ a nyabankɔ nizɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Ɔ kɔsi sisɨn ɔ yaa ruvini pɛlinɛtɔ, ɔ rinɔɔ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii, nɔgbete yɛ yasɔɔ ruuvini kɨn. Ɔkɛ pɛlinɛyɛ, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />yɛ dɔ̃sɔɔ Yesɔ sɔ̃ntɔ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Shɔshɔranɛ shɔ gbete lɔrɔɔ tɛttɔ tɛ̃ɛtɛ̃ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ Yesɔ yɛ ɔ̃ a kolapa anɛ ɗagbete shɔ sɔɔri vitɛ sɔɔ kpai, nagbete Ɗalapa sha au janyagadiyi wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ nya tɛ̃ɛtɛ̃ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Musa shanɛ, Uɓeyelapa ɔ Ɗalapa yɛ shoshɔɔ janyagaditɔ, yɛ lɔjo awɔ tetekɔ, ji nagbete shɔmɓakɔ. Ɔ gɨn vigbete yɛ gelɔɔtɔ kpai. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Shɔ gbeteu ji gɨn janyagadi wa vigbete shayɛ ɓa, shɔyɛ shɛshutɔ atette Ɗa jaayini shɔu lɛsiurɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />A janyagadiyi kpai gbeteyi sha Ɗa nyaruubiiyɛ yunɛ Samayila bi a shɔ gbeteyi au kɨntiyɛni, ikɔma i sha ji vigbete a ɗɔyɛnɛ leezɨnkɔ. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Ruu gbete Ɗalapa ma au janyagadiyi nya pɛ ɔ ɓɛɛkɔ, ɔkɔɔ yɛ shaa naa vigbete Ɗalapa ma a mɛuruyini jo. Nɔgbete geli Ibirayi nɛ, Ji aa ladurukɔ n yɛn tasi shɔ kootipiyi vɔɔ susãri a bi kpai. <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Aɗagbete Ɗalapa lɔu jawɛrɛ Yesɔ yɛ, a shoupɛ ji awɔ ɗɔbii ɗekɨn, aru u tasɔɔ vɔɔ susãri a bi kpai u pɔ̃ kopiya u yaa vikɔ̃linɛ pɛlinɛtɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Bituru a Yɔhanani a yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi ɗekɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Aɗagbete Bituru a Yɔhana ni sii ɗɔɔ nyanwanɛ a mooyini, shɔlansi wɛrɛ Ɗa a yupɛ̃ni wɛrɛ Ɗa ganɛ, a gãsi Sadukiyawayini i arɛ ai ɗɔbii. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />I sisɨn lɛsitɔ aruviya jashɔnɛ zitiwi i mati mooyi vi nɛ vɔrɔyi yɛ yutɛ a suruni, nagbete Yesɔ yuɓa a sàà a suruni yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Kɛɗɔn i sã Bituru rɛ a Yɔhanani i pɔ̃yirɛ a jaahm nɛ see dii ɓuru, aruviya si ɗaa yiitɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Ama shɔzɛ waanɛ gbeteyi nta ruum ayuu Yesɔ i ã sisɨntɔ ɗɔn; kɛɗɔn shɔ gbeteyi ãsisɨn a Ɗa bi i nomba shakɛ mɛnɛ laa ziti atu kopi ɓa maani.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />A dii ɓuru Yahudawayi yupɛ̃ni, a shɔpẽni dɔlayi a Shɔmala nya-ãsinɛyini i tolinya a Urushalima. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />I kpazɔɔ a yupɛ̃ni shɔlansi wɛrɛ Ɗa Anaasi a Kayafa ni, Yɔhana, Alezanda, a gãsi shɔ gbeteyi yeenɛ gbete a yupɛ̃ni shɔlansi wɛrɛ Ɗani. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />I pɔ̃ Bituru a Yɔhanani i shi ai ɗekɨn ai hɨyinɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔ pɛli vishonɛ a pi kaka piya? Ko ɔ shovi shonɛ a pi nii piya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Bituru shɔu si Ɗa Suruni rau bitɛ kpai, kasiyinya nɛ, mooyi yupɛ̃niyi a shɔpẽni dɔlayi: <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />ɔ ruu gbete ɔ hɨurɛm pɛ aru vitɔ̃vɨng gbete u pɛli shɔdɔgbutum ya? Awɔ kasi nɛi zɛ shɔ gbete gatiuyɛ ya? <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />Ɔ zɛtɔ kpai, a shɔ Israilayini, nɛ ja gbete shi awɔ ɗekɨn gatinɛ tɛpɛ-tɛpɛm ji a kaka gbete shɛ a Yesɔ Kirisi shɔ Nazara niikɔ gbete ɔ ɓau nalaayɛ, shɔ gbete Ɗalapa yusiu a sàà a suruniyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Yesɔ kɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ gbete Ɗa nyaruubii shanɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">&lt;&lt; tari gbete ɔ shɔ ɗɔmaanɛ ɔ bɛ̃ɛ̃ yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">ukɔ ritɛ tari gbete tɛɛ gãsiyi kpai a tɔ̃vɨn ni.<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Ukɔ raa shɔrɛ a ruuvini sheeli; aruviya nii wɔɓa a kootipini ɓa gbete Ɗalapa shoyɛ nɛu raurɛ ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Yupɛ̃niwi i zɛ nɔgbete Bituru a Yɔhanani i sharuu kakani ai ɗekɨn, i zɛrɛ i ji shɔ gbãgbã weze, i ji ɓalilaa ɓa tot, kɛɗɔn bi-zaaikɛtɔ. I shanɛ nɛi si pɛ Yesɔ jadɔɔyi. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Ama aru i zɛ jagbete Ɗalapa gatiuyɛ u ɗɔshinɛ a Bituru a Yɔhanani a ɗɔukɔ i vi pɛlinɛ si ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Kɛɗɔn i geli Bituru a Yɔhanani nɛi shɛnɛ jaa ruyeenɛuni, ai gaa ruu shalinɛkɛ ai nɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />I hɨnɛ&lt;&lt;U pɛli jaamiyi kɛpiviya? Kopiya a Urushalimayi kpai i zɛ tɛttɔ nɛ vibiizaanɛ pɛ̃nibam ikɔi pɛlirɛ, u yɛ mayisi nyaɓa ɗɔnɓa. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Ama aru u zãri ruum sãtinɛ a mooyi tete koɗɔpiya, ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u gɔ̃ jaamiyi yushotɔ ikɔi nwari shɔ nii Yesɔ nɛ toti.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />I ɓaa Bituru nya sɔ̃n a Yɔhanani a ɓuzɨn jaa i geliyi nɛ ikɔi nwari shɔ nyanɛ ko i mati shɔ vi a Yesɔ nii ni. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Ama Bituru a Yɔhanani i kasiyinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔkɔma ɔ yeruu pɛji tɔ̃vɨn awɔ yuu, shɔpi tɔ̃vɨn piya a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii, u gɨn Ɗalapa nya ya? ko u gɨn ɔ nya ya?. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />U yɛ zɛnɔɔ vi gbete u zɛyɛ au ntayɛ yaanɛ shanɛ dɔɔɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Akɨnti gbete yupɛ̃niwi gɔ̃yi yushotɛ fɛ̃ɛm kɛɗɔn i yaayi naarɛ i yɛrɛ. I zɛrɛ yɛ pɛliɓa i tasiyi raarɛ ɓa, aruviya si shɔ kpai i dooɗɔ Ɗalapa bɛlinɛ aru vigbete pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Jagbete shɔ pɛli vibiizaanɛ gatinɛm au biiyɛ si tɛɛ saa laa ziti au jaa kopitɛ.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ Sisɨn-ãnɛ Ɗa bi i Gaki Ɗa Aru i shovi-shonɛ Seti ntanɛ ɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Naa Bituru a Yɔhanani shɔ yainaatɛ tɛ̃ɛ̃ti, i sɔɔ i shɔbiiyi ɗɔbiirɛ ai geliyi vigbete shɔlansi wɛrɛ Ɗa a shɔpẽni dɔlayi shayɛ kpai. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Naa shɔ sisɨn-ãnɛ Ɗabii i ntatɛ, i kpai ɓasiyuu i gaki Ɗa rɛ: ai shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Mashɔwɛrɛ shɔ gbete shɛshi kolapa a kootipiniyɛ, a wapo a vi gbete a ɓuzɨn ni kpai!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />A nyaba Ɗa Suru a nwanya au ɓɛuru Dauda ni, a jawɛrɛ a shanɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">&lt;&lt; Shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa i lɛsi sisɨn kɛ aruviya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">kɛpiruvi nyakooyi lɛsi sisɨn waati viya?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Kpati kootipimiyi i mabii sɨtanɛ tɛttɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">a yupɛ̃niyi ni i ɓassiyutɛ nyazɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">a Uɓeyelapa yuu au Shɔshɔranɛni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Pɛ nizɛ Kpati Hiridu a Bilatu ni i ɓassiyurɛ, a shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa a komoom a shɔ Isirelayini a Yesɔ yuu i ɗɔ sɨntanɛ awuni, a jawɛrɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ gbete a pɔ̃rɛ nɛu ɔ̃ Shɔshɔranɛyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />i tolinyatɛ aru i pɛli vigbete a matɛ gboti yɛ pɛlitɔ, aa kaka aa kasinɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Dɔdɔrim, Uɓeyelapa, zɛ nɔgbete i kã nyaba gbete nɛi zãriu vishopɛ. A ã a fooyi kaka gbeteyi nwa a ruubii pɛ seti ntanɛni ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Gɨn naa nɛ a gati shɔvɔrɔyi rɛ, a pɛli vitasinɛ a vibiizaanɛni aa jawɛrɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ Yesɔ nii.<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Naa i yisi Ɗa gakinɛtɛ, kɛɗɔn ɗɔ gbeteyi tolinyayɛ si ɗɔ zɨtirɛ. Kɛɗɔn Ɗa Suru raayi birɛ kpai i gaa Ɗa nyaruubii nwanɛrɛ seetintanɛ ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ sisɨn Ãnɛ Ɗabii i Vɔsi i vinaayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Kn shɔsisɨn-ãnɛ a Ɗabii i sisɨnānɛ ɔ̃ gbete i vi shanɛ ɔ̃ gbete. Vigbete i a wuniyɛ shɔwɔɔ ji toɓanɛ vim pɛ nɛn ɓɛɛ ɓa, ama i vɔsi ko-iviya ji a nyazɔɔ kpai. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Jashonɛyi i geli shɔ ruum a kakani waanɛ i yɛ ɗekɨn a shinɛni a Yesɔ knti aru gbete yuu a sàà yɛ, Ɗalapa ntɛ̃riyi vɔɔ susãri a bi kpai. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Shɔ wɔɔ ji kã viwɔɔ ɓa ai tete niɓa. Shɔ gbeteyi ɗɔ aɗɔn ko wɛrɛ i mɛlirɛ i n ti saaurɛ, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />i pɔ̃rɛ a jashɔnɛyi ɗekɨn, a saa u shɔ vɔsirɛ kopiya ji nɔgbete kasiyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Yusufu Lawi ɓɛuru shɔ gbete shɔ yeeu a Sapuruyɛ, pɛli ji ɗɔkɔ shɔu jashonɛyi i ɓaunɛ Barnaba yɛ(ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ &lt;&lt;Shɔ gbete au masishɔbiiyɛ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Barnaba mɛli u ɗɔrɛ a n ti saa rɛ a jashonɛyi ɗekɨn.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Hananiya a Safaratu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Ama jawɔɔ siɗɔn u niinɛ Hananiya, a ɓeso Safaratu ni, i mɛli ɗɔrɛ jiyi ɓɛɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Ama a ɓesɔ kasini pɔ̃siu yuu saa u gãsirɛ, a tuu gãsi a n ti jashonɛyirɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Bituru geliu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Hananiya, a yaa japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ piruvi to a sisɨnrɛ a ɗakaarɛ aa yeli Ɗa Suru nya, aa ɓusi saa gãsi gbete a meli ɗɔyɛ viya? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />A ɓɛɛ ɗɔ mɛlinɛ, ɗɔu si jo a ɓɛɛkɔ A kɨnti gbete a mɛliyɛ, saau si jo a ɓɛɛkɔ. Pɛli piɗɔvi a nwa ruum aa sisɨn ɗɔkɔ viya? A ji ɗakiɓa jashɔzɛ ɓa, a ɗaki pɛ Ɗalapa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Naa Hananinya nta ruumtɛ nankɔ tɛ̃ɛ̃ti, a nwesirɛ a vɔrɛ; shɔ gbeteyi nta vim kpai seeti pɛli waanɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Jakasayi to ɓuzɨn rɛ, i liu birɛ a fãrã, i shɛshiu ɓilirɛ i gbãurɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Si gɨnɗadɔɔ tɛɛtɛ mɛnɛ taati, ɓeso torɛ ji zɛ vigbete aɗɔ yɛnɛ ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Bituru hɨ suu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Gelin pɛ, n ji saa gbete shɔ shorɔɔ sheeli aru ɗɔ gbete ɔ mɛliyɛ ya? Suu kasinya nɛ,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">&lt;&lt;Nn, ji saa u bi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Kɛɗɔn Bituru geli suunɛ, &lt;&lt;Aru ivi ɔ mɛvɔuni ɔ manya nɛi ɗaki Uɓeyelapa Suru viya? Wesho pɛ shɔ gbeteyi gbã mɛvɔuyɛ i doo a nyejaa dɔdɔrim, i yɛ tu atɔ i shɛsha ɓili ɗɔ gbãnɛ sɔnjo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Tɛ̃ɛ̃ti suu nwesirɛ au dɔɔ a vɔrɛ. A jakasayi torɛ i zɛrɛ suu vɔtɛ, ai tuurɛ i shɛshiu ɓili i gbãu a ɓɛvɔ kagɨn. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Shɔ gbeteyi gɨn Ɗa kpai a shɔ gãsiyi gbeteyi nta ruum piti seeti pɛliyitɔ.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jashonɛyi tasi Vibiizaanɛ waanɛ a Vitasinɛyini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Jashonɛyi i pɛli Vibiizaanɛyi waanɛ a shɔ ɗɔbii. Shɔ gbeteyi ãsisɨn a Ɗa bi kpai i tolinya a Solomon jaa nyabawɛrɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Shɔ gãsiyi kpai gbeteyi ji ãsisɨn ɓa Yesɔ biini ɓa i nta seeti i tete tonɛtɔ, ama mooyi yɛ ɗekɨn ɓɛɛgitɔ ai bassinɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Ama shɔzɛ waanɛ i yiiɓee jitɔ zori-zori, vɔshɔ a soroni kpai gbeteyi ãsisɨn a Uɓeyelapa biiyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Aru vigbete Yesɔ jashonɛ i pɛliyɛ, shɔvɔriyi waanɛ shɔ n-tirɛ a nyaba-nyaba, a shɔwɔyi shɔ yɔi a laroonɛ nyaba, a siriyi, nɛ nɗa Bituru kɛ tɛɛnɛ u jasuru u ɗii gãsiyi birɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Shɔzɛ waanɛ i tolinyarɛ i shɛ a tipi gbete kɨnti Urushalima a teteyɛ, i n ti shɔvɔrɔyi a shɔ gbete rãma sãitɔyɛ; ai gatirɛ kpai.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ Jashonɛyi Ɓoraa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Kɛɗɔn yupɛ̃ni shɔlansi a wɛrɛ Ɗa a shɔ gbeteyi wuni nyazɔɔyɛ, a shɔ gbeteyi a ɓuzɨn Sadukiyawayini, i kaa gɨnn a Yesɔ jashonɛyini fɛ̃ɛm, kɛɗɔn i maruurɛ nɛi pɛli viwɔ au yuuni. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />I sã Yesɔ jashonɛyirɛ i pɔ̃yi a jahm gbete shɔ mashɔ aɗɔn kpaiyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Ama a leukɔ a zɨmba Ɗajashonɛlapa arɛ a ɓeli nyejaahmrɛ, a yaa Yesɔ jashonɛyi naarɛ i shɛ ɓilirɛ, a geliyi nɛ, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />&lt;&lt;Ɔ yɛnɛ ɔ shi a wɛrɛ Ɗa, ɔ geli shɔ ruu ayuu suru sɔɔm.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Yesɔ jashonɛyi gɨnyaurɛ, a gadi zɨɨkɔ i to wɛrɛ Ɗarɛ ai gaa shɔ vi matinɛrɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Yupɛ̃ni wɛrɛ Ɗa a shɔ gbeteyi wuniyɛ i ɓaa Yahudawayi shɔpẽni dɔlayi nya kpai aru ɔ̃nɛ pɛ̃niba au jadɔlaayini; I shonyarɛ a jahm nɛ shɔ n ti Yesɔ jashonɛyi arɛ ai ɗekɨn. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Ama naa yupɛ̃ni wɛrɛ Ɗa ganɛyi atɛ, i ji kpaa Yesɔ jashonɛyi ɓa a jahmni ɓa, kɛɗɔn i sɔɔrɛ i geli yupɛ̃niyi nɛ, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />&lt;&lt;U kpaa nyejaahmwu ɓaanɛ shɔnyejaa ganɛyi i si ji ɗɔ nyejaa ganɛ kpai, ama naa u ɓeli nyejaatɛ u ji kpai shɔ wɔɔ ɓa a ɓuzɨn niɓa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Naa shɔlansi wɛrɛ Ɗa a yupɛ̃ni wɛrɛ Ɗa ganɛ i nta vimtɛ, i kã a sisɨn kpai i ji zɛ vigbete pɛli Yesɔ jashonɛyi ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Kɛɗɔn jawɔɔ torɛ a geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ weshopɛ! shɔ gbete ɔ mayiyɛ a jahm i a ɗɔ gbete i mati shɔvi a wɛrɛ Ɗa-yɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Kɛɗɔn yupɛ̃ni wɛrɛ Ɗa ganɛ au shɔ wɛrɛ Ɗa ganɛyini i yɛrɛ a sɔɔri Yesɔ jashonɛyirɛ. I ji tasiyi kaka ɓa, aru i nta seti shɔzɛ nɛi yɛ loriirɛ a tari. <verse eid="ACT 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />I n ti Yesɔ jashonɛyirɛ i pɔ̃rɛ i shi yupɛ̃niyi ɗekɨn, a yupɛ̃ni shɔlansi wɛrɛ Ɗa hɨu ruu, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;U ãsɔɔ-nya tɛttɔ nɛ, ɔkɔɔ mati shɔvinɛ toti a jaam nii ni, ama ɔ zɛ vigbete ɔ pɛliyɛ pɛ! Ɔ vimatinɛ raa Urushalimatɛ kpai, ɔ kasinɛ shɔu tɔnɛ ukɔu nyo jaam vɔrɔrɛ ya!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Bituru a Yesɔ jashonɛ gãsiyi i kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u gɨn Ɗalapa nya, ɓa jashozɛ ɓɛɛ ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />U ɓɛuruyi Ɗalapa ukɔ yusi Yesɔ rɛ a suruni, a knti gbete ɔ nyou vɔrɔ a nyaba naa ɓaanɛ a laa. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Ɗalapa basiurɛ au ka nakɨn ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ yupɛ̃ni a shɔshɔraanɛ, Ɗalapa pɛli vim aru u pɔ̃siunaa shɔ Israilayi u kɔsi sisɨn shɔu yasiyi ruuvinitɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Ukɔu ɔ̃rɛ shɔshinɛ knti ayuu vimni, a Ɗa Suruni, gbete Ɗalapa ã shɔ gbeteyi wesho au nyayɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Naa yupɛ̃niyi nta vimtɛ, i lɛsi sisɨn fɛ̃ɛm, i kã nɛi nyo Yesɔ jashonɛyitɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Ama shɔzɛ gbete ai tete u si shɔ Farisiya u niinɛ Gamaliyel, u si Shɔmala nya-ãsinɛ Musa, a shɔ bassiutɔ fɛ̃ɛm, yulaparɛ a yupɛ̃niyi ɗekɨn, pɔ̃rɛ nɛ shɔu shɛshi Yesɔ jashonɛyi pɛ ɓili, <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />kɛɗɔn geli yupɛ̃niyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;N shɔbii Israilayi, ɔ kɔyuutɔ a vigbete ɔ kasi jamiyi pɛlinɛyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ jawɔɔ u niinɛ Tiyoda shɛrɛ a saa gbete tɛɛ a knti, risiuyuu pɛ̃niba, shɔ vɔshɔyi mɛnɛ laa bmati i gɨurɛ. Ama shɔ nyourɛ, u shɔ gɨnnɛyi kpai shɔ sãtiyirɛ, i ji zɛnɔɔ viwɔɔ pɛlinɛ tɔɓa. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Au kɨnti ni, sikɛ jawɔɔ u niinɛ Yahuda shɔ Galili shɛ sɔ̃njirɛ a ɗagbete shɔ ga shɔ yɛ; a pɔ̃ mooyi i gɨurɛ, ukɔma shɔ nyourɛ, au shɔ gɨnnɛyi kpai i sãtirɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Aru gbetenkɔ n gelɔɔtɛ, ɔkɔɔ pɛli jaamiyi viwɔɔ nɛ. Ɔ yainɛ! Naa i vigbete i mayɛ ai vipɛlinɛni kɛ ɔ̃nɛ jashɔzɛ ɓɛɛ yɛ sɔ̃nyatɔ, <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />ama kɛ ɔ̃nɛ Ɗalapa ɓɛɛ, ɔ yɛ zãriyi dɔɔɓa. Ɔ yɛ kpaa ɔ yuu a ɗɔɔ bawaanɛ a Ɗalapani!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Yupɛ̃niwi i gɨn Gamaliyel nyarɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />I ɓaa Yesɔ jashonɛyi nyarɛ a ɓuzɨn jaa, ai wayirɛ, kɛdɔn i kɔsiyinyarɛ nɛi ikɔyi nwari shɔ nyanɛ toti aru Yesɔ nii; kɛɗɔn i yai naarɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Yesɔ jashonɛyi yurɛ a yupɛ̃niyi ɗekɨn ni i nta sisɨn puru, aru nɛ Ɗalapa basiyi pɛtɔ a yairɛ nɛi ɓoo yusẽ aru Yesɔ nii. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Ko-pi leepiya, a wɛrɛ Ɗa ko a shɔ wɛrɛ i yɛ ɗekɨn a shɔ vimatinɛ a nyawaanɛni aru tɔ̃vɨn ayuu Yesɔ Shɔshɔranɛ nii.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s1">Shɔ Lɔɔ Shɔnaapɔ̃sinɛ Maangzii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />A ɗauni, naa Yesɔ jadɔɔyi aɗɔ ɗekɨn yɛnɛ a shanɛni, gãsi Yahudawa gbeteyi nta nya Helenawa a Yahudawa gbeteyi ntanya Aramaya yɛ nya yurɛ ai tetteni. Yahudawa gbeteyi ntanya Helena yɛ i shanɛ shɔ vɔsi saa ko-pi leepiya nɛ shɔ kɔi suvɔ gbete ai tete ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ jashonɛyi kopi atu ziti i ɓaa kn shɔ gbeteyi ã sisɨn Ɗabii nya a ɗɔzɔɔ kpai ai shanɛ, &lt;&lt; Ji kɔriɓa u yaa Ɗa nyaruubii nwanɛ aru nɛu vɔsi suvɔyi vishaanɛ a saa ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Aru nankɔ mazɔ̃yi, ɔ lɔɔ shɔzɛ maanzii awɔ tete gbete shɔ zɛi tɛttɔ nɛ Ɗa Suru raayi bitɛ kpai ai sẽrẽni aɗɔn, u yɛ pɔ̃yirɛ i pɛliu vishɔnɛmrɛ. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />U ɔkɔma u ãu sisɨn kɛ a ɗɔɔ Ɗa gakinɛ a vishonɛ Ɗa nyaruubii nwanɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗa biyi i kpai i kasinyarɛ a vigbete Yesɔ jashonɛ shayɛni, kɛɗɔn i lɔɔ Istifanu rɛ jagbete u a Ɗa Suruni a sisɨn-ãnɛni, a Filibu a porokoru, a Nikanɔ, a Timon, a Barimina, a Nikɔla shɔ Antiya, shɔ gbete u ɓa Yahudawa ɓa ama to Yahudawayi ɗa gɨnnɛ ji gadi. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Shɔ n-tiyirɛ a Yesɔ jashonɛyi ɗekɨn, a Yesɔ jashonɛyi gakiyi Ɗarɛ a pɔ̃siyinaa rɛ ayuu ko shɔpiya. <verse eid="ACT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗa nyaruubii raaɗɔ yɛ ɗekɨnɗekɨn. Yesɔ jadɔɔyi a Urushalima shɛkɛ waanɛ-waanɛ, a shɔlansiyi a wɛrɛ Ɗa waanɛ i tɛ sisɨn ãnɛnrɛ.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ Sã Istifanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Istifanu, jaau Ɗa tasiu vɔɔ susãri tɛttɔ abi fɛ̃ɛm a kakani waanɛ, pɛli vibiizaanɛyitɔ pɛ̃niba a vitasinɛyini a shɔ ɗɔbii. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Ama shɔwɔyi i masinya a Istifanu ni i si shɔ Yahudawayi kn ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛkɔ gbete shɔ ɓainɛ shɔ gbeteyi ranaatɛyɛ, i pɛ Yahudawayi ai shɛ a Sariya a Alezandariya, wɔsɔ̃n a tipi Silikiya a tipi Asiya. i tonya masinɛ a Istifanu ni. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Ama Ɗa Suru ã Istifanu sẽrẽ gbete yɛ nwanya ai risiunya dɔɔɓa. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Kɛɗɔn i woo shɔ gãsiyi nɛyi shanɛ &lt;&lt;U ntarɛ kɛ dã Musa nɛ a Ɗalapa ni! <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />A nyabankɔ i sɨnrɛ mooyi sisɨn durɛ, a yupɛ̃ni dɔlaayi a shɔmala nya-ãsinɛ Musani. I sã Istifanu rɛ i n-tiu yupɛ̃niyi ɗekɨn. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Kɛɗɔn i n ti shɔwɔyirɛ nɛi yeeriu nya ayuu. I shanɛ&lt;&lt;Jaamkɔ, shali vikɔ̃linɛ lee-lee aru u wɛrɛ Ɗa wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ a Musa nya-ãsinɛni. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />U ntarɛ kɛ shanɛ Yesɔ shɔ Nazara yɛ zɨli wɛrɛ Ɗam a tipi u kɔsiu nakoo gbete Musa yasiuyɛ kpai!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Shɔ gbeteyi si ɗɔ,ɔ̃nɛ a yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi ɗɔruyeenɛ kpai i ntẽẽri Istifanu nɔɔ bi i zɛu nɔkɨn ɔ̃ naa Ɗajashonɛlapa ɓɛɛ.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s1">Istifanu Nyanwanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Kɛɗɔn yupɛ̃ni shɔlansi a wɛrɛ Ɗa hɨ Istifanu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Vim nizɛ ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Istifanu kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Mazɔ̃yi a Mayeyi, ɔ weshɔpɛ ang nya! U ɓɛuru Ibirayi ɓɛɛ yɛnɛ nɛn ɔ̃ a tipi Haranyɛ, Ɗalapa gbete u bassinɛ aɗɔn shɛ au bi a Mesopotamiya, <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />a geliu nɛ, &lt;Yaa a shɔwɛrɛyinɛ aa tipi yeenɛni a yɛ tipi gbete n yɛn tasaa yɛ.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Kɛɗɔn Ibirayi yau tipirɛ a yɛrɛ a ɔ̃ Haran. Akɨnti gbete Ibirayi ɓeye vɔyɛ, Ɗalapa n-tiu tipirɛ gbete ɔ ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ aɗɔn dɔdɔrim yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Ɗalapa ji ã Ibirayi tipi kawɔɔ ɓa nɛu ɓɛɛ ɓa, ko dɔɔ naa nɛ gbete ɓa. Ama Ɗalapa marɛ nɛn ãu tipiutɔ au laduruyini. A ɗagbete Ɗalapa marumyɛ, Ibirayi jaa siɓa. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Shompɛ vigbete Ɗalapa geliuyɛ&lt;A laduru i yɛ ɔ̃ a tipi ɓili, shɔ tipiwi i yɛ risɔɔ foo, i yɛ tasɔɔ raa waanɛ saa laa mbati. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Ama nkɔng Ɗalapa n yɛn tasi shɔ gbete ai yɛ ɔ̃ foo ai dɔɔ yɛ raatɔ, kɛɗɔn akɨntini Ibirayi laduruyi yɛ sharɛ a tipiuni i bassi Ɗalapa a ɗɔukɔ.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗalapa ãsi Ibirayi nyanɛ ko-pi javɔshɔ gbete pi au wɛrɛ kpai shɔu yeeriyi shaatɔ, u ɔ̃kɛ vitasinɛ ruumanɛ gbete i mayɛ. A Ibirayi yeeri Ishayaku shaarɛ a dii maantaa a shɔ yeeuyɛ; Ishayaku yeeri ɓɛɛ javɔshɔ Yakubu sɔ̃njorɛ, Yakubu yeeriu ɓɛɛ javɔshɔ kopi atu ziti sɔ̃njirɛ, ikɔi ɔ̃kɛ uɓeyeyi kopi atu ziti shɔ Israila.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Yakubu jaayi i kaagɨn a ɓɛzɔ̃ Yusufuni i mɛliurɛ a shɔ Masar i naa nɛu ɔ̃kɛ i foo. Ama Ɗalapa u si awuni, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />a shɛshi Yusufu rɛ au raa gbete si ɓooyɛni kpai, a kpati Firauna ɗekɨn a Masar Ɗalapa pɔ̃rɛ nɛu kpaa u ɔ̃ a shɔ ɗekɨn tɔ̃vɨn a sɛ̃rɛ̃ni. Kpati Firauna pɔ̃rɛ Yusufu ɔ̃kɛ Gɔmna a tipi Masar a yupɛ̃ni au yɛti wɛrɛni kpai. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Kɛɗɔn vaanwɔ shɛrɛ a Masar a kaana ni, gbete n ti shɔ raaɓoonɛ waanɛ. U ɓɛuruyi i ji kpaa vishaanɛ wɔɔ ɓa, <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />naa Yakubu ntatɛ nɛ nɔvisha a Masarni, a sho ɓɛɛ jaayi, u ɓɛuruyi, shomkɔ ɔ̃rɛ i zati gbete i gaa yɛnɛ a Masar nɛi woo vishaanɛyɛ . <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Naayi pɛsi ɗɔu yɛnɛtɛ Yusufu tasiu yuu a ɓɛzɔ̃yi ɗekɨn, kɛ ɗɔukɔ kpati Masar arɛ a zɛ Yusufu shɔwɛrɛyi kɛkn. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Kɛɗɔn Yusufu shoshi ɓeye Yakubu nyarɛ, geliurɛ au shɔwɛrɛyini kpai, shɔzɛ kpai laa taati au jaa kopi atu maani nɛi a Masar. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Kɛɗɔn Yakubu yɛ Masar rɛ, a ɗɔwakɔ i vɔlirɛ a ɓɛɛ jaayini. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Shɔ sii vɔrɔ shɔ sɔriyi Shɛɛkɛm, shɔ gbã a yusàà gbete Ibirayi woo a saa azurfa a Hamo ɓɛɛ jaayi naa a Shɛɛkɛm. <verse eid="ACT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Naa ɗaa atɛ ɗɔɔli aru Ɗalapa u pɛli vigbete masi a Ibirayi ni, siu shɔbiiyi shatɛ a Masar waanɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Kɛɗɔn kpati wɔɔ gbete ji zɛ viwɔɔ ɓa a Yusufu yuuni ɓa ukɔ roo kpatirɛ a Masarni. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Kpatiu ɗaki u ɓɛuruyitɔ, a tasi raatɔ, pɔ̃irɛ i loriyi jabɛ̃rɛ̃tirɛ, aru nɛi vɔlikɛtɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Shɔ yee Musa ji ɗaamkɔ, u si jaa tɔ̃vɨn a Ɗalapa ɗɔbiini, shɔ bàu a ɓeye wɛrɛ shɛllɛ taati. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Naa shɔ tuu Musatɛ shɔ pɔ̃utɛ a nyaɓooti, kpati ɓɛɛ jaa soro tuurɛ a basiurɛ naa ɓɛɛ jaa, <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Shɔ mati Musa Masaryi sẽrẽẽ kpai, a ɔ̃kɛ shɔ nyanwanɛ pɛ̃niba a vishonɛni. <verse eid="ACT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Naa Musa saa yɛtɛ laa ziti, a kã yɛnɛ nɛn zɛ ɓɛshɔbiiyi Israila i ɔ̃nɛ pɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />A zɛ shɔ Masar wɔɔ u ɗɔ gbete kuli u shɔbii wɔɔ nɔɔ, kɛɗɔn Musa yɛrɛ nɛn pɔ̃si Israilayi naa a kɔsinɔɔ a shɔ Masar vɔrɔ nyonɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />(Musa tuunɛ mɛnɛ u shɔbii i yɛ zɛtɔ nɛ Ɗalapa yɛ pɛli vishonɛ a nkɔ aru u rairɛ, ama i ji zɛ ɓa.) <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />A dii ɓuru zɛ shɔ Isirelayi ziti i ɗɔɔ bawaanɛ, a kasinɛn vɔsiyi bautɔ, A shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ weshopɛ mazɔ̃yi, ɔ pɛ n shɔbii Isirelayi; Ɔ waaba aruviya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Ama shɔu waa ɓɛzɔ̃u dɔ̃ Musa kagbete, a hɨnɛ, &lt;&lt;Pi pɔ̃ a yupɛ̃ni pi a yeeruu au yuu piya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />&lt;&lt;A kasin nyonɛ nagbete a nyo shɔ Masar wɔɔ a si ɓuruyɛ ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Naa Musa nta vimtɛ naam, a yurɛ a yɛkɛ tipi Madiyana, a ɗɔukɔ a yee javɔshɔ ziti. <verse eid="ACT 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Akɨnti saa laa ziti, Ɗajashonɛlapa shɛ a Musa bi a yeenya yaa a ɗɔ gbete laa ɓa ɗɔmbayɛ ɗɔɔli a kɔpɔ Sinayini. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Naa Musa zɛ vimtɛ bizautɔ aru vigbete zɛyɛni, a yɛ ɗɔɔli nɛn zɛ viupɛ. Ama nta Uɓeyelapa yeenya shanɛ: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />&lt;&lt;Nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ meuruyi Ɗalapa, Ibirayi Ɗalapa, Ishayaku, a Yakubuni.&gt;&gt; Kɛɗɔn Musa bi gaa zaanɛrɛ, ji kpaa kara zɛnɛ tɔɓa. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Uɓeyelapa geliu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Zɔ̃ kɔdɔɔtɔ, aru ɗɔ gbete a shiɗɔnmi pɛ ɗɔ Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />N zɛ nɔgbete shɔ tasi mashɔzɛyi raa a Masartɛ. N ntayi nyavɔtɛ, n nɔrɛ n raipɛ. Anɛ dɔdɔrim; n yɛn sho a, a Masar.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />Shɔ Israila i bɛ̃ɛ si jo Musa kɔ. I hɨnɛ &lt;&lt;Pi pɔ̃ arɛ a ɔ̃ yupɛ̃ni aru a yeeruu au yuu piya?&gt;&gt; Ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ gbete Ɗalapa shourɛ nɛu ɔ̃ri u shɔbiiyi yupɛ̃ni, a nyaba Ɗajashonɛlapa u raayitɔ gbete tasiu yuu a shɛ au bi a yaa shaanɛ a ɗɔ gbete shɔ ɓa ɗɔmba yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Ukɔ shɛshi shɔrɛ a tipi Masarni, a ɗɔu pɛli vibiizaanɛ a vitasinɛni a Masar a ɓooti nweri, saa laa ziti a ɗɔ gbete laa ɓa ɗɔmɓayɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Musa kɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ gbete geli shɔ Israilayi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɗalapa yɛ shoshɔɔ janyagaditɔ ji naa au shonɛyɛ, a janyagadiu yɛ ɔ̃ ji shɔzɛ gbete awɔ tete shɔbiiyikɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Ukɔu si ji a shɔ Israilayini aɗagbete i tolinya a ɗɔgbete laa ɓa ɗɔn bang ɓayɛ; u si ji ɗɔukɔ au ɓɛuruyi a Ɗajashɔnɛlapani shɔ gbete nwanya awuni a kɔpɔ Sinayi, ukɔ tɛ Ɗa nyaruubii au ã suruyɛ, a geliurɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Ama u ɓɛuruyi i bɛ̃u nyagɨnnɛtɔ; i bɛ̃ɛ̃yi a nɔɔni, ai sisɨn i kasinɛi si sɔɔ Masar. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />I geli Haruna nɛ,&lt;&lt;Pɛliu jaɗa fɛ̃ɛyi pɛ gbeteyi yɛ tɛɛsiu ɗekɨn yɛ. U ji zɛ vi gbete pɛli Musa yɛ ɓa, shɔ gbete au shɛshiu a Masaryɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Kɛɗɔn i pɛli viwɔɔrɛ naa jagunapu, i ãu viyuu ãnɛrɛ, ai tɔ̃soo i sásàrɛ aru i bassi vigbete i pɛli ai yuuyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Ama Ɗalapa risiyi kntirɛ, a ãyi naarɛ nɛi gɨn sɛyi a kolapa, ji nagbete shɔ bee a laabeenɛ janyagadiyi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">Ɔ shɔ Israila!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">ɔ ji yeerin vivaayi ji ɓa ɔ ji ãng viyuu ãnɛyɛ ji ɓa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">a saa laa ziti a ɗɔ gbete laa ɓa ɗɔn bang ɓayɛ.<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Ɔ tuu taali jaɗa molɛk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">a sɛ jaɗa jasuru shɔ ɓaanɛ Refan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">ikɔyi ɔ̃rɛ jaɗa gbete ɔ pɛliyɛ nɛi basiyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Aru gbetenkɔ n yɛn ãwɔ naa ɔ tɛɛ tipi Babila tɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />Aɗagbete u ɓɛuruyi si a ɗɔgbete laa ɓa ɗɔn bang ɓayɛ, i si a taali gbete Ɗalapa suru a ɓuzɨn ni. Shɔmkɔ ɔ̃rɛ taali shɔ gbete Ɗalapa geli Musa nɛu pɛliyɛ, shɔ pɛli ji nagbete Ɗalapa tasi Musa nɛu pɛliyɛkɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Kɛ au kɨnti ni u ɓɛuruyi i tɛ taalim ai ɓɛuru-ɓɛuruyi naa. i n ti tipim a ɗa gbete Joshuwa si yupɛ̃ni yɛ, naa i raa tipiutɛ a moo gbete Ɗalapa pɔ̃rɛ nɛi yaa tipiu i naani, kɛɗɔn shɔ Israila i ɔ̃ a ɗɔukɔ yɛnɛ ɗagbete Dauda roo kpati yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Ɗalapa nta tɔ̃vɨntɔ a Dauda ni, a gaki Ɗalapa nɛu yang pɛ nɛn maa ɗɔ gbete Yakubu Ɗalapa yɛ ɔ̃ ɗɔnyɛ pɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Ama Sulɛmanu ukɔ maari Ɗalapa wɛrɛu rɛ.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Ama Ɗalapa shɔ gbete vitɛu kaka ɓa rooɓa a wɛrɛ gbete shɔzɛ maayɛni ɓa; ji nagbete janyagadiyi shayɛ:<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />Uɓeyelapa shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Kolapa ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ n la,ɔ̃nɛ kpati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">a kootipi ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ n ɗɔɔ dɔɔpɔ̃nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Ɔ maarin kɛpi zɔng wɛrɛ shɔpiya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Ɗɔ gbete n yɛn ɔ̃ a ɓuzɨn kɛpiya?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Ɓang nkɔ pɛli vimrɛ kpai ɓaya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Istifanu yɛ ɗekɨn a shaanɛni nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔ shɔ yuu lakinɛ, a shɔ sisɨn lakinɛyi, ɔ shɔ gbeteyi nɔɔ shootɛ aru Ɗa nyaruubiini, nɔ gbete mɛuruyi pɛliyɛ ɔ ji nankɔ, ko-pi leepiya ɔ ɓɛ̃ɛ̃ Ɗa Suru nyagɨnnɛtɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Janyagadi wɔɔ pɛ a ɗɔnni gbete a mɛuruyi i ji tasiu raa ɓaya? I nyo Ɗalapa jashonɛyi, shɔ gbeteyi si tɛ̃ɛtɛ̃ɛ i sharuu jawɛrɛ tɔ̃vɨn anɛyɛ, dɔdɔrim ɔ mɛliutɛ ɔ nyou vɔrɔtɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Ɔkɔɔ tɛ Ɗalapa nya-ãsinɛjo a Ɗajashonɛlapayi naa, ama ɔ ji gɨn ɓa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ Lori Istifanu A Tari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Naa Yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi nta vigbete Istifanu shayɛtɛ, i sisɨn lɛsi fɛ̃ɛm, i shaa ntari shɛtɛ̃tɛ̃ aru sisɨn lɛsinɛni. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Ama Istifanu shɔ gbete Ɗa Suru rau bitɛ kpai, kɨnnɔɔ a kolapa a zɛ Ɗalapa bassinɛ a zɛ Yesɔ a ɗɔshinɛ a Ɗalapa ka nakɨn. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />A shanɛ.&lt;&lt;Kɨnnɔɔ pɛ, n zɛ kolapa ɓelitɛ, a Shɔzɛja u ɗɔshinɛ a Ɗalapa ka nakɨn!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />A kakani yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi nɔɔ shoorɛ ai naa. Kɛɗɔn i kpai i yɛu ɗɔbii gbãgbã nɔgbete, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />i shɛshiu a komoowuni yɛnɛ ɓili, ai loriu a tari. Shɔ shinɛkɨntiyi yai fãrã a jakasa wɔɔ ɗɔbii u niinɛ Shawulu. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />I ɗɔ ɗekɨn yɛnɛ a Istifanu lorinɛ a tari, Istifanu u ɓɛjo ɗɔ gbete gaki Uɓeyelapa a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ, tɛn surunɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />A ta a yugboti, a ɗee yeenya a kakani a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa mɔkɔ kpaa sisɨn nɛ ai yuu ruuvini ni.&gt;&gt;Naa shatɛ naam a vɔrɛ.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Shawulu pɔ̃naatɔ nɛ shɔu nyo Istifanu rɛ.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 8:1">Shawulu Tasi Shɔ Ɗa Gɨnnɛyi Raa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">A leukɔ shɔ gaa shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi ratasinɛrɛ fɛ̃ɛm a Urushalima ama yajo Yesɔ jashonɛyi kɔ sheeli; a shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi kpai i sãtirɛ a yɛti tipi Yahudiyani a Samariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Shɔ gbeteyi ã sisɨn a Ɗabii i gbã Istifanu rɛ i ɔ̃ mɔɔvɔ fɛ̃ɛm au yuu. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Ama Shawulu kãnɛn tasi shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi raatɔ fɛ̃ɛm; yɛli wɛrɛ-wɛrɛ u ɗɔ gbete gɔ̃ki vɔshɔ a soroni, a lori a jaahm.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filibu Nwari Shɔ Ɗa nyaruubii a Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a Ɗabii gbete shɔ nyiki a Urushalima i sãtirɛ kopiɗɔpiya, i ɗɔ gbete i nwaruu tɔ̃vɨnyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filibu yɛ komoo Samariya, u ɗɔgbete nwari shɔ ruu Shɔshɔraanɛ a ɗɔukɔ. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Mooyi ɔ̃ a Filibu ni ɗɔɔli a ɗɔɔ showenɛ a vigbete shayɛ, aɗagbete si ɗɔgbete i weshoyɛ i zɛ vibiizaanɛ au pɛliyɛtɔ. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Suru kɔ̃linɛ i shɛki a shɔbii fɛ̃ɛm i ɗɔɔ sɨnɛ a kakani, a shɔ gati shɔ gbeteyi bivɔ kagbeteyɛ a shɔ dɔgbutuyini kpai. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Aru nankɔ a komoo wakɔ shɔ nta yɛti puru fɛ̃ɛm.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Jawɔɔ siɗɔn u niinɛ Siman, shɔ gbete a lewɔɔ tasi Samariyayi vibiizaanɛ a gãn nɔkunɛ. Tasi yuu nɛn pɛ shɔ pɛ̃niba. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Kopiya a komoouni shɔpẽni a jajjayini i ã yuu ji au bikɔ, i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Jaam pɛ Ɗalapa kaka, gbete shɔ ɓaanɛ, &lt;Kaka Pɛ̃niba. &gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />I weshotɔ au nyani aruviya ɔ̃ tɛttɔ tɛ̃ɛtɛ̃ɛ u ɗɔ gbete tasiyi vibiizaanɛ nɔkunɛ u gãn yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Ama naa i ã sisɨn tɛ a ruu tɔ̃vɨn gbete Filibu shayɛni aru Ɗa Kpati roonɛ, wɔsɔ̃n Yesɔ Kirisi nii, shɔ pɛliyi Batizima rɛ vɔshɔ a soroni. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Siman au yuu ã sisɨn sɔ̃njorɛ; Akɨntini shɔ pɛliu Batizima rɛ, a rɛbii a Filibu ni ɗɔɔli, naa zɛ vinɔlusinɛtɛ a vibiizaanɛ pɛ̃niba gbete Filibu pɛliyɛtɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Naa jashonɛ gbeteyi Urushalima i ntatɛ nɛ Samariyayi tɛ Ɗa nyaruubiitɛ, i shokɛ Bituru a Yɔhanani ai ɗɔbii. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Naa i totɛ, i gaki shɔ sisɨn Ɗabii i Ɗa rɛ, aru i tɛ Ɗa Suru. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Aru Ɗa Suru si ji nɔɔpɛ ɓa ai biini ɓa, ko a shɔzɛ gbete bi atete ni ɓa; shɔ pɛliyi ɓɛjo Batizima kɔ sheeli a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ nii. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Kɛɗɔn Bituru a Yɔhanani i pɔ̃siyi naarɛ a bi, ai tɛ Ɗa Sururɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Siman zɛrɛ shɔ ã shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a Ɗabii Suru a nyaba gbete jashonɛyi pɔ̃siyinaayɛ. Kɛɗɔn a ã Bituru a Yɔhana saa rɛ, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔ ãng kakan jo, nɔgbete nkɛ pɔ̃si kopiya naa nɛ bi nɗau tɛ Ɗa Suru jo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Ama Bituru kasiunya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Mɛnɛ mɔkɔ aa saani ɔ tokɔɔ yaa, aru a pɔ̃ a sisɨn nɛn yɛ woo Ɗalapa vi-ãnɛ a saa! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Viwɔɔ ji ɓasaa ɓa au vishonɛni ɓa, aruviya a sisɨn ɓa tɔ̃vɨn a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn ni ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />A kɔsi sisɨn yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛ, a gaki Uɓeyelapa wɔɔɓa yɛ yasaa ruuvinitɔ ayuu vigbete a pɔ̃ sisɨn aɗɔnyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />N zɛtɛ a sisɨn gɨnkaanɛ gɔlɔrɔ aɗɔn, ruuvini maatɛ katakata naa shɔ jaahm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Siman geli Bituru a Yɔhanani nɛ,&lt;&lt;Sɔkɔ ɔ gaki Uɓeyelapa pɛ ang yuu, aru vigbete ɔ sham ukɔu kpang-nɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Akɨnti gbete Bituru a Yɔhanani i nwari shɔ nyatɛ ayuu Uɓeyelapa ruubii, Kɛɗɔn Bituru a Yɔhanani i sɔɔkɛ Urushalima. Ai nyaba sɔɔnɛ i nwari shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨntɔ a jakomɔɔ waanɛ gbeteyi a Samariya yɛ.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filibu A Yupɛ̃ni Itopiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Uɓeyelapa Ɗajashonɛlapa geli Filibu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Yunɛ a rinɔɔ a ka nakɨn a sɔɔ nyaba gbete au shɛ a Urushlima yɛnɛ Gaza yɛ.&gt;&gt;(Nyabam shɔ shovi tɔkɨn awuni leezin niɓa.) <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Kɛɗɔn Filibu yulaparɛ a yɛrɛ, a knɔɔ a zɛ yupɛ̃ni wɔɔ shɔ gbete shɛ a ɗɔ gbete shɔ ɓaanɛ Itopiya, u si shɔ tɔ̃vɨn pɛ̃niba ukɔ sãri Su Kpati Itopiya saa rɛ, jaam yɛ Urushalima ɗɔɔ Ɗalapa bassinɛ, <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />U si ɗɔ wɛrɛ sɔɔnɛ ɔ̃tɛ au gbɛntɛn, a ɓeli laabeenɛ Ishaya nyarɛ u ɗɔɔ ɓalinɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗa Suru geli Filibu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Kpaa binɛ a ɗɔɔ gbɛntɛn a shi maani awuni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Filibu yurɛ a yɛu ɗɔbiirɛ, ntarɛ kɛ ɓali laabeenɛ janyagadi Ishayanɛ. A hɨunɛ, &lt;&lt;A zɛ vigbete a ɓalim tɛttɔ ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Jaau risinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;n yɛn zɛ kɛpikoviya?&gt;&gt; Sete shɔwɔɔ tasin u ɗɔɔ tɛttɔ, a ɓaa Filibu nyarɛ nɛu arɛ u ɔ̃ yɛm a gbẽnteng a ukɔni. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Ɗa nyaruubi gbete jaau si ɗɔ ɓalinɛ si shɔm:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">&lt;&lt;U si naa mɛrɛ̃ gbete shɔ yɛkɛ ɗɔyeenɛyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">naa jamɛrɛ̃ au nwanya ɓayɛ aɗagbete shɔ kpariu u shɛnti binɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">A ji sharuu wɔɔ ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Shɔ tasiu raarɛ, a shɔ zãriu tɔ̃vɨn ãnɛ nɔni.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Shɔwɔɔ yɛ zɛnɔɔ ɓa u shavi aru ɓɛuruyini ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Aruviya shɔ tuu Surutɛ a kootipini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Yupɛ̃niu hɨ Filibu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Gelin pɛ, janyagadim sha ruumpɛ a pi yuu piya? Au yuu ya ko a shɔwɔɔ yuu ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Kɛɗɔn Filibu ɓeliu nya a gaapɛ a Ɗa nyaruubii shɔ laabeemkɔ; a geliu ruu tɔ̃vɨn aru Yesɔ yuu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />I ɗɔɔ yɛnɛ a nyaba, i arɛ a ɗɔ gbete mii si ɗɔnyɛ, a jaau shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Nkɔ mii yɛm. Ivi yɛ zãrin Batizima pɛlinɛ viya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Kɛɗɔn Filibu geliu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ yɛ pɛlaa batizima tɔ, naa akɛ ã sisɨn nɛ a Yesɔ biini sisɨn gbete.&gt;&gt;A jaau risiunya nɛ, &lt;&lt;N ã sisɨntɛ nɛ Yesɔ Kirisi kɔ ɔ̃rɛ Ɗa jaa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Yupɛ̃niu ãsinyarɛ nɛ shɔu shiri gbɛntɛu pɛ, a Filibu a Yupɛ̃niuni i nɔɔ tipirɛ yɛnɛ ɗɔɔ miiu, kɛɗɔn Filibu pɛliu Batizima rɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Naa i shɛtɛ a yɛti miini, Ɗa Suru tuu Filibu rɛ. Yupɛ̃niu ji zɛ Filibu toti ɓa, ama yɛ ɗekɨn ɓɛjo a raanɛni u ɗɔɔ yɛti puruni fɛ̃ɛm. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Ama Filibu kpaau yuu kɛ a Azotu; a yɛ ɗekɨn anɛ Kaisariya, u ɗɔ gbeteu nwari shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn ko-pi komoo shɔpiya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Shawulu Ruuvini Yaanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Shawulu yɛ ɗekɨn a shɔ gbeteyi gɨn Uɓeyelapa ratasinɛni waanɛ, nɛn nyoitɔ, kɛɗɔn a yɛ yupɛ̃ni shɔlansi wɛrɛ Ɗa ɗɔbiirɛ, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />a gakiu nɛu ang sẽkoo Yahudawayi ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ yɛnɛ Damasku aruviya nɛkɛ kpaa shɔ gbete ai gɨn nyaba Uɓeyelapa nɛ, vɔshɔ ko soro u sɔɔriyirɛ shɔu mayi a komoo Urushalima.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Naa Shawulu atɛ a komoo Damasku ni maani, ɓa shɔ zɛnɛni ɓa, ɗɔsẽsẽ koli a koonyasi au ɗɔbii kpai. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />A nwesi a tipi a nta yeenya u ɗɔgbete geliuyɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shawulu, Shawulu! A tasinraa pi ruviya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;A ɓɛɛ piya, Uɓeyelapa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">&lt;&lt;Nkɔng Yesɔ, shɔ gbete a tasiu raayɛ,&gt;&gt; Yeenyau shanɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />&lt;&lt;Ama yulapanɛ a tɔ komoo, a ɗɔwakɔ shɔyɛ gelaa vigbete ɔ̃raa kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ a pɛliyɛtɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Shɔ gbeteyi si ɗɔranɛ a Shawuluni i shi shɔk, i ji sha ruwɔɔ ɓa; i nta yeenyau ɓɛɛ ji ɗɔkɔ i ji zɛ shɔwɔɔ ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Shawulu yulaparɛ a tipini a ɓeliu nɔrɛ, ama ji zɛ viwɔɔ ɓa. Kɛɗɔn i sãu naarɛ a n-tiu Damasku rɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Ɔ̃ lee taati ji zɛɗɔ dɔɔɓa, a ɗawuni ji shaa vi ɓa, ji ɓoo viwɔɔ dɔɔɓa.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ wɔɔ siɗɔn a Damasku u niinɛ Hananinya. Zɛ vi a nɔɔrinɛ, Uɓeyelapa geliunɛ, &lt;&lt;Hananinya!&gt;&gt; a kasinya nɛ.&lt;&lt; Nkɔng yɛm, Uɓeyelapa,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Uɓeyelapa geliu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Mabiinɛ a sã nyabalanɛ gbete shɔ ɓaanɛ kororo, a yɛ Yahuda wɛrɛ a kã jawɔɔ aɗɔn u shɔ Tasu u niinɛ Shawulu. U ɗɔ Ɗa gakinɛ, <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />a nɔrinɛ zɛ jawɔɔ u niinɛ Hananinya torɛ, a pɔ̃siunaa rɛ bi aru u kpaa ɗɔzɛnɛ sɔ̃ntɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Hananinya kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa, shɔzɛ waanɛ i gelin jaau ruubii tɛttɔ ayuu vikɔ̃linɛ gbete pɛli aa shɔbiiyi yuu kpai a Urushalima. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Nkɔ atɛ yɛm a Damasku kpaa kaka a yupɛ̃ni shɔlansiyi a wɛrɛ Ɗa i bi aru u sã kopiya shɔ gbeteyi basaa niiyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Uɓeyelapa geliu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Yɛnɛ, aru n lɔu tɛttɔ u shoshin-vishonɛ, u pɔ̃rɛ shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa a Kpatiyi a shɔ Israilayini i zɛn niitɔ. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />N yɛn tasiu raa-gbete yɛ ɓooyɛtɔ kpai arumi yuu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Kɛɗɔn Hananinya yɛrɛ, a to wɛrɛurɛ ɗɔgbete Shawulu si ɗɔnyɛ, a pɔ̃siunaa rɛ. A shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Mazɔ̃ Shawulu, Uɓeyelapa shongrɛ Yesɔ au yuu, shɔ gbete shɛ aa ɗekɨn a nyaba gbete a ɗɔ anɛ ɗɔm. Ukɔ shongrɛ aru a kpaa ɗɔzɛnɛ sɔ̃ntɔ, a Ɗa Suru rau bitɛ kpai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Ji weze tɛ̃ɛ̃ti viwɔɔ naa kaka jazɨng, shɛ a Shawulu nɔɔ kɛ ɗɔukɔ kpaa ɗɔzɛnɛ sɔ̃nrɛ. A yulapa shɔ pɛliu batizima rɛ; <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Akɨnti vishaanɛ u kaka abi sɔ̃nrɛ.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 9:19">Shawulu Nwari Shɔ Ɗa nyaruubii a Damasku</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Shawulu ɔ̃ a shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyini lee Ziti a Damasku. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />A yɛrɛ ji wariyuu ɓa, a Yahudawayi ɗɔ,ɔ̃nɛ a gaa shɔ Ɗa nyaruubii nwarinɛrɛ nɛ Yesɔ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Ɗa jaa.<verse eid="ACT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Shɔ gbeteyi nta ruum kpai bizayitɔ i hɨnɛ,&lt;&lt;N ɓa shɔ gbete au si a Urushalima nyoki shɔ gbeteyi bassi Yesɔ yɛ ɓaya? Ji am ɓanɛn sã shɔ nɛn n-tiyi yupɛ̃ni shɔlansiyi ɗekɨn aru shɔu mayitɔ ɓaya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Ama Shawulu kpaa nyanwanɛ fɛ̃ɛm a kakani yɛnɛ ɗekɨnɗekɨn, a sã Yahudawa gbeteyi a Damasku yuu kpai nɛ Yesɔ kɔ ɔ̃rɛ Shɔshɔranɛ, i ji kasiunya dɔɔɓa.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Akɨnti gbete dii tɛɛtɛ fɛ̃ɛm, Yahudawayi toli zɔɔrɛ ai maruu nɛi nyo Shawulu tɔ, <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />ama shɔwɔɔ geli Shawulu vigbete Yahudawayi ma au yuuyɛtɔ. Niti a zɨmbani i taanɔɔ a nyaba gbete shɔ to komoo yɛ aru i kasiu nyonɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Ama a zɨmba shɔ gbeteyi gɨn Shawulu i turɛ a yɛti kpẽnti ɓuti i sɔɔriu nyaba wɔɔ a bi kãsiri komoo.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shawulu A Urushalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Shawulu to Urushalima ntabii nɛn ɓasi yuu a Yesɔ jadɔɔyi. Ama i ji ã-sisɨn ɓa au biini ɓa nɛu ji Yesɔ jadɔɔ kɔ ɓa, i kpai i ntau seetitɔ. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Kɛɗɔn Barnaba au ɗɔbiirɛ a pɔ̃siunaa a n-tiu Yesɔ jaɗɔɔyi ɗɔbiirɛ. A geliyi nɔgbete Shawulu zɛ Uɓeyelapa a nyabarɛ, a nɔgbete Uɓeyelapa nwanya a wuniyɛ. A geliyi wɔsɔ̃n nɔgbete Shawulu nwari shɔ Ɗa nyaruubii a Yesɔ nii a tipi Damasku a kakani seeti ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Kɛɗɔn Shawulu ɔ̃ a yini a raa tipi Urushalima kpai, i ɗɔgbete i nwari shɔ Ɗa nyaruubii a Uɓeyelapa nii a kakani seeti ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />A nwanya a masinya a Yahudawa gbeteyi nta nya Heliniyawa yɛ, ama i yɛ ɗekɨn a nyaba kãnɛ gbete i yɛ nyouyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Naa shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a Ɗa bi i zɛtɛ nam, i tuu Shawulurɛ yɛnɛ Kayisariya, kɛɗɔn i ãu naa yɛnɛ Taasu.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Kɛɗɔn aɗɔwakɔ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a Ɗa bi gbeteyi a tipi Yahudiya, tipi Galili, a tipi Samariyayini i kpaa sisɨn roonɛ kɛkn. A nyaba Ɗa Suru naapɔ̃nɛ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a Ɗa bi i kpaa kaka kɨn fɛ̃ɛm, ai sharɛ waanɛ, ai ɔ̃kɛ a ɓuzɨn Uɓeyelapa bassinɛ.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bituru a Lida a Joopa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />A ɗawakɔ Bituru zaa a tipiu kpai, kɛɗɔn a yɛ ɗɔ shɔ sisɨn-ãnɛ a Ɗa bi gbeteyi ɔ̃nɛ a tipi Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Aɗɔwakɔ kpaa jawɔɔ u niinɛ Aninya, shɔ gbeteu bi vɔkagbete u ɗɔroonɛ ji zɛnɔɔ lapayunɛ ɓa saa maantaa. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Bituru geliunɛ,&lt;&lt;Aninya, Yesɔ Kirisi gataatɛ. Yulapanɛ a li-aa ɗɔroonɛrɛ.&gt;&gt; Ji weze tɛ̃ɛ̃ti Aninya yulaparɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Shɔ gbeteyi ɔ̃nɛ a Lida a Sharon-ni kpai i zɛutɔ, ai kɔsi sisɨnrɛ i gɨn Uɓeyelapa rɛ.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />A Joopa su wɔɔ siɗɔn u niinɛ Tabita, u si shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ (U nii a nya Heliniyawa nɛ Doka.) Suu ãu yuu kpai a ɗɔ vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ, a shɔraayi naapɔ̃sinɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />A ɗɔukɔ suu rii vɔrɔ a vɔrɛ. Shɔ weliu birɛ a yɔurɛ a jaa gbete a lapa. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Joopa si ɓa kpɛlɛ a Lida niɓa, naa shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a Ɗa bi a Joopa i ntatɛ nɛ Bituru u a Lida, i sho shɔzɛ ziti au ɗɔbii nɛ, &lt;&lt;Sɔkɔ pɛli gbãgbã au ɗɔbii.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Kɛɗɔn Bituru mabiirɛ a yɛrɛ a yininyazɔ. Naa totɛ, i tuurɛ yɛnɛ jaa lapa, suuvɔyi kpai i kɨntiu atette, i ɗɔsɨnɛ, i ɗɔ gbeteyi tasiu fãrãyi ɓuzɨn a shɔ ɓiliyini a vi gãsiyini gbete Dokasi pɛliyɛni kpai aɗagbete u si doo nɔniyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Bituru shɛshi i ɓilirɛ a jaauni kpai, a ta a yugboti a tipi a gaki Ɗarɛ; kɛɗɔn rinɔɔ a ɗɔɔ vɔrɔu a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Tabita, yulapanɛ!&gt;&gt;A ɓeli nɔɔrɛ, naa zɛ Bituru tɛ, kɛɗɔn yulaparɛ a ɔ̃rɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Bituru kpaa birɛ a sãu naarɛ yulaparɛ. Kɛɗɔn a ɓaa shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi Ɗa binyarɛ, a suvɔyini kpai, a tasirɛyi nɛ suu a suru ni. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Shɔ sãti ruum a tipi Joopa kpai, a shɔzɛ waanɛ i ã-sisɨnrɛ a Uɓeyelapa biini. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Bituru ɔ̃ a Joopa dii waanɛ a jawɔɔ wɛrɛ u niinɛ Siman au sɔ̃ koo vivaayiyɛ.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Bituru A Kɔnaliyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Jawɔɔ siɗɔn a Kayisariya u niinɛ Kɔnaliyo, u si yupɛ̃ni soja Rooma a kn soja gbete shɔ ɓaanɛ&lt;&lt;Italiyayi kn soja&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />U si shɔ Ɗalapa gɨnnɛ, ukɔ au shɔwɛrɛni kpai i bassi pɛ Ɗalapa, totti ã Yahudawa shɔraayi vitɔ, wɔsɔ̃n gaki Ɗa tɔ a lee-lee. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Si mɛnɛ atette niti a nɔɔrirɛ, au zɛ Ɗajashonɛlapa wasa-wasa gbete arɛ au ɗɔbii a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Kɔnaliyo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Kɔnaliyo nteri Ɗajashonɛlapa nɔɔ a bi a seetini a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Viu piviya, Uɓeyelapa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Ɗajashonɛlapau kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɗalapa ntabiinyatɔ̃nɛtɛ aa gakinɛni aa vishonɛ raantanɛni, mabiitɛ yɛ kasaa nyatɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Dɔdɔrim sho shɔwɔyinɛ yɛnɛ Joopa a i ɓaa jawɔɔ nya u niinɛ Siman Bituru. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Nɔ a Siman wɛrɛ shɔu sɔ̃ kooyɛ, shɔ gbete u wɛrɛ a nyaɓooti wapo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlapau yɛrɛ, a Kɔnaliyo ɓaau jawɛrɛyi nya ziti a Sojani, jagbete gɨn Ɗalapa u si shɔ gbete pɛliu vishonɛ alee -leeyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Kɔnaliyo geliyi vigbete Ɗajashonɛlapa shayɛ kpai, kɛɗɔn a shoyirɛ yɛnɛ Joopa. <verse eid="ACT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />A dii ɓuru, siyi a nyaba anɛ a Joopani maani, kɛɗɔn Bituru gẽ jalapa atette niti aru u gaki Ɗa. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Nwo sɨurɛ kasi viwɔɔ shaanɛ; si shɔ nwa vishaanɛtɛ, kɛɗɔn a zɛ vi a nɔrinɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />A zɛrɛ kolapa ɓɛlitɛ, viwɔɔ a ɗɔnɔnɛ naa kpenti fãrã, shɔ ɗɔnɔsinɛ a kawanɛ nɛ̃ɛ̃ti anɛ tipi. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />A ɓuzɨni vivaayi ko shɔpiya aɗɔn, shɔ gbeteyi dɔɔ nɛ̃ɛ̃ti a ɗɔnni, vi koonɛ buruyi a jaanɔ ɓiliyini. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />A nta yeenya wɔɔ shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Yulapanɛ, Bituru, a nyonɛ a shaarɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Ama Bituru shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Yɛ pɛli ɓa, Uɓeyelapa! N ji shaa vi gbete ɓa wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ ɓa ji lee gbete ni ɓa, ko vigbete nya-ãsinɛ Musa zãritɔ ɓa wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />A nta yeenya sɔ̃n nɛ, &lt;&lt;Vigbete Ɗalapa shatɛ nɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ mɔkɔ ɓaanɛ nɛɓa wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Ɗalapa nyanwa nankɔ ɓa taati, kɛdɔn tɛ̃ɛ̃ti viu sɔɔ kolaparɛ.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Bituru tɔkɛ lɛrinɛ fɛ̃ɛm aru u zɛ dɔɔ nɔrinɛm, kɛɗɔn shɔ gbete Kɔnaliyo shoyɛ i kpaa Siman wɛrɛ-rɛ, ai shirɛ a nyeba wɛrɛukɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />I ɓaa nyarɛ ai hɨnɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔzati wɔɔ a dɔmni u niinɛ Siman Bituru ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Si Bituru doo ɗɔɔ kãlinɛ a sisɨn nɛn zɛ dɔɔ nɔrinɛm pɛ, Ɗa Suru geliu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Weshopɛ! Shɔzɛ taati i yɛm i ɗɔgbete i kã ɗɔyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Mabiinɛ a nɔrɛ a gɨyirɛ, yɛ a sisɨn gbete aruviya nkɔng shoyirɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />A Bituru nɔrɛ yɛnɛ ɗɔɔ shɔwiyini a geliyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;Nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ jagbete ɔ kãuɗɔyɛ. Ɔ a pi aruviya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />I kasinya nɛ.&lt;&lt;Yupɛ̃ni Soja Rooma au niinɛ Kɔnaliyo ukɔ shourɛ,&gt;&gt;U pɛ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn, au bassi Ɗalapa tɔ, a shɔ Yahudawa i ãu bassiutɔ kpai. Ukɔ Ɗajashonɛlapa geliunɛ u waa a nya au wɛrɛ, nɔgbete a yɛ nta vigbete yɛ shayɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Bituru tosi shɔyi ɓusɨng wɛrɛ-rɛ, a ãi ɗɔroonɛrɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">A dii ɓuru mabiirɛ a yɛrɛ ayini; A gãsi shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a Ɗa bi a Joopa i gɨyirɛ jo. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Kɛ a dii ɓuru wɔɔ i to Kayisariyarɛ, a ɗɔ gbete Kɔnaliyo u si ai ɗɔ ganɛyɛ, a ɓɛzɔɔyini a nyazɔɔ, a ɓesayi maani ni gbete waayi nyayɛni. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Naa Bituru sikɛ to ɓuzɨn nɛ, Kɔnaliyo kpaaurɛ, a nwesi au ɗekɨn, a basiurɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Ama Bituru sã Kɔnaliyo naa a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Yulapanɛ, n ji shɔzɛ kɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Bituru yɛ ɗekɨn a nyanwanɛ a Kɔnaliyo ni, kɛdɔn a to yɛti wɛrɛ-rɛ a kpaarɛ shɔ tolinyatɛ waanɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />A geliyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔ awɔ yuu ɔ zɛ tɛttɔ fɛ̃ɛm au nya-ãsinɛ ji tɔ̃ɓa Yahudawayi ɓasi yuu a shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa a nyazɔ niɓa. Ama Ɗalapa tasintɛ nɛn nkɔng zɛ shɔwɔɔnɛ ɓa wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ ɓa, ko vizarani ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Arumkɔ shɔ shonrɛ nɛn atɔ, n ji tɔɓa nɛn a ɓani ɓa. N ji hɨ ɓanɛ dɔdɔrim a shon aruviya ɓa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Kɛɗɔn Kɔnaliyo shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Si ji ɗaa nankɔ lee taati gbete tɛɛ ɓayɛ, n si aɗɔ Ɗa gakinɛ ang wɛrɛ, si dɔɔɗa ntatɛ taati atette niti. Ɓa shɔ zɛnɛni ɓa jawɔɔ tosi fãrã kpelen-kpelen a shi ang ɗekɨn <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />a shanɛ: &lt;Kɔnaliyo! Ɗalapa nta a gakinɛtɛ tɛ vigbete a ã shɔraayi yɛ ni. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Sho shɔwɔɔnɛ a Joopa a jawɔɔ ɗɔbii u niinɛ Siman Bituru. U shɔzati a Siman shɔ koo tɔ̃ri u wɛrɛ, roo wɛrɛ a nyaɓooti wapo.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Aruukɔ n shonya shɔu ɓaa nyarɛ, a atɛm ukɔ tɔ̃vɨn. Dɔdɔrim u yɛm a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn kpai, u ɗɔ gbete u ga ko-iviya gbete Uɓeyelapa ãsiu-nyanɛ u geliuyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bituru Nyanwanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Kɛɗɔn Bituru gayi nyanwanɛrɛ nɛ: &lt;&lt;Dɔdɔrim n zɛtɛ pɛ nizɛ Ɗalapa tuu kopiya ji nazɔɔ gbetenkɔ kpai. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Shɔ gbeteyi ntau seetitɔ ai pɛli vigbete tɔ̃vɨn yɛ, Ɗalapa tɛyi naa kaaziti, ko-pi shɔ nyakoo shɔpiya. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Ɔ zɛ ruu gbete Ɗalapa shoshi shɔ Israilayitɛ, au geliyi ruu tɔ̃vɨn gbete au n ti ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ Yesɔ Kirisi kabii, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Uɓeyelapa piti kpai. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Ɔ zɛ nɔgbete ruum raa tipi Yahudiyatɛ, gaa a Galili, akɨnti gbete Yɔhana nwari shɔ nya aru Batizimayɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Ɔ zɛ Yesɔ kirisi shɔ Nazara ruubiitɛ, a nɔgbete Ɗalapa ãu Ɗa Suru wɔsɔ̃n a kaka. Yɛ kopiɗɔpiya, pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng, shɔ gbete japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ mayi dɔlaa gatiyirɛ, aruviya Ɗalapa u si awuni. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Ukɔu ɔ̃rɛ shɔshinɛkɨnti a vigbete pɛliyɛ kpai a tipi Israila a ɓuzɨn Urushalimani. Kɛɗɔn shɔ nyourɛ a nyaba naɓaanɛlaa. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Ama Ɗalapa yuusiu lapa a dii taati a pɔ̃rɛ shɛ a shɔ ɗekɨn, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Ji shɛ ɓa a kopiya ɗekɨn ɓa, ama ji shɔshinɛkɨntiyi ɗekɨnkɔ sheeli gbete Ɗalapa lɔyi tɛttɔ tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃yɛ, u shɔ gbete au shaarɛ u ɓoorɛ awuni a knti gbete yuu a sàà yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Au ãsiu-nyanɛ nɛu nwari shɔ Ɗalapa nyaruubiitɔ, u tasiyinɛ pɛ ukɔ shɔ gbete Ɗalapa ãu naa nɛ ukɔ u ɔ̃ shɔruuyeenɛ, aru shɔ gbeteyi nɔkãkãri a shɔgbeteyi vɔtɛtɔyɛni i yuu. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Janyagadiyi kpai i nwanya tɛttɔ au yuuni, i shanɛ shɔgbete ikɛ ã sisɨn nɛ au biini shɔyɛ yasiyi ruuvinitɔ au nii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ gbeteyi Ɓa Yahudawa Ɓa I Tɛ Ɗa Suru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Si Bituru u doo ɗɔɔ nyanwanɛ, Ɗa Suru nɔɔ a shɔ gbeteyi wesho au nya i yuu kpai. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Shɔ Yahudawa gbeteyi a a Bituru ni a Joopayɛ bizayikɛtɔ nɛ Ɗalapa tẽẽri shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawaɓa i Ɗa Surutɛ jo abiini kpai. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Aru nankɔ i ntarɛ ikɛ nwanyanɛ a nyakoo totot i ɗɔɔ gbete bassi Ɗa yɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:46">See Bituru nwanyarɛ nɛ: <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />&lt;&lt;Shɔmiyi tɛ Ɗa Surutɛ, ji naa gbete au tɛyɛ. shɔwɔɔ yɛ zãriyi dɔɔtɔ nɛ shɔu pɛliyi batizima ɓa a mii ni ɓaya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />See Bituru ãsi-nyanɛ shɔu pɛliyi batizima a Yesɔ Kirisi nii. Kɛɗɔn i geli Bituru nɛ u ɔ̃ pɛ a yini ko lee ziti.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Bituru Geli shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi Ruu a Urushalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Jashonɛyi a shɔ gãsi shɔ gbeteyi a sisɨn Ɗabii a tipi Yahudiya kpai i ntarɛ nɛ shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa nɛi tɛ Ɗa nyaruubii sɔ̃ntɛ jo. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Naa Bituru yɛ Urushalimatɛ, gãsi shɔ gbeteyi shi ayuu nakoo aru shaa yeenɛ i waaba a Bituru ni i shanɛ, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />&lt;&lt;Aru ivi a yɛ shɔ gbeteyi shɔ ji yeeri shaa ɓa i wɛrɛ a sháà vishaanɛ a yini viya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Kɛɗɔn Bituru tasiyidɔɔ vigbete pɛliyɛ gaa au gɨn-gɨn nɛ:<verse eid="ACT 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />&lt;&lt;Aɗagbete n si ɗɔɔ Ɗa gakinɛ a Komoo a Joopa, n nɔrirɛ, ang nɔrinɛ n zɛ viwɔɔ kɛ nɔnɛ naa fãrã pɛ̃niba a kolapa wanɛ nɛ̃ɛ̃ti, a shi ang nkɔni maani. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />N kɨnnɔɔ ɗɔɔli a ɓuzɨn n zɛ vivaa wɛrɛyi a shɔ ɓiliyini, a vigbeteyi koo a buruyi wɔsɔ̃n janoyini. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Kɛɗɔn n nta yeenya gelin nɛ,&lt;Bituru Yulapa nɛ, yeenɛ a shaarɛ.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Ama n kasinya nɛ, Ɓa nankɔ ɓa! Uɓeyelapa, n ji tosi vishaanɛ vikɔ̃linɛ au ɓa wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ ɓa ji shãni ang nyani ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Yeenya shɛ sɔ̃n a kolapa shanɛ, &lt;Mokaa ɓaa viwɔɔ nɛ vikɔ̃linɛ gbete Ɗalapa sɔɔ tɛttɔ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ nɛ ɓa wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ ɓani.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Vim pɛli ɓa taati, au kɨnti ni kɛɗɔn a viu sɔɔ kolaparɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />A ɗaukɔ tɛ̃ɛ̃ti shɔzɛ taati i arɛ a wɛrɛ gbete n-si aɗɔnyɛ, shɔ shoyi a Kasariya anɛ n ɗɔbii. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗa Suru gelin nɛ, nɛn yɛnɛ ayini nkɔng tasi yuvɔsinɛ nɛ, mazɔɔyi mangbete ai sisɨn ãnɛ aɗɔn, i shɛ a joopa i dɔ̃n dɔɔ yɛnɛ Kasariya, a u kpai u yɛ Kɔnaliyo wɛrɛ rɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />kɛɗɔn a geliu nɔgbete zɛ Ɗajashonɛlapa shi au wɛrɛ yɛ, Ɗajashonɛlapa geliu nɛ,&lt;Sho shɔwɔɔ nɛ yɛnɛ Joopa u ɓaa Siman nya gbete shɔ ɓaunɛ Bituru yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Ukɔ yɛ nwarɔɔ ruurɛ, mokaa a shɔwɛrɛni piti ɔ ranaarɛ.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Naa n gaa nyanwanɛtɛ, kɛɗɔn Ɗa suru nɔrɛ ai bi, nagbete gaa nɔnɛ au biiyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Kɛɗɔn n kpaa sisɨn a vigbete Uɓeyelapa shayɛ nɛ:&lt;Yɔhana pɛli shɔ batizima a mii, ama a yɛ pɛli shɔ batizima a Ɗa suru.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Pɛ nizɛ Ɗalapa ã shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa vi zali a ukɔni naa ukɛ ã sisɨn nɛ a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ kirisi biini; Nkɔng pi n tɔnɛn zãri Ɗalapa piya!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Naa i nta vimtɛ, i yaa nyamasinɛ ai bɛli Ɗalaparɛ, i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yadudawa ɓa Ɗalapa ã nyabatɛ i kɔsi sisɨn i yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛ aru i kpaa ɔ̃nɛ a suruni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛ a Antiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Gãsi shɔ gbeteyi ãsisɨn a Ɗabii shɔ gbeteyi sãtirɛ aru raatasinɛ gbete shɔ pɛliyɛ a ɗagbete shɔ nyo Istifanu yɛ. Shɔ gãsiyi i yurɛ yɛnɛ tipi pinitiya a Sapuru, a komoo Antiya, i ɗɔgbeteyi geli Yahudawayi kɔ sheeli Ɗa nyaruubii. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Ama gãsi shɔ gbeteyi ãsisɨn Ɗabii, shɔ gbeteyi a Sapurus a Sayirin, i yɛ Antiya rɛ i nwari shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa Ɗa nyaruubiirɛ, i ɗɔgbete geliyi ruu tɔ̃vɨn ayuu Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ nyaruubii. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Uɓeyelapa kaka si a yini, a shɔzɛ waanɛ i ã sisɨnrɛ a Ɗabii, i sɔɔ Uɓeyelapa ɗɔbiirɛ.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Ruu vigbete si ɗɔyɛnɛ tipi Antiya to shɔ gbeteyi gɨn Ɗalapa shorɛ a Urushalima. Kɛɗɔn shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi i sho Barnaba yɛnɛ tipi Antiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Naa atɛ a zɛ nɔgbete Ɗalapa tasi shɔ vɔɔ susãritɛ a bi, a nta yɛti purutɔ, a geli ruutɔ kpai nɛi ãsisɨntɔ a Uɓeyelapa nii a sisɨn gbete. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Barnaba u si shɔ tɔ̃vɨn, u Ɗa suru aɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm, a shɔzɛ waanɛ i sɔɔ u Uɓeyelapa ɗɔbiirɛ.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Kɛɗɔn Barnaba yɛ Taasurɛ aru u kã Shawulu ɗɔ. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Naa kpautɛ, a n-tiukɛ Antiya, a saa gbete sɔ̃ɔ̃li, i ziti piti i kpazɔɔ a shɔ gbeteyi ãsisɨn Ɗabiini, ai mati shɔzɛ waanɛi virɛ. A Antiya kɔ shɔ gbeteyi ãsisɨn a Ɗabii shɔ gai ɓaanɛ rɛ nɛ Kirisa.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />A ɗaukɔ gãsi janyagadiyi yurɛ a Urushalima yɛnɛ Antiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Shɔzɛ gbete ai tetteni u niinɛ Agabu, Ɗa suru ãu kakarɛ a yurɛ nwanya a shanɛ vanwɔ yɛ shɛtɔ a koo kpai, vim pɛli a saa gbete Kalaudiyu si kpati yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ jadɔɔyi marɛ nɛ kopiya ji nɔgbete u kaka sãyɛ, nɛi yɛ dɔ̃si ɓɛzɔɔyi shɔ gbeteyi ã sisɨn naapɔ̃sinɛtɔ a Yahudiyani. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />I pɛlirɛ nankɔ, kɛɗɔn i shoshi shɔpẽniyi a jaa Ɗa saaurɛ a Barnaba a Shawulu naa.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ratasinɛ Sha waanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />A ɗaankɔ kpati Hiridu gaa shɔ gãsi a ɓuzɨn shɔ gbeteyi gɨn Ɗalapa ratasinɛrɛ. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Hiridu pɔ̃rɛ shɔ nyo Yakub rɛ, Yɔhana ɓɛzɔ̃, a zaali. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Naa zɛtɛ Yahudawayi nta yɛti purutɛ a vigbete pɛliyɛni, a sã Bituru sɔ̃njirɛ. (Vim pɛli a ɗaa gbete shɔ pɛli yumusinɛ borodi gbete yisiti ɓa ɗɔmɓa yɛ.) <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Akɨnti gbete Hirudu sã Bituru tɛ a mau a jahm, a ãi a sɔjayi nɛ̃ɛ̃ti i kn kopishɔpiya naa nɛi gasɨuntɔ. Si a Hiridu sisɨn nɛn n-tiu mooyi ɗekɨn aru u yeruu au yuu a knti yumusinɛ tɛnɛda. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Shɔ pɔ̃ Bituru rɛ a jahm, ama shɔ gbeteyi ãsisɨn Ɗabii i si ɓɛjo a ɗɔɔ Ɗa gakinɛ lɔsi-lɔsi au yuuni.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ Shɛshi Bituru a jahm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />A zɨmba gbete Hiridu pɔ̃ a sisɨn nɛn shɛshi Bituru a jahm yɛnɛ shɔzɛ ɗɔbii naa dii kɛ kaanɛ yɛ, Bituru u si a noro atette sɔjayi ziti, shɔ mautɔ a saagãnya ziti, shɔ nyejaa ganɛyi i si ɗɔɔ nyejahm ganɛ. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Ɓa shɔ zɛnɛni ɓa kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlapa shɛrɛ a ɗɔuni, ɗɔsẽsẽ tasirɛ a jauni. A Ɗajashonɛlapa ɗii Bituru naarɛ a lakɔrɔ, yusiu laparɛ a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Yunɛ! gbãgbã!&gt;&gt;Tɛ̃ɛ̃ti saagãnyawi tɛ̃ɛ̃rɛ a Bituru naani a tɛ̃ɛ̃ tipi. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlapa shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Tosaa fãrã nɛ a kɔrãti ni.&gt;&gt; Bituru pɛlirɛ nankɔ. Ɗajashonɛlapa geliu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Vãa a fãrã nɛ bi a gɨnrɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Bituru gɨurɛ a shɛrɛ a jahm ni, ji zɛ ɓanɛ vigbete Ɗajashonɛlapa a ɗɔɔ pɛlinɛm pɛ nizɛ ɓa, tɔnɛ mɛnɛ nɛn zɛpɛ vigbete Ɗalapa yɛ pɛliyɛ a ɗekɨn <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Naa i tɛ shɔ nyejaa ganɛ ɗekntɛ a shɔ gbete pɛsiyɛni, ai arɛ a nyejaa saka gbete shɔ to ɓuzɨn komooyɛ, nyejau ɓelirɛ au yuu, kɛɗɔn i shɛrɛ, naa i atɛ aɗɔ gbete nyaba lanɛu doo nya aɗɔnyɛ, a ɗaukɔ tɛ̃ɛ̃ti Ɗajashonɛlapa yaa Bituru rɛ.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Kɛɗɔn Bituru sisɨn sɔɔ kɛkn a vigbete kpauyɛni, a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɔdɔrim n zɛtɛ pɛ nizɛ Uɓeyelapa shou Ɗajashonɛlapa rɛ aru u rantɔ a Hiridu naani, wɔsɔ̃n u rantɔ a vikɔ̃linɛ gbete Yahudawayi kasi pɛlinɛ ang yuuyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Naa Bituru zɛtɛ nankɔ, a yɛkɛ Mariyamu wɛrɛ, Yɔhana Marku ɓini gbete shɔ ɓaunɛ Maraku, aɗɔgbete shɔzɛ waanɛ i tolinya i ɗɔgbete i gaki Ɗa yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Bituru waa nyejaa ɓilirɛ, a jawɛrɛ gbete pɛli vishonɛ a wɛrɛuko u nii nɛ Roda arɛ nɛn kasi shɔu waa nyejaa nyapɛ. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />A ntarɛ Bituru yeenya, kɛɗɔn ji ɓeli nyejau ɓa, ama a sɔɔ ɓuzɨn a deyinɛ aru yɛti puru gbete ntayɛ, a geliyi nɛ Bituru shitɛ a nyejaa. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Kɛɗɔn i geliu nɛ, A pɛ rãn yaaǃ Ukɔ ma yɛ ɗekɨn a shanɛni nɛpɛ nizɛ, kɛɗɔn i kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Pɛ Bituru Ɗajashonɛlapa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Ama Bituru u ɓɛjo a ɗɔɔ nyejaa waanɛ. A kɨnti ni i ɓeliu nyejaarɛ, naa i zɛutɛ, bizaayi kɛtɔ. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Bituru tasiyi kɛ naa nɛi ɔ̃ shok, a tasidɔɔ nɔgbete Uɓeyelapa shɛshiu ɓili a jahm-yɛrɛ, A shanɛ,&lt;&lt; Ɔ geli Yakub tɔ a gãsi shɔ gbeteyi sisɨn ãnɛ a Ɗabii aɗɔn vimtɔ.&gt;&gt; Kɛɗɔn yurɛ a yɛ ɗɔwɔɔrɛ.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Naa dii kaatɛ, sɔjayi ai nɔɔ i yɔri yuu fɛ̃ɛm aru vigbete kpaa Bituru yɛni. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Hiridu ãsinya nɛ shɔu kã Bituru ɗɔtɔ, ama i ji kpaau ɗɔ ɓa. Kɛɗɔn hɨli shɔ ɗɔganɛyirɛ a ãsinyarɛ nɛ shɔu nyoki vɔrɔnɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Akɨnti vim Hiridu yurɛ a tipi Yahudiyani, yɛkɛ Kayisariya pɛli dii gãsi kɛ ɗɔwakɔ.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hiridu vɔnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Hiridu sisɨn lɛsi fɛ̃ɛm a shɔ Taya a Sɔdom ni, kɛɗɔn i arɛ a nyazɔ a Hiridu ɗɔbii nɛi kasiu zɛnɛ, i gaa kãnɛ pɛ Bilatu jagbete sã ɗɔuyɛ, nɛu pɔ̃siyinaa. Kɛɗɔn i a Hiridu ɗɔbiirɛ a ɗɔzɔɔ aru i kã ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ, aru i tipi yeenɛ kpaa vishaanɛ ji a kpatiu tipikɔ.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />A lee gbete shɔ lɔɔyɛ nɛ shɔ kpesi zɔ a ɗɔuyɛ, Hiridu tosiu fãrã kpatirɛ, a ɔ̃rɛ a laa kpatini, a geliyi ruurɛ. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Naa mooyi nta ruutɛ i ɗee yeenya lapa i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɓa shɔzɛ nwanyan rɛ ɓa, ama pɛ jaaɗa wɔɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />A ɗɔukɔ tɛ̃ɛ̃ti Uɓeyelapa Ɗajashonɛlapa waa Hiridu rɛ a tipi, aru ji bassi Ɗalapa ɓa, kɛɗɔn nweliyi shaaliurɛ a vɔrɛ. <verse eid="ACT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Ama Ɗa nyaruubii yɛ ɓɛjo ɗekɨn u ɗɔsãtinɛ a banɛni.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Naa Barnaba a Shawuluni i yisi vishonɛtɛ i sɔɔkɛ Urushalima, ai akɛ Yɔhana shɔ gbete shɔ ɓaunɛ Maraku ni a nyazɔɔ.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s1">Shɔ lɔɔ Barnaba a Shawulu Shɔ shoyirɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Atette shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi a Antiya, janyagadi wɔɔyi siɗɔn a shɔmalayini: Barnaba, Simeyon (gbete shɔ ɓaunɛ hɨmri), Lusiya (gbete a Sarini,) a Manayen a gbeteu ba nyazɔ (a kpati Hiridu ni) a Shawuluni. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Sii doo a ɗɔɔ Uɓeyelapa bassinɛ, a nyamanɛni, kɛɗɔn Ɗa suru geliyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔ kasin Barnaba a Shawulu ni ka gbete, aru vishonɛ gbete n ɓayi nya i pɛlinyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />I manyarɛ, ai gaki Ɗarɛ, kɛɗɔn i pɔ̃si Barnaba a Shawuluni naarɛ ayuu i tasiyi kɛ vɔɔ susãri a bi, i ãi naarɛ nɛi yɛnɛ.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ Jashonɛyi Nwari Shɔ Ɗa Nyaruubii a Sapuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Barnaba a Shawulu ni, shɔ gbete Ɗa suru shoyi yɛ, i yɛkɛ Selukiya aɗɔwakɔ i to latosi yɛnɛ Sapuru. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Naa i to Salamitɛ, i nwari shɔ Ɗa nyaruubiirɛ a Yahudawayi ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛyi. Yɔhana Marku u si ji ikɔyi ni u ɗɔ gbete pɔ̃siyinaa a vishonɛ.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Akɨnti gbeteyi zaa doddo gbete mii ka atette yɛ tɛ kpai yɛnɛ Pafos ni, i kpɛsizɔɔ a shɔ gãn nɔkunɛ wɔɔni u niinɛ Ba Yesɔ, u pɛ Yahudawa tasiyuu nɛn pɛ janyagadi. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />U si a nyazɔ gɔmna Sarajiyu Bulus, gomna Saraji u si shɔ sẽrẽ. Gɔmnau ɓaa Barnaba a Shawulu nyarɛ aru kasi nɛn nta Ɗa nyaruubii. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Ama shɔ gãn nɔkunɛm Alima ( ji u niikɔ a nya Helena) ji kasi ɓa kãnɛn rii gɔmnau sisɨn ãnɛtɔ ukɔu ãsisɨnɛ a Ɗa nyaruubiini. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Kɛɗɔn Shawulu gbete shɔ ɓau sɔ̃nnɛ Bulus yɛ, si Ɗa suru rau bitɛ kpai, a kɨnri Alima shɔ gãn nɔkunɛ nɔɔ a bi kpɛ̃ɛ̃, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />A shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Mɔkɔ japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ ɓɛɛ jaaǃ Mɔkaa ɔ̃rɛ shɔnɔpɔ̃ ko-iviya gbete tɔ̃vɨn yɛ kpai. Shɔ ɗakinɛ a lanɛni aa sisɨn lotti, a ko-pi leepiya a kã ɓɛjo nɛn risi Uɓeyelapa nyaruubii vitɔ̃vɨng u ɔ̃kɛ nyayeelinɛǃ <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Dɔdɔrim Uɓeyelapa yɛ gɔ̃ a yushotɔ; a yɛ ɔ̃ nɔgbãti, a yɛ ɔ̃ pɛtɔ dɔkaa a zɛ ɗɔsẽsẽ ɓa.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Tɛ̃ɛ̃ti ɗɔkɨnri gbɨtɨ-gbɨti kuki Alima nɔɔrɛ ji zɛ ɗɔɔɓa, a ntalirɛ u ɗɔ gbete kã shɔ gbete yɛ sãu naa u ntantiu yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Naa gɔmna zɛ vigbete kpauyɛtɛ, a ãsisɨnrɛ Ɗabiini, aruviya si bizau tɛttɔ gboti ayuu vimatinɛ gbete shɔ pɛli a Uɓeyelapa niiyɛ.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus a Barnaba ni a Antiya gbete a Pisidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Kɛɗɔn Bulus au shɔdɔranɛyini i yuu a pafos a latosi, i yɛ paga, pɛ komoo a tipi pampiliya, a ɗɔgbete Yɔhana Maraku yaairɛ a sɔɔ Urushalimayɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />I yɛ ɗekɨn yunɛ a periga ai to Antiya gbete a tipi Pisidiya rɛ, a lee susunɛ i to Yahudawayi ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛrɛ i ɔrɛɗɔn. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Akɨnti gbete shɔ ɓali laabeenɛ nya-asinɛ Musatɛ a viɓeenɛ gbete janyagadiyi ɓeeyɛni, kɛɗɔn Yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛ i shoyirɛ a ruumini nɛ,&lt;&lt;N shɔbiiyi ɔ nyanwanɛ bimanɛ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ɗɔn u kasirɛ ɔ nwari shɔ pɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Kɛɗɔn Bulus yulaparɛ, a ɗee naa nɛ shɔu ɔ̃ shɔk, a gaa nyanwanɛ a shanɛ,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:16">N shɔbiiyi Israila a shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa kpai ai bassi Ɗalapa yɛː ɔ weshopɛ ang nya! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Shɔ Israila i Ɗalapa lɔɔ u mɛuruyi, a pɔ̃rɛ i ɔ̃ shɔzɛ pẽniba aɗagbete i ɔ̃ shɔzati a tipi Masaryɛ. Ɗalapa pɛli vishonɛ au kaka pɛ̃niba a shɛshirɛ a tipi Masarni. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Au sisɨn zaza saa laa ziti Ɗalapa masisɨntɔ ayini a ɗɔgbete laa ɓa ɗɔn ɓamɓayɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Ɗalapa lɛsi shɔzɛ kn maanzii a tipi Kana a pɔ̃rɛ tipiu ɔ̃ shɔ Israilayi ɓɛɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Vim tuu mɛnɛ saa laa bmati au jaa lazi a tu kopi kpai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">Akɨnti vim Ɗalapa ãkɛ shɔ ruuyeenɛ anɛ ɗaa janyagadi Samaila. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Naa i kã kpatitɛ, kɛɗɔn a Ɗalapa ãikɛ Shawulu Kish ɓɛɛ jaa, Benjame u nyakoo, nɛu ɔ̃rii kpati saa laa ziti. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Akɨnti gbete Ɗalapa zɔ̃ Shawulu tɛ a kpatini a pɔ̃kɛ Dauda ɔ̃yi kpatikɛrɛ. Shompɛ vigbete Ɗalapa shayɛ a Dauda yuu yɛː &lt;&lt;N kpaarɛ Dauda Yesse ɓɛɛ jaa u pɛ shɔzɛ gbete n kasiyɛ, shɔ gbete yɛ pɛli vigbete n kasiu pɛliyɛ kpai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />A Dauda ladurukɔ Ɗalapa n ti Israila shɔshɔraanɛrɛ Yesɔ, nagbete ma siyɛ a Dauda ni. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Yesɔ u ɓɛɛ vishonɛ gaanɛ, Yɔhana nwari shɔ Israila Ɗa nyaruubiitɔ kpai nɛi kɔsi sisɨn i yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛtɔ shɔu pɛliyi Batizima rɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Naa Yɔhana vishonɛ atɛ ɗɔnyayisinɛ, a geli shɔ nɛ, awɔ sisɨn ɔ tɔnɛ nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ piya? Shɔ gbete ɔ gayɛ ɓa nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ ukɔ ɓa. Ama ɔ weshopɛ ang biǃ Shɔ wɔɔ kaanɛ ang kɨnti, n ji yɛɓa nɔgbete n ɗenaa n kali u rii korãtirɛ ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />N shɔbii Israilayi, Ibirayi laduru, a shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa i bassi Ɗalapa kpai: Shɔ dɔ̃si ruu shɔraanɛm pɛjo ukɔuǃ <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Aru shɔ gbeteyi ɔ̃nɛ a Urushalima ai yupɛ̃nini i ji zɛ ɓa nɛ Yesɔ kɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔshɔraanɛ ɓa, i ji zɛ ruu janyagadiyi gbete shɔ ɓaliyɛ a lee susunɛ ko-pi leepiya ɓa. Ama Ɗa nyaruubii gbete janyagadiyi shayɛ ɔ̃ nizɛ nɔgbete i nyo Yesɔ vɔrɔyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />A shomini kpai i ji kpaau ɓa a ruukɔ̃linɛ au yɛtɛ nɔgbete shɔ nyou vɔrɔyɛni ɓa, i gaki Bilatu nɛ shɔu nyou vɔrɔtɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Akɨnti gbete i pɛli ko-iviya gbete labeenɛ Ɗa nyaruubii shayɛtɛ au yuu, kɛɗɔn i nosiurɛ a yulaa gbete shɔ ɓaunaa aɗɔn i tosirɛ a sàà. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Ama Ɗalapa yusiu laparɛ a sàà ni, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Shɛ a shɔzɛ gbeteyi gɨuyɛ a dɔɔ a Galili yɛnɛ Urushalima i bi a lee totot. ikɔi ɔ̃rɛ u shɔshinɛkɨnti a shɔ Israilayi ɗekɨn. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Dɔdɔrim u yɛm u n-tɔɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨntɛ, ayuu vigbete Ɗalapa ma si au ɓɛuruuni nɛn pɛliyɛ, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />dɔdɔrim pɛliutɛ, gbete u pɛ ɓɛɛ jaamiyi, nɔgbete yusi Yesɔ lapa a sàà a suruni, nagbete laabeenɛ beeyɛ a zabura ziti nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">&lt;&lt;A pɛ ma javɔshɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">nɛm n ɔ̃tɛ meyeu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Ɗalapa yusi Yesɔ sàà aru nɛ yɛ vɔ toti ɓa, pɛliɓa nɛu pnrɛ a sàà ni ɓa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">&lt;&lt;N yɛn ãwɔ vɔɔ susãri tasinɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ nizɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">gbete n ma si a Dauda ni yɛ, <verse eid="ACT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Naa gbete sha a ɗɔwɔɔ nizɛ nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">a yɛ yaa a jawɛrɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ ɓa nɛu pn a sàà ni ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Aru Dauda yisinya vishonɛ gbete Ɗalapa ãuyɛ nɛu pɛliyɛtɔ au ɗaayɛ, kɛɗɔn a vɔrɛ, shɔ gbãurɛ a ɓɛuruyini, au bi pnrɛ a sàà ni. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Ama vim ji pɛli Yesɔ shɔ gbete Ɗalapa yusiu a sàà yɛ ji ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Aruumkɔ n shɔbii Israilayi ɔ zɛtɔ nɛ pɛji aru Yesɔnkɔ shɔ gelɔɔ ruu ruuvini yaanɛrɛ. Ɔ zɛtɔ kopiya shɔ gbete kɛ ã sisɨn nɛ au biini, ranaatɛ a ruuvinini kpai gbete laabeenɛ Musa yɛ rawɔɔ dɔɔ ɓayɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Aru kopiya gbete kɛ ãsisɨn nɛ au biini, kpaa naraanatɛ a ruuvinini kpai, shɔ gbete nya-ãsinɛ Musa yɛ pɛli dɔɔɓa <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Ɔ kɔyuutɔ, aru vigbete janyagadiyi shayɛ ukɔu pɛlinɛ a ɔkɔɔni:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />Ɔ kɨnnɔɔ pɛ ɔ shɔ nya ããnɛmiyi! Ɔ zɛ vibiizaanɛ ɔ vɔrɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Aru vi gbete nkɛ pɛlinɛ nɛm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">pɛ vigbete ɔ yɛ ã sisɨn ɓayɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">ko shɔ wɔɔ u tasɔɔ u dɔɔtɔ <verse eid="ACT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Naa Bulus a Barnaba ni i a ɗɔshɛnɛ a Yahudawa ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛ, kɛɗɔn mooyi gaki nɛi sɔɔ a lee susunɛ gbete kaanɛ, nɛi geli ruu wɔɔ sɔ̃n aru vimiyini. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Akɨnti gbete shɔ sãtitɛ a ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛni, kɛɗɔn Yahudawayi waanɛ a shɔ gbeteyi to shɔ Yahudawayi ɗa gɨnnɛni i gɨn Bulus a Barnaba ni a knti. jashonɛyi nwarinyarɛ i masibiirɛ nɛi yɛ ɗekɨn a ɔ̃nɛ Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛni.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Naa lee susunɛ zaatɛ, kopiya a komoo arɛ nɛi nta Uɓeyelapa nyaruubii pɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Naa Yudawayi zɛ mooyitɛ, kɛɗɔn nɔ̀ɔ̀ pɛli fɛ̃ɛm, ai masinya aru vigbete Bulus shayɛ ai dãurɛ.<verse eid="ACT 13:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Ama Bulus a Barnaba ni i dii nya a kakani seeti ɓa i shanɛː Ɔ Yahudawa tɔ̃ɔ̃tɔ shɔu gaa Ɗa nyaruubii nwarinɛ pɛ ɔkɔɔ. Ama ɔ ɓɛ̃ɛ̃tɛm, ɔkɔɔ pɔ̃nɛ toti sisɨn nɛi kpaa suru gbete sɔ̃nya ɓa yɛtɔ, u yɛu yawɔɔtɔ u yɛ shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa i ɗɔbii. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Aru shɔmkɔ ɔ̃rɛ nya-ãsinɛ gbete Uɓeyelapa ãu nɛu pɛliyɛ, shanɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">N pɔ̃tɛ a ɔ̃ ɗɔsẽsẽ aru shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">aru a n ti shɔraanɛ kopiɗɔpiya a koopiti kpai.<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Naa Shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa i nta vimtɛ, i nta yɛti purutɔ fɛ̃ɛm, i bɛli Uɓeyelapa nyaruubiirɛ, shɔ gbete shɔ lɔyi yɛ, aru suru gbete sɔ̃nya ɓa yɛ i ã sisɨnrɛ a Ɗabii.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗa nyaruubii raa kopiɗɔpiya kpai a tipiuni. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Ama Yahudawayi ɗaki shɔ yupɛ̃ni gbeteyi a komoou, a suu gbeteyi bassi Ɗalapayɛ a shɔ ntayi nyatɔyɛ ama i ɓa Yahudawa ɓa. I gaa Bulus a Barnaba ratasinɛrɛ ai yikiyirɛ ai kooni. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Jashonɛwi i sɔ̃li zabururɛ ai dɔɔ u ɔ̃kɛ shɔshinɛkɨnti aru shɔ koowi, ai yɛ komoo Ikoniya rɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Shɔ sisɨn anɛ a Ɗabii gbeteyi a Antiya yɛ i nta yɛti puru fɛ̃ɛm a Ɗa suruni.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s1">Bulus a Barnaba a Ikoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />A Ikoniya Bulus a Barnaba ni i to Yahudawayi i ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛ nagbete i pɛli a lee-leeyɛ, i nwari shɔ Ɗa nyaruubii fɛ̃ɛm nɔgbete Yahudawayi waanɛ a shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa, i ã sisɨnrɛ Ɗabiini. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Ama Yahudawa gbeteyi ɓɛ̃ɛ̃ sisɨn ãnɛ a Ɗabii yɛ, i shɔli shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa, ai pɔ̃rɛ i lɛsirɛ a shɔ gbeteyi ã sisɨn a Ɗabiini. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Bulus a Barnaba ni i ɔ̃rɛ a ɗɔwakɔ dɔkɔkɔ, i ɗɔɔ Uɓeyelapa nyaruubii nwanɛ seeti ɓa, Uɓeyelapa tasi u shinɛkɨntitɔ ayuu u tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ nɛpɛ nizɛ, a nyaba gbete ãu jashonɛyi kaka nɛi pɛli vibiizaanɛyi a vinɔlusinɛyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Ama shɔ komooyi i yuu vɔsikɛ zitiː shɔ wɔɔ i si a Yahudawayi knti, wɔɔ si a jashonɛyi knti.<verse eid="ACT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Kɛɗɔn gãsi Yahudawayi a shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa, i yupɛ̃niyi ni i marɛ aru i tasi jashonɛyi raa, nɛi loriyi a tari. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Naa jashonɛwi i zɛtɛ nankɔ kɛɗɔn i yurɛ yɛnɛ komoo Listira a Dabi a tipi Likaniya, au kɨntiyiyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />A ɗɔwakɔ i yɛ ɗekɨn shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn nwarinɛni.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus a Barnaba a Lisitira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />A Lisitira jawɔɔ siɗɔn u si gbangbutu, sãnɛ a ɗagbete shɔ yeeyɛ, ji raɓa shãni ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Ɔ̃rɛ aɗɔwakɔ u ɗɔgbete weshoo a Bulus nya, Bulus kɨnnɔɔ au bi kpɛ̃ɛ̃, a zɛrɛ jaau u sisɨn ãnɛ a Ɗabii aɗɔn nɔgbete shɔ yɛ gatiutɔ aɗɔn, <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />ɗee yeenya a kakani a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Yuunɛ a shi a dɔɔǃ&gt;&gt;Jaau kɔbii lapa a gaa ranɛrɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Naa mooyi zɛ vigbete Bulus pɛliyɛtɛ, i gaa yeenya ɗeenɛ a nya Likoninya i ɗɔɔ shanɛ nɛ,&lt;&lt;jaɗayi i notɛ au ɗɔbii a shɔzɛ jasuruǃ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />I ã Barnaba nii nɛ Zeyus, ai ã Bulus nɛ Hemas, aru Bulus ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ yupɛ̃ni nyanwanɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Kɛɗɔn shɔlansi jaaɗa Zeyus, gbete u wɛrɛ gãnki a akɨnti shɛnɛ komooyɛ, n ti gunapuyi a kowalaayini a nyejaa shɛni komoou, aru ukɔ a mooyini kasinɛn ã Yesɔ jashonɛyi viyuu ãnɛ.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Ama naa Barnaba a Bulus ni i nta vigbete shɔ kasi pɛlinɛyɛ, kɛɗɔn i ntasi i fãrã a yurɛ a to mooyi i tete, i ɗɔ gbete i shatinyanɛ, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />ɔ pɛli vim aruiviya? ukɔma u ji shɔzɛ naa ɔkɔɔǃ U aɗɔm aru u gelɔɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn, ɔ risi vikɔ̃linɛm knti, ɔ sɔɔ Ɗalapa au suru ɗɔn ɗɔbii, shɔ gbete pɛli kolapa a kootipini, wapo a vi gbete a ɓuzɨn ni kpai. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />A koo gbete si tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃ yɛ, ya shɔzɛ kpai nɛi pɛli vi gbeteyi kasi pɛlinɛ yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Ama Ɗalapa kopiɗaviya tasitɔ nɛn aɗɔn a nyaba vi tɔ̃vɨn gbete pɛliyɛ: Awɔ mii kolapa a vishaani a ɗaa tɔ̃vɨn; ãwɔɔ kn u pɔ̃rɛ ɔ ɔ̃ atette sisɨn puru. <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Piti a ruumini kpai, mooyi nta vi gbete Bulus shayɛ, i tɔnɛyi yɔ gunapu zitiutɔ aru i bassi Bulus a Barnaba ni ama a kɨnti ni kpai i yaarɛ.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Ama gãsi Yahudawayi arɛ Antiya a Ikoniya i shɔli mooyirɛ, ai lori Bulus a tari, i gɔ̃urɛ shɛnɛ komoo ɓili, i tɔnɛ mɛnɛ vɔtɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Ama shɔ gbeteyi ã sisɨn a Ɗabii i kɨntiu atette, kɛɗɔn yulaparɛ a sɔɔ ɓuzɨn komoorɛ. A dii gadii a yɛkɛ Dabi a Barnaba ni.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus a Barnaba Sɔɔnɛ Antiya a Suriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Bulus a Barnaba ni i nwari shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn a Dabi i kpaa jadɔɔyi fɛ̃ɛm. Kɛɗɔn i sɔɔ Lisitirarɛ, a Ikoniya wɔsɔ̃n Antiya a Pisidiya. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />i ã shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗabii kakarɛ, ai masiyibii nɛ shi ayuu sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗa bi. I tɔnɛ&lt;&lt;Ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨn akɔrɔ u ɓooraatɔ fɛ̃ɛm ɗau to ɗɔɔ Ɗa kpati roonɛkɨn,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />ko-pi wɛrɛ Ɗa shɔpiya i lɔri shɔpẽni atete ni shɔ gbeteyi gɨn Ɗalapayɛ, a Ɗa gakinɛ a nya manɛni i ãyi Uɓeyelaparɛ naa, gbeteyi ãsisɨn au biiyɛ.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Kɛɗɔn i sɔɔ tipi Pisidiya yɛnɛ pamfiliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />A ɗɔwakɔ i nwari shɔ ruu Ɗalapa a Paga, kɛɗɔn i yɛ Ataliya rɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />A ɗɔukɔ i to latosirɛ i sɔɔ Antiya rɛ, ɗɔ gbete shɔ gakiyi Ɗa nɛ Ɗalapa u shaaritɔ ai tete vishonɛ gbeteyi yisi dɔdɔrim yɛ.<verse eid="ACT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Naa i to Antiya tɛ, i toli mooyi rɛ gbeteyi gɨn Ɗalapa yɛ, i geliyi vigbete Ɗalapa pɛli ai kɔni, nɔgbete ɓeli shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawayi ɓa nyaba gbeteyi yɛ ã sisɨnyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />I ɔ̃ a ɗawakɔ dɔkɔkɔ a shɔ gbeteyi ã sisɨn Ɗabiini<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Shɔ ɔ̃ a Urushalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Shɔ wɔɔyi shɛ a tipi Yahudiya i a Antiya rɛ ai gaa shɔ sisɨn-ãnɛ Ɗabii vimatinɛrɛ, i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ ji yerɔɔ shaa ɓa naa gbete laabeenɛ Musa nya-ãsinɛ shayɛni ɓa, ɔ yɛ kpaa raanɛ ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Bulus a Barnaba ni aruumkɔ i masinya a shɔwini ayuu ruum fɛ̃ɛm, kɛɗɔn shɔ marɛ nɛ Bulus a Barnaba ni a shɔ gãsiyini a Antiya nɛi yɛ Urushalima, jashonɛyi a shɔpẽni ɗɔbii aru ruumkɔ.<verse eid="ACT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Shɔ gbeteyi gɨn Ɗa yɛ, i dɔ̃yi naarɛ, ai sɔɔkɛ tipi Fonishiya a Samariya, i geli shɔ ruu nɔgbete shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa i ã sisɨn a Ɗabiiyɛ; ruum n ti shɔ sisɨn anɛ Ɗabii kpai yɛti puru fɛ̃ɛm. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Naa Bulus a Barnaba ni i to Urushalimatɛ, shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi i tɛyi naarɛ, a jashonɛyini wɔsɔ̃n shɔpẽni dɔlaani kɛɗɔn i sha vigbete Ɗalapa pɛliyɛ ai kabii kpai. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Ama gãsi shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗabii gbeteyi ai kn gbete Farasiya ni, i yurɛ i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ shɔ yeeri shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa shaatɔ, shɔu geliyi nɛi gɨn Musa nya-ãsinɛtɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Jashonɛyi a shɔpẽni dɔlaayini ai gɨn Ɗa yɛ, i tolinyarɛ aru i sha ruumkɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />A knti gbete i nwaruutɛ fɛ̃ɛm, kɛɗɔn Bituru yurɛ geliyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;N shɔbiiyi ɔ zɛ tɛttɔ tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃ Ɗalapa lonrɛ awɔ tete aru n nwari shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa ruu tɔ̃vɨn, nɔgbete i ntarɛ i ã sisɨnrɛ a ɗɔn. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Ɗalapa au zɛ kopiya sisɨntɛ, tasitɛ nɛn tɛ shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa naatɛ au ãyi Ɗa surutɛ, nagbete ãuyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Ji ta shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa a ukɔuni ɓa; Yaasiyi ruuvinitɛ aru i sisɨn ãnɛ a Ɗabii aɗɔn. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Aru nankɔ aru ivi ɔ nta Ɗalapa sisɨn viya, a nyaba gbete ɔ pɔ̃si shɔ sisɨn anɛ Ɗabii, i vi kpette-kpetɛ gbete uɓeuruyi a wuyuni i ji zɛnɔɔ tunɛ ɓa viya? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Ama u ã sisɨntɛ a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ u kpaa naraanɛtɛ, ji nagbete ikɔma i kpaayɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Kɛɗɔn mooyi kpai i ɔ̃rɛ nyani shɔk a ɗa gbeteyi wesho a Barnaba a Bulus nyayɛ, au sha ruu vibiizaanɛ a vinɔlusinɛ gbete Ɗalapa pɛli ai kabiiyɛ, atette shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Naa i yisinya nwanɛtɛ, a Yakub kasinya a shanɛ, N shɔbiiyi ɔ wesho pɛ ang nya. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Siman tadɔɔruu nɔgbete Ɗalapa gaa rɛ tasi shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa ɔrinɛyɛ, aru Ɗalapa sẽ shɔ wɔɔ ai tete nɛi ɔ̃ n ɓɛɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Ruu gbete janyagadiyi i shayɛ ɔ̃ zali a ruumni, na gbete Ɗa nyaruubii shanɛ,<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />Uɓeyelapa shanɛ a knti vim n yɛn sɔɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">n maa ɗɔɔ kpati roonɛ gbete Dauda sãyɛ sɔ̃ntɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">n yɛn tɔ̃ri ɗɔgbete sakiyɛ sɔ̃ntɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">n yɛn pɔ̃rɛ u ɔ̃ sɔ̃n a kakani.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Kɛɗɔn shɔzɛ gãsi gbeteyi yaayɛ kpai i yɛ kãntɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">Shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa kpai, gbete n ɓai nya i ɔ̃ n ɓɛɛyɛ.<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Uɓeyelapa sha nankɔ, au sha vim si ji tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃ yɛ.<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />A ruumkɔ Yakubu yɛ ɗekɨn a shanɛni nɛ, ji tɔ̃ɓa u bɔ̃ɔ̃ shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa ai ɗɔɔ Ɗa ɗɔbii sɔɔnɛrɛ ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Ama u beeri sẽkoo u geliyinɛ ikɔ shaa vishaanɛ gbete ɓa wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ ɓanɛ, aruviya shɔ ã jaɗayi, ikɔ kã sonɛ ko vɔshɔnɛ, ikɔ shaa vivaa gbete shɔ zau kɔrɔnɛ, wɔsɔ̃n a kpaani nɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Aru Musa nya-ãsinɛ shɔ ɓalitɔ si ji tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ a Yahudawayi ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛ ko-pi lee susunɛ shɔpiya, shɔ nwau ruubiitɔ ko-pi komoo shɔpiya<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sẽkoo yɛnɛ shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ai ã sisɨntɛ Ɗabiiyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Kɛɗɔn jashonɛyi a shɔpɛ̃n dɔlaayi, a nyazɔ a shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyini kpai, i marɛ ai lɔɔ gãsi vɔshɔyi ai tete, wɔsɔ̃n Bulus a Barnaba ni i shoyirɛ a Antiya. I lo shɔzɛ ziti Yahuda gbete shɔ ɓaunɛ Barsaba a Sila, shɔ gbete shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗabii i ãyi basitɔ fɛ̃ɛm, <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />i bee sẽkoo gbete shanɛː</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:23">Ukɔu jashonɛyi a shɔpẽni dɔlaayi a mɛzɔ̃yi, u gee u ɓɛzɔ̃yi nyatɛ kpai shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa ai dɔdɔrim a Antiya, a tipi Suriya a tipi Kilisiyani, <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />u nta tɛttɔ nɛ gãsi shɔ wɔyi au kn i pɔ̃ ɔ yukɔnɛtɛ, i pɔ̃tɛ ɔ sisɨn a ɗɔɔdunɛ a nya gbeteyi shayɛ; ama ɓa ukɔu ãsiyi-nyarɛ nankɔ ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />U ɔ̃tɛ a nyazɔɔ au kasinɛ kpai u lɔɔ gãsiyi shɔ wɔɔyitɛ jashonɛyi u shoitɛ awɔ ɗɔbii, i yɛ a a ɓɛsayi Barnaba a Bulus ni nyazɔɔ, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />Shɔ gbeteyi ai kasi vɔnɛtɛ aru Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ kirisi vishonɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Arumkɔ u sho shɔ Yahuda tɛ a Sila ni. i ai yuu i yɛ gelɔɔtɔ ai nya i yɛ gelɔɔ ji vi gbete u beeyɛkɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Ɗa suru a ukɔuni u matɛ au kasitɛ shɔkɔ pɔ̃sɔɔ vi kpetɛ-kpetɛ nɛ gbete au tɛɛ nya gɨnnɛmyɛ, ɔ sã ɓɛɛ jo vi gbete u gelɔɔ dɔdɔrim: <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />ɔkɔɔ shaa vishaanɛ gbete shɔ ã vigãnkiyinɛ; ɔkɔɔ shaa kpaani, ɔkɔɔ shaa vivaa gbete shɔ zau kɔrɔnɛ, ɔkɔɔ roonɛ shɔ soni ko vɔshɔni. ɔkɛ kɔɔyuunɛ a vimni, ɔ pɛli vitɔ̃vɨngtɛ, ɔ ɔ̃ tɔ̃vɨn.<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />kɛɗɔn shɔ sho jashonɛyirɛ, ai yɛ Antiya rɛ, naa i toli shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗabiitɛ kpai, kɛɗɔn i ãyi sẽkoourɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Naa shɔ wɔɔyi ɓalitɛ, i nta yɛti purutɔ aru ruu bimanɛ gbete a ɓuzɨnyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yahuda a Silani aru si pɛ janyagadi, i geliyi ruu fɛ̃ɛm, masiyibii a ãyi kaka. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />A knti gbeteyi ɔ̃tɛ dɔkɔkɔ a ɗɔuni, kɛɗɔn shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗabii i ai naarɛ a yɛti ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ, i sɔɔ shɔ gbeteyi shoirɛ ɗɔbiirɛ.<verse eid="ACT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Ama Sila kasirɛ a ɔ̃rɛ a ɗɔukɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Bulus a Barnaba ni i nyo dii gãsi a Antiya kɔ, i a shɔ wɔyini waanɛ i mati shɔ vi ai nwari shɔ Uɓeyelapa nyaruubii.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus a Barnaba i Vɔsirɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Akɨntini a lewɔɔ Bulus geli Barnaba nɛ, &lt;&lt;U sɔɔ komoo kopishɔpiyanɛ au nwari shɔ Uɓeyelapa ruubii aɗɔnyɛ u zɛ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗabiiyi, aru u zɛ nɔgbete i ɔ̃nɛ pɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Si Barnaba kasinɛn tuu Yɔhana Marku a naani. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Ama Bulus zɛrɛ ji tɔ̃ɔ̃ɓa i yɛrɛ a Markuni ɓa, aru ji ɔ̃ ɓa ikɔ ni anɛ ɗagbeteyi yisinya vishonɛrɛ ɓa, ama yaai a tipi pampiliya. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Nyamasinɛ siɗɔn, vim pɔ̃rɛ i vɔsirɛː Barnaba tuu Markurɛ, i to latosi yɛnɛ Sayipuru. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Ama Bulus lɔɔ Silarɛ i yaa ɗɔurɛ, akɨnti gbete shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗabii shatɛ nɛ Ɗa u shaariyitɔ a nyaba Uɓeyelapa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />I tɛɛkɛ tipi Suriya a Kilikiya, i ɗɔgbete i masi shɔ gbeteyi gɨn Ɗabiiyɛ.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Timoti gɨn Bulus a Sila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Kɛɗɔn Bulus yɛ Dabi a Lisitira, a ɗɔ gbete shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛ siɗɔn u niinɛ Timoti ɔ̃yɛ, u ɓini si ɓɛɛ Yahudiyawa gɨn ji Ɗalapa kɔ, ama u ɓeye si ɓɛɛ Helenawa. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Shɔ Lisitira a Ikoniya ni gbeteyi ã sisɨn a Ɗabii kpai i nwanya tɔ̃vɨn tɔ a Timoti yuuni. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Bulus kasi nɛn yɛ a Timotini, aruumkɔ tuurɛ yeeruu shaarɛ, pɛli nankɔ aru Yahudawa gbeteyi ɔ̃nɛ a ɗɔuyi zɛ ɓeye tɛttɔ kpai u pɛ Helenawa. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />A ɗagbete i ɗɔ gbeteyi gɨn komoo-komooyɛ, i geli shɔ gbeteyi ã sisɨn a Ɗabii ruu nya-ãsinɛ gbete Yesɔ jashonɛyi a yupɛ̃ni dɔlaayi i mayɛ a Urushalimarɛ, ai geliyi nɛi gɨn nya-ãsinɛmtɔ. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Aruumkɔ shɔ sisɨn anɛ a Ɗabii i sisɨn ãnɛ lakirɛ i yɛ ɗekɨn kopi leepiya.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus nɔri aru Torowasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Kɛɗɔn i zaa tipi Pijiya a Galantiya ni aru Ɗa suru zãri i ruu Uɓeyelapa nyaruubii shanɛtɔ a Asiya ni <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Naa i atɛ a nyaɓala tipi Misiya, i kãnɛyi yɛ tipi Pitiniya ama Suru Yesɔ ji yaayi ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Kɛɗɔn i zaakɛ tipi Misiya i yɛ Torowasarɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />A zɨngbaukɔ Bulus nɔritɔ a zɛ jawɔ a Makidoniya shitɛ, u ɗɔgbete gakiu yɛ shanɛ nɛ,&lt;&lt;A tipi Makidoniya a pɔ̃siunaa pɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Akɨnti gbete Bulus nɔritɛ, tɛ̃ɛ̃ti u mabiirɛ aru tɛrɛ yɛnɛ Makidoniya, u zɛ tɛttɔ nɛ Ɗalapa ɓaunyarɛ aru u nwari shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn a ɗɔwakɔ<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lidiya ãsisɨn a Ɗabii a Filipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Kɛɗɔn u yuurɛ a Torowasa a latosi u tɛrɛ yɛnɛ Samutaraki, a dii gadi u yɛkɛ Neapoli. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Kɛ ɗɔwakɔ u tɛ a tipi yɛnɛ Filipi, a komoo ɗekɨn a makidoniya; shɔ gbete kpanti roma sãyɛ. U ɔ̃ a ɗɔwakɔ lee ɗɔkɔkɔ. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />A lee susunɛ u shɛrɛ a komoouni u yɛkɛ nyaɓooti, u pɔ̃ sisɨn u tɔnɛ mɛnɛ Yahudawayi i ɗɔ nyatoli aru Ɗa gakinɛ aɗɔn. U ɔ̃rɛ au nwanya a su gbeteyi tolinya a ɗɔuyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Su wɔɔ siɗɔn shɔ ɓaunɛ Lidiya shɔ tipi Tayatira, mɛli fãrã mizaarɛ gbete u saa yuuniyɛ, u si shɔ Ɗa bassinɛ, a Uɓeyelapa ɓeliu sisɨnrɛ aru u nta vi gbete Bulus shayɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />A knti gbete shɔ pɛliu Batizimatɛ au shɔwɛrɛyini, kɛɗɔn gakiu rɛ a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔkɛ kasinɛ nɛn shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a Ɗabii nizɛ a Uɓeyelapa nii ɔ arɛ ɔ nɔ ang wɛrɛ.&gt;&gt;Putuu nyarɛ kɛɗɔn u kasirɛ.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus a Sila Shɔ mayi a jaahm a Filipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />A lewɔɔ u ɗɔgbete u yɛ ɗɔ Ɗa gakinɛ, kɛɗɔn u kpɛsi a jaa suu wɔɔni gbete u suru kɔ̃linɛ biini au pɔ̃rɛ ntalaapaatɔ. Shɔ jaawi kpaa saa tɔ fɛ̃ɛm a nyaba laapaa gbete suu ntayɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Suu gɨli Bulus a ukɔni, u ɗɔ nya shaatinɛ shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Jaa miyi pɛ Ɗalapa gbete vi tɛu kaka ɓa u jawɛrɛyi, i gelɔɔ pɛ nɔgbete ɔ ranaanɛyɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Suu yɛ ɗekɨn a pɛlinɛni nankɔ lee waanɛ, kɛɗɔn Bulus lɛsi sisɨn fɛ̃ɛm, a zaarɛ a geli suru kɔ̃linɛu nɛ,&lt;&lt;N ãsaanyatɛ a Yesɔ kirisi nii, shɛnɛ a jaa suu biniǃ&gt;&gt; Tɛ̃ɛ̃ti suru shɛrɛ au biini.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Naa shɔ jaayi zɛtɛ i nyaba saa kpaanɛ yeetɛ, kɛɗɔn i sã Bulus a Silani, i gɔ̃irɛ yɛnɛ ɓuzɨn lumoo a shɔ ruuyeenɛyi ɗɛkɨn. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />I n-tiyirɛ a shɔ ruuyeenɛi ɗekɨn, i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Jaa miyi pɛ Yahudawayi, i ɗɔgbete n ti yukɔnɛ au komooyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />I mati nakoo gbete u nya-ãsinɛ zãaritɛ; u pɛ shɔ tipi Roomayi, u tɛ nakoom ɓa, ko u mati ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Mooyi i ɓasi yuu i nwanya kɔ̃linɛrɛ a Bulus a Sila yuu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 16:22">shɔ ruuyeenɛyi ntali i fãrã rɛ, ai ãsi-nyarɛ nɛ shɔ wayinɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />A knti gbete shɔ wayitɛ fɛ̃ɛm, kɛɗɔn shɔ pɔ̃yirɛ a jaahm, shɔ geli shɔ jaahm nɛu gau tɔ̃vɨn. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Naa shɔ jaahm tɛ nya-ãsinɛntɛ, kɛɗɔn a tosiyirɛ a ɓuzɨn jaahm gbikiri-gbikiri, a pɔ̃yi dɔɔ a ɓuzɨn laa kpete-kpete ziti ai tete a ɓaarɛ.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Simɛnɛ atette zɨmba Bulus a Silani a nyazɔɔ i si ɗɔ Ɗa gakinɛ a soo tɔ̃nɛ Ɗa ɓɛlinɛni, shɔ jaahm gãsiyi i ɗɔ gbeteyi wesho ai nyayɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Ɓa shɔ zɛnɛni ɓa, a tipi zɨntirɛ waanɛ, vim pɔ̃rɛ dɔjaa jaahm zɨntirɛ. Tɛ̃ɛ̃ti nyejaawiyi i ɓelirɛ kpai, saganya kalirɛ kpai a shɔ jaahm dɔɔyi ni. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Naa shɔ jaahmwiyi i yulapatɛ, a zɛrɛ nyejaahm ɓɛlitɛ, tɔnɛ mɛnɛ shɔ jaahmwiyi yutɛ, kɛɗɔn zɔu zaalirɛ naa yɛ nyɔu yuu awuni. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Ama Bulus shati nya a kakani a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Mɔkaa lɛsaa yuunɛǃ U kpai u ɗɔnkɔǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Shɔ jaahm ganɛ ɓaanya nɛ shɔu n ting yaa, kɛɗɔn to ɓuzɨn a nwesi a Bulus dɔɔ a Silani u bi a ɗɔɔ zaanɛ aru seeti. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Kɛɗɔn a shɛshi ɓili a hɨnɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔmala n pɛlikɛ ivi n ranaarɛ viya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />I kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;A sisɨn a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ nii, a yɛ ranaatɔ mɔkɔ aa shɔwɛrɛyini.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ nwariu Ɗa nyaruubiirɛ, a shɔzɛ gãsi gbeteyi au wɛrɛ kpai. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />A tete zɨmbauni shɔ jaahɨm ganɛu tuyirɛ a sɔɔriyi nɔrɔrɛ. Tɛ̃ɛ̃ti shɔ pɛli shɔ jaahm u Batizima rɛ au shɔwɛrɛyini kpai. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Kɛɗɔn a n ti Bulus a Silani yɛnɛ u wɛrɛ a ãyi vishaanɛrɛ nɛi shaatɔ, ukɔ au shɔwɛrɛyini i nta yɛti purutɔ fɛ̃ɛm, aru dɔdɔrim i ã sisɨntɛ Ɗalapa bi. <verse eid="ACT 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />A dii gadi yupɛ̃ni Roomayi sho shɔdiimanɛyi a nya ãsinɛni nɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔ yaa shɔmiyi naa nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />A shɔ jaahm ganɛu geli Bulus nɛ,&lt;&lt;Yupɛ̃niyi i sho nyatɛ nɛ shɔu yaa a naa a Silani. Arumkɔ ɔ shɛnɛ ɔ yɛ atette binyatɔ̃nɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Ama Bulus geli yupɛ̃niyi shɔdiimanɛuwi nɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔ ji kpau ɓa a ruukɔ̃linɛ wɔni ɓa, ama i wau a shɔ ɗekɨn, a shɔmni kpai u pɛ jaa tipi Roomayi, i lokiu a jaahm. Dɔdɔrim i kasinɛ i dɔ̃u naa kaali, yɛ pɛli ɓaǃ Ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ yupɛ̃ni Roomayi i aɗɔm i shɛshiyirɛ ai yuu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Yupɛ̃ni shɔdiimanɛyi yɛrɛ geli yupɛ̃ni Roomyi ruumrɛ; naa i ntatɛ nɛ Bulus a Silani nɛi pɛ jaa tipi Romayi, seeti pɛliyitɔ. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />I arɛ i gaki Bulus a Silani nɛi yasiyi ruukɔ̃linitɔ; kɛɗɔn i shɛshiyirɛ a jaahmni, ai gakiyi rɛ nɛi yaa koounɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Bulus a Silani i yaa jaahm-urɛ i yɛkɛ Lidiya wɛrɛ. A ɗɔwakɔ i kpaa shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a Ɗabiirɛ, i nwaariyinya bimanɛrɛ ai yaa ɗɔurɛ.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Nyayunɛ Tasalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Bulus a Silani i yɛrɛ i sɔɔ Ampiboli a Apoloniya ai to Tasalonika rɛ, ɗɔ gbete Yahudawayi ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛ aɗɔn. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Ji naa gbete Bulus pɛli a lee-lee, a to Yahudawayi ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛrɛ. A lee susunɛ lumoo taati shɛ̃ri-shɛ̃ri Bulus nakiruutɔ a shɔni a vi gbete laabeenɛ Ɗa nyaruubii shayɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />U tasiyidɔɔ ruu Ɗa nyaruubiirɛ, au tasiyinɛ Shɔshɔraanɛ yɛ ɓooratɔ, u yurɛ a sàà ni. Bulus sha sɔ̃n nɛ, &lt;&lt;Yesɔ gbete nkɛ gelɔɔ u ruubiinɛm, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Shɔshɔranɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Kɛɗɔn Yahudawa gãsiyi a Helinayi gbeteyi gɨn Ɗalapa yɛ wɔsɔ̃n suu yupɛ̃niyi waanɛ shɔ sã yuurɛ, i ɓasi yuurɛ a Bulus a silani <verse eid="ACT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Ama Yahudawayi kaagɨn i toli jasɔrɔ wɔɔyi nya a nyabalanɛ. Kɛɗɔn i yusi nya a koouni, i yurɛ yɛnɛ jawɔɔ wɛrɛ u niinɛ Jaason, nɛi kã ɗɔ Bulus a Sila aru i n-tiyi shɔ ɗekɨn. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Ama naa i ji kpayi ɓa, kɛɗɔn i gɔ̃ki Jaason a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗabii gãsiyini, i n-tiyi shɔ ruuyeenɛyi ɗekɨn, ai kaa nya i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔ miyi n ti shɔ yukɔnɛtɛ kopiɗɔpiya a koo, dɔdɔrim i atɛ au koo <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />a Jaason ãi ɗɔsusunɛ au wɛrɛ, i kpai i ɗɔ kayisar nya-ãsinɛ kanɛ i shanɛ kpati wɔɔ aɗɔn, au niinɛ Yesɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />A ruumkɔ mooyi a yupɛ̃ni koowi i sisɨn ji rooɓa. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Yupɛ̃ni koowi i pɔ̃rɛ Jaason a shɔwɔɔyini i shɔ saa rɛ aru shɔ yainaa.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus a Sila i Yɛ Beriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Naa zɨmba pɛlitɛ tɛ̃ɛti, shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi Ɗabii i sho Bulus a Silani a Beriya, naa i totɛ, i yɛ Yahudawayi ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛrɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Yahudawamiyi i sisɨn si tɔ̃vɨn i tɛɛ shɔ gbeteyi a Tasalonikatɔ, aru i tɛ Ɗaruubiitɛ naa kaziti, ko-pi lee piya i zɛ Ɗa nyaruubiitɔ aru nɛi zɛpɛ vi gbete Bulus shayɛ nizɛ ya. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Aruumkɔ Yahudawayi waanɛ i ã-sisɨn Ɗalapa bi, a suu yupɛ̃ni Helenawa a shɔ gbete shɔ ntanyatɔ wɔsɔ̃n Helenawa vɔshɔyini. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Ama naa Yahudawayi gbeteyi a Tasalonika i ntatɛ nɛ Bulus u ɗɔ Ɗa nyaruubii nwanɛ a Beriya, i yɛrɛ i wòònya a shɔ ɗɔbii nɛi pɛ shɔ gbeteyi pɔ̃ shɔ sisɨn rooɓa. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Ji ɔ̃ ɓa ɗɔkɔkɔ ɓa shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a Ɗabii i pɔ̃ Bulus yɛ nyaɓootirɛ, ama Sila a Timotini i shi ɓɛji a ɗɔukɔ. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Shɔ gbeteyi i dɔ̃ Bulus dɔɔyɛ i n-tiurɛ yɛnɛ Atina, kɛɗɔn a ɗaa Beriya sɔɔnɛ Bulus shoirɛ yɛnɛ Sila ɗɔbii a Timotini nɛi arɛ i kpau tɛ̃ɛ̃ti, ai yɛrɛ.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus nwari shɔ Ɗa nyaruubii a Atina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />A ɗagbete Bulus u ɗɔ gbete ga Sila a Timotini a Atina yɛ, naa zɛtɛ koomou vigãnkiyi raatɛ kpai u sisɨn hm fɛ̃ɛm. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Arumkɔ naki ruu a Yahudawayi ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛ a Yahudawayini a shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa gbeteyi i bassi Ɗalapayɛ, ko-pi lee piya shɔ gbete a lumo kpai naki ruutɔ a yini. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Abikuriya wɔɔyi a shɔmala Sitokiyayi i masinyatɔ awuni ni, gãsiyi hɨnɛ, &lt;&lt; Rãnmi kasi i vi shanɛ viya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:18">Wɔɔyi kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Naa shɔ gbeteyi nwari shɔ ruu jaaɗa wɔɔyi ɓa shɔ ɗɔnkɔɓa,&gt;&gt; I sha ruum aru Bulus nwari shɔ ruu a Yesɔ yuu a nɔgbete yurɛ a sàà yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Kɛɗɔn i n ti Bulus ɗɔ gbete mooyi yupɛ̃niyi tolinya aɗɔn gbete shɔ ɓaanɛ Arasa, i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;U yɛu kasi u zɛ vimatinɛ sɔɔmtɔ gbete a ɗɔɔ shanɛm. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Gãsi vi gbete a shaliyɛ u ji ntaɓa shãɓa, u kasi u zɛtɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Aru jaa tipi Atinayi a shɔzɛtini gbeteyi a Atina yɛ i kasi ɓɛɛ ruu sɔɔ ntanɛ aru i nwanya a yuuni.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Kɛɗɔn Bulus yulapa a Yupɛ̃niyi ɗekɨn a shanɛ, ɔ shɔ Atina n kɨnnɔɔ n bilirɛ ɔ pɛ shɔ nyaba gɨnnɛ waanɛ ko-pi nyaba shɔpiya. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Aru n rakitɛ awɔ koomo, n bilirɛ n zɛ vi gbete ɔ gɨn yɛ, n zɛ laazãã wɔɔ gbete shɔ bee vi au yuuni au shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɗalapa gbete shɔ ji zɛ ɓa&gt;&gt; Shɔ gbete ɔ gɨurɛ ɔ ji zɛɓamkɔ, n nwarɔɔ nya ji au yuukɔ.<verse eid="ACT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Ɗalapa gbete au shɛshi kootipi a vi gbete au ɓuzɨn ni, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Uɓeyelapa au lapa a tipini, ɔ̃ ɓa wɛrɛ Ɗa gbete shɔzɛ mayɛni ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Ji nankɔ kã shɔzɛ vinaa au pɛliyɛ ɓa, kã viwɔɔ ɓa, aru ji ukɔ au yuu ã shɔzɛ sururɛ a ɔ̃kinɛni a vi gãsiyini kpai. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Ukɔ shɛshi shɔrɛ a koo kpai a nyaba shɔzɛ gbete, a pɔ̃yirɛ nɛi ɔ̃ a kootipi kpai, pɔ̃si kopiya ɗagbete i yɛ ɔ̃ yɛ tɛttɔ a kooni kpai a ɗɔ gbete kopiya i yɛ ɔ̃yɛni. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Ɗalapa pɛli vim aru nɛ shɔu kãn ɗɔtɔ, wɔɔɓa i kɛ kãlinɛ i kpaurɛ, ko shɔmni kpai Ɗalapa u ɓa kpɛlɛ a ukɔuni ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />&lt;&lt;Uru ji a Ɗalapa yuukɔ sheeli u shaa vi u ɓoorɛ, u bi gulunɛ ji ukɔ, u ɔ̃nɛ a suruni ji ukɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Na gbete ɔ shɔ sɔɔ tɔ̃nɛ wɔyi shanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">&lt;&lt;Ukɔma u ji mɛjaayikɔ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Asitɛ ukɔu ɔ̃tɛ Ɗalapa ɓɛɛ jaayi ya, ji tɔ̃ɓa u pɔ̃ a sisɨn nɛ Ɗalapa shɛ zɔ a jasuru tarimɛɛ ɓa, ko saka gbete shɔ ɓaanɛ a zurfa ɓa, ko tari ɓa, a shɔzɛ tɔ̃ri au sẽrẽyɛ ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Si tɛ̃ɛtɛ̃ɛ Ɗalapa ya kopiyatɔ u yɛ ji u nyaba, aruiviya i ji zɛ nyaba gbeteyi au ɗɔbii ɓa, Ama dɔdɔrim kopiya ãsiunyatɛ nɛu ya ruuvinitɔ. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Aruviya pɔ̃ dii tɛttɔ au yɛ vɔsi shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn a kɔ̃linɛni a koo a shɔzɛ gbete lɔ yɛ kabii, Ɗalapa tasi kopiya tɛttɔ a koo a nyaba au yusi jau a sàà yɛ! <verse eid="ACT 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Naa i ntatɛ Bulus nwanya aru yuunɛ a sàà yɛ, kɛɗɔn gãsiyi i ãriu-nya, Ama wɔɔyi shanɛ,&lt;&lt;U kasirɛ u nta vi gbete a yɛ sha aru ruum pɛtti.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />A ɗaukɔ Bulus yaa ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛurɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Shɔ gãsiyi i sɔɔu ɗɔbii ai ã-sisɨnrɛ. Ai tetteni si Diyonisu, Yupɛ̃ni Yahudayi jaadɔ, si suwɔɔ aɗɔn u niinɛ Damari, a shɔ gãsiyini.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Bulus Yɛ Koranti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />A knti vim Bulus yaa Atina rɛ a yɛkɛ Koranti <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />A ɗɔwakɔ kpaa shɔ Yahudawa wɔɔ u niinɛ Akila, shɔ yeeu a Pontu. Akila a ɓɛso Briskila ni i ɓɛɛ anɛ a tipi Italiya siyi ji ɔ̃ ɓa dɔkɔkɔni ɓa, aru Kalaudiyu ãsinya nɛ ko-pi Yahudawa shɔpiya u yaa tipi Roomatɔ. Bulus yɛrɛ ai ɗɔbii, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />aru siu vishonɛ pɛ gbete a ikɔ ni vihãnɛ tɛnti, kɛɗɔn ɔ̃rɛ a pɛli vishonɛrɛ ikɔ ni a nyazɔ <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Ko-pi lee susunɛ shɔpiya Bulus naki ruutɔ a Yahudawayi ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛ, aru Ɗa nyaruubii, pɛli-nyaba nɔgbete sã Yahudawayi a shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa i yuu.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Naa Sila a Timotini i atɛ a Makidoniyani, Bulus ã-yuu gɔɔli aru u nwari shɔ Ɗa-nyaruubii, u ɗɔ gbete tasi Yahudawayi nɛ, Yesɔ kɔ ɔ̃rɛ Shɔshɔraanɛ. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Ama Yahudawayi i masi Bulus nyarɛ ai sha vikɔ̃linɛ au yuu, kɛɗɔn Bulus kuti zɛburu au fãrã a geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔkɛ niinɛ, n naa ɓa ɓuzɨn ni ɓa ɔkɔɔ kãjo awɔ yuu, n naa ɓa ɓuzɨn ni ɓa, dɔdɔrim yɛnɛ ɗekɨn n yɛkɛ shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawayi ɓa ɗɔbii.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />A kɨntiuni Bulus yaa ɗɔurɛ a yɛkɛ jawɔɔ wɛrɛ u niinɛ Titu Jusitu, au Bassi Ɗalapayɛ, u wɛrɛkɔ pɛsi Yahudawayi ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛrɛ <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kiripu yupɛ̃ni a Yahudawayi ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛ, ã-sisɨnrɛ a Uɓeyelapa biini, au shɔwɛrɛni kpai, a gãsi shɔgbeteyi korantini waanɛ i nta Bulus nyanwanɛ, i ã-sisɨnrɛ au nyani, shɔ pɛliyi Batizima rɛ.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Lewɔɔ a zɨmba Uɓeyeylapa geli Bulus a nɔɔrinɛ nɛ,&lt;&lt;Mokaa nta-seetinɛ, yɛ ɗekɨn a shɔ Ɗa-ruubii nwarinɛni, mokaa ɔ̃nɛ nyani, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />n a mokoni, shɔwɔɔ yɛ lɛsaa dɔɔ ɓa, aruiviya shɔzɛ waanɛ gbeteyi i a koomon pɛ n maa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Aruumkɔ Bulus ɔ̃rɛ a ɗɔu saa gbete a shɛlɛ maangbete, u ɗɔgbete matiyi Ɗa-nyaruubii yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Ama a ɗagbete shɔ Rooma i ã Gaaliyo kpanti a tipi Akaya yɛ, Yahudawayi i toli yuu i sã Bulus i n-tiu ɗɔ gbete shɔ yeeruu aɗɔnyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />I shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Jaam u ɗɔgbeteu pɔ̃ shɔ nɛ, shɔu gɨn Ɗalapa a nyaba gbete nya-ãsinɛ Musa zãritɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Si Bulus nɛn kasikɛ-nya, kɛɗɔn Gaaliyo geli Yahudawayi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Si pɛlimpɛ ruukɔ̃linɛ wɔɔ, ko ruuvini-vini, n si weshotɔ awɔ nyani. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Asitɛɗɔkɔ nya-masinɛkɔ sheeli ayuu ruuyi, a niiyi, awɔ nyaãsinɛ, ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ ɔ yisi awɔ nɔɔ. Ɓa nkɔng yɛ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ ruuyeenɛ ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />A nyikiyirɛ a jàà ruuyeenɛni. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Kɛɗɔn i kpai i sã Sostanu rɛ yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi i ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ, i waurɛ a ɗekɨn jàà ruuyeenɛukɔ, ama vim ji daa Gaaliyo ɓa a biini ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus Sɔɔ Antiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Bulus ɔ̃rɛ a Korantini lee waanɛ a shɔ gbeteyi i ã-sisɨn Ɗa biini, kɛɗɔn a to latosirɛ a priskila ni wɔsɔ̃n Akila i sã nyaba yɛnɛ Suriya. Ama i ɓɛɛ yuunɛ Bulus kouyuutɔ a Kankiriya aru gbete teetɔ. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Naa i to Apisa tɛ, Bulus yaa Briskila a Akila ni a ɗɔwakɔ, a to Yahudawayi i ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛrɛ u ɗɔ gbete masinya a yini. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Kɛɗɔn i gakiu rɛ nɛu ɔ̃pɛ toti a yini, ama ji kasiɓa. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Aɗagbete yɛ yaayikɛtɔ, a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɗalapa kɛ kasinɛ n yɛn sɔɔtɔ.&gt;&gt;kɛdɔn to latosirɛ a Apisa.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Naa nɔtɛ a Kaisariya, yɛ Urushalimarɛ a gee shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi i nyarɛ, kɛɗɔn a yɛ Antiya kɛkn. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />A knti gbete ɔ̃tɛ dii sekaa a ɗɔuni, kɛɗɔn yuurɛ zaa tipi Galantaya a tipi Pirijiya, u ɗɔgbete masi shɔ gbeteyi i gɨn Ɗalapa i biiyɛ,<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Apolo nwari shɔ Ɗa nyaruubii a Apisa a Koranti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Kɛɗɔn Yahudawa wɔɔ u niinɛ Apolo, gbete shɔ yeeu a Alezandariya yɛ, arɛ a Apisa, u pɛ shɔ nyanwanɛ waanɛ, zɛ Ɗa-nyaruubii tɛttɔ fɛ̃ɛm. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Shɔ matiu vi tɛttɔ a nyaba a Uɓeyelapani, mabii waanɛ a nyanwanɛni, mati shɔ ɓɛɛ ji vi tɔ̃vɨn gbalas a Yesɔ yuu, ama zɛ ɓɛɛ ji ruu Yɔhana Batizima kɔ sheeli. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Kɛɗɔn gaa Ɗa-nyaruubii waanɛrɛ ji nta seti ɓa a Yahudawayi i ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛni ɓa, naa Briskila a Akila ni i nta ruugbete shatɛ, i tuurɛ i tasiudɔɔ ruu Ɗa-nyaruubii sɔ̃nrɛ fɛ̃ɛm. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Apolo kasi tipi Akaya tɛnɛrɛ, shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi gbete i a Apisa i pɔ̃siu naarɛ i beeri shɔ Akayayi sẽkoorɛ, nɛi tɛu naa kaziti, naa to ɗɔwatɛ, pɔ̃si shɔ ɗɔwiyi naatɔ waanɛ shɔ gbeteyi i ã sisɨn a nyaba gbete Ɗalapa nta shɔraayɛ, <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Masi nyatɔ waanɛ a Yahudawayini, Ɗa-shaariurɛ a shɔ ɗekɨn, a nɔgbete tasiyi a Ɗa nyaruubii nɛ Yesɔ kɔ ɔ̃rɛ kirisi.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Bulus u a Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Aɗagbete Apolo u si a Koranti yɛ, Bulus raki a tipiu yɛnɛ tipi Afisa, a kpaa jadɔɔyi gãsi a ɗɔwakɔ. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Kɛɗɔn Bulus shanɛ,&lt;&lt;A ɗagbete ɔ ã sisɨn yɛ ɔ tɛ Ɗa suru kati ya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">&lt;&lt;I kasiu nyanɛ, u ji nta ɓa shãani nɛ Ɗa suru ɗɔni ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />A hɨyinɛ, ɔ tɛ sipɛ zɔ Batizima shɔpi ya?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">I kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Batizima gbete Yɔhana pɛli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Bulus shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Yɔhana pɛli shɔ Batizima aru nɛ shɔu yaa ruuviniyitɔ; a geli shɔ nɛ shɔu ã sisɨn a shɔ gbete kaanɛ au knti bi, kɛ Yesɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />I ɓɛɛ ntanɛ vim, kɛɗɔn shɔ pɛliyi Batizima rɛ a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ nii. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Bulus pɔ̃siyinaa rɛ yuu, Ɗa suru arɛ ai bi; ai gaa yeenya sɔɔ nwanɛrɛ, i nwari shɔkɛ Ɗa nyarubii. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />i kpai i si mɛnɛ vɔshɔ kopi atu ziti.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Bulus torɛ a Yahudawayi ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛ, a nwari shɔ Ɗa nyarubii a kakani ji nta seeti ɓa, pɛli shɛlɛ taati a ɗɔwakɔ, masinya ayini u ɗɔgbete pɛli nyaba gbete gɔ̃yi bii aru Ɗa lakpati ɔ̃nɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Ama gãsiyi i sisɨn lakitɔ i ji ã-sisɨn ɓa a Bulus nyani ɓa, a mɔɔyi ɗekɨn i nwanya kɔ̃linɛtɔ aru Uɓeyelapa nyabani. Kɛɗɔn Bulus yai ɗɔbiirɛ a tuu jadɔɔyirɛ yɛnɛ u ɗɔbii, ko-pi leepiya masi nyatɔ ayini u ɗɔgbete matiyi vi a jàá a Tiranu. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Bulus pɛliji ɗɔkɔ saa ziti, aru shɔ gbete i a ɔ̃nɛni a tipi Asiya i nta Uɓeyelapa nyarubiirɛ, Yahudawayi a shɔ gbeteyi i ɓa Yahudawayi ɓa ni kpai.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sikeba ɓɛɛjaayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />A ɗauni Ɗalapa pɛli vishonɛ vibii-zaanɛ gbete shɔ ji pɛli ɓa shãɓa shovi shonɛ a Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Ko shɔ tuu u hankashi ko fãrã gbete pɛli vishonɛtɛ awuni ni shɔu n ti shɔvɔrɔ, i vɔrɔ gatitɔ, suru kɔ̃linɛ shɛtɔ ai biini. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Yahudawa gãsiyi gbete i raki a yukoo-yukoo aru i shɛshi suru kɔ̃linɛyi i tɔnɛyi sho vishonɛ a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ nii, i geli suru kɔ̃linɛyi nɛ, n ãsɔɔnyatɛ a Yesɔ nii, gbete Bulus nwari shɔ yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Ai tete jaayi i si mazii javɔshɔyi, pɛ yupɛ̃ni shɔ lansi ɓɛɛ jaayi u nii nɛ Sikeba, i piti i pɛli ji ɗɔkɔ.<verse eid="ACT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Ama suru kɔ̃linɛ geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt; N zɛ Yesɔ tɛ, n zɛ Bulus tɛjo; ɔ ɓɛɛkɛ piya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Jagbete u suru kɔ̃linɛ biini, kɔbiirɛ a shishiyi a bi tɛyi kakarɛ kpai, i yurɛ i yaa wɛrɛurɛ bi waati nɔ̃rɔ̃kɔ sheeli. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Shɔ gbeteyi i ɔ̃nɛni a Apisa kpai, Yahudawa a shɔ gbeteyi i ɓa Yahudawyi i nta rum nankɔ kɛɗɔn seeti pɛliyi fɛ̃ɛm, i bassi Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ nii rɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Shɔzɛ waanɛ gbeteyi i ã-sisɨn a Yesɔ bi yɛ, i shɛshiyi i yuutɔ i ɗɔgbete i shayi i ruuvini a shɔ ɗekɨn. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Shɔzɛ waanɛ gbeteyi i nta laapaayɛ i n-tiyi laabeenerɛ kpai, i too a yaa a shɔ ɗekɨn. I ɓasi saa laabeeneyi, si piti kpai si azurfa laa laa ziti atu kopi ɓa laa ziti atu kopi. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />A nyabankɔ Uɓeyelapa nyaruubii yɛ ɗekɨn u ɗɔgbete raaɗɔyɛ a kakani.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗɔnyayusunɛ a Apisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />A knti vimkɔ Bulus pɔ̃ au sisɨn nɛnkɛ zaa tipi Makidoniya gbete a Akaya nɛ, nɛn yɛkɛ Urushalima. A shanɛ, &lt;&lt;A knti gbete nkɛ yɛ ɗɔwanɛ, ɔ̃rintɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ n zɛ Roomatɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />A kɨnti gbete shoshiyi u shɔ naapɔ̃nɛtɛ ziti, kɛ Timoti a Eratu yɛnɛ Makidoniya, u biba shi ɓɛɛ pɛjo a tipi Asiya kɔ.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />A ɗawukɔ nyayuu aru Uɓeyelapa nyarubii waanɛ Apisa. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Shɔ gbaa waanɛ wɔɔ u nii nɛ, Demitiriu nya yunɛm gayuu au bikɔ gbete shovi shonɛ a a zurfa u tɔ̃ri Artimi jasuru jaaɗaa, au lumomkɔ u shɔ vishonɛyi i kpaa saa tɔ waanɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Kɛɗɔn tolinyayirɛ kpai a shɔ gbeteyi i vishonɛ nazɔɔ gbete ayi ɓɛɛni a geliyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;Mooyi ɔ zɛ tɛttɔ u kpaa saa tɔ̃vɨn ji a nyaba vishonɛnkɔ, <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Ɔ ji ɔ yuu ɔ ɗɔɔ zɛnɛ ɔ ɗɔɔ ntanɛ vigbete jaa a shɔ ɓau niinɛ Bulus pɛliyɛ ɔ zɛ tɛttɔ ɗaki shɔ fɛ̃ɛm. Bulus shanɛ, ɗa gbete shɔ tɔ̃ri a naa yɛ ɓa ɗa tɔ̃vɨn ɓa, Ɗa shaariu tɛttɔ a shɔzɛ waanɛ i ɗɛkɨn a tipim Apisa, a shɔ gãsiyi gbete i a tipi Asiya ni kpai. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Yukɔnɛ aɗɔn, u vishonɛm nii yɛ vɔtɔ. Ɓa shɔnkɔ sheeli ɓa, jaaɗa Aritima pɛ̃niba gbete kopiya ɓɛliyɛ a tipi Asiya a kootipi kpai shɔyɛ risikɛ pɛtɛlɛǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Naa mooyi i nta vimtɛ ɗɔkɔ i sisɨn lɛsi fɛ̃ɛm, i shatinya i piti i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Bassinɛ a Aritima Apisa bi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ koowi piti i sisɨn lɛsirɛ i gaa nyashaatinɛrɛ. I sã Gayu rɛ a Aritaku ni shɔ tipi Makidoniya, gbeteyi i radɔɔ a Bulus turɛ yɛnɛ ɗɔgbete mooyi tolinya aɗɔnyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Bulus tɔnɛn to mooyi i ɗɔbii tɔ ama shɔ gbete i ã sisɨn a Ɗa bi i zariutɔ. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Gãsi yupɛ̃ni tipi Asiya gbete i ɓɛsaa a wuniyɛ, ikɔma i shoshiu jaatɔ, i gakiu nɛ vɔrɔ u nwetiu ɓa u to mooyi i ɗɔbiirɛ ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Shɔzɛ gbeteyi tolinya kpai ikɔma i ji zɛyi i yuu ɓa, i ji zɛ vi gbete i tolinya au yuuni ɓa, wɔɔyi shatinya i sha vim, wɔɔyi i sha sɔ̃nji viwaa. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Gãsi Yahudawayi dɔ̃naa Alezada a ɗekɨn, a ɗe naa nɛ shou ɔ̃ a nyani shok nɛn nwanyapɛ, <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Naa i zɛtɛ nɛu pɛ Yahudawa, i kpai i shatinya a nyazɔɔ i sha vi gbete nɛ, &lt;&lt;Bassi a Aritima Apisa biǃ &gt;&gt;I pɛli nankɔ yɛnɛ dɔɔɗa ziti.<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />A kɨntiuni kpai shɔ vibeenɛ koomo pɔ̃rɛ i vẽnyarɛ, a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ shɔ Apisayi! Kopiya zɛ tɛttɔ koomo Apisa ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ gbete zɛ jaaɗa pɛ̃niba Aritima jo a tari wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ gbete shishi a lapa yɛjo. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Shɔwɔɔ yɛ masinya ɓa a rumni ɓa, pɛ vitɔ̃vɨng ɔ wali ruu pɛ a sisɨn, ɔkɔɔ gɨnnɛ yuvãli <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Shɔ gbete ɔ n-tiyi aɗɔm, i ji ɓɔɔ vi ɓa jaaɗa Aritima ni ɓa, i ji nwanya kɔ̃linɛ wɔɔ ɓa au ɗa yuuni ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Ama Demitiriu a ɓɛsaayi shɔ vishonɛ i ruu wɔɔ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ aɗɔn, jaa ruu yeenɛ yɛm a shɔ ruunwanɛyi i a ɗɔn; i n ti ruu ji a ɗɔwakɔ. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Asitɛɗɔkɔ viwɔɔ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ɗɔn gbete ɔ kasiyɛ, ɔ yɛ yisikɛ ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn gbete jaa tipiyi i pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />U a tete yukɔnɛ ukɛ tɔnɛ u tɛ ruu gbete nyayumi nɛm, aru iviya u ji zɛ vi gbete pɔ̃rɛ shɔ yusinyarɛ ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />A knti gbete sha vim yɛ kɛɗɔn a ã kopiya naarɛ nɛyi yɛnɛ.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Bulus Yɛ Makidoniya a Girisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />A kɨntiu naa bawaanɛ yisinyatɛ, Bulus ɓaa Yesɔ jaɗɔɔyi nya a roori sisɨnrɛ, kɛɗɔn a yairɛ yɛkɛ Makidoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Raki a tipiu kpai u a ɗɔgbete nwari shɔ Ɗa nyaruubii, kɛɗɔn a to tipi Girisi rɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />A ɔ̃ a tipiu kɔ shɛllɛ taati. Usi ɗɔbii mannɛ nɛn to latosi yɛnɛ tipi suriya. kɛɗɔn naa zɛtɛ Yahudawayi i maruu kɔ̃linɛtɛ au yuu; a kɔsi nyabarɛ yɛnɛ tipi Makidoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Sufata ɓɛɛ jaa Faru a Biriya, i yɛ awuni; a Aristaku a Sakundu, shɔ Tasalonika, a Gayu gbete shɛ a Dabi; a Taikiku a Tarofimu, shɔ Asiyayi, wɔsɔ̃n Timoti i dɔ̃u dɔɔ rɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />I yɛ a ɗekɨn, i gau kɛ a Toruwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Ama u yurɛ a latosi a Filipi, akɨnti yumusinɛ borodi gbete yisiti ɓa ɗɔmɓayɛ, kɛɗɔn akɨnti dii maani u kpaayi kɛkn a Toruwa, a ɗɔwakɔ u ɔ̃ dii maanzii.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus yaanɛ Turowa dangdang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Alee susunɛ a darɛ u toli nya a ɗɔzɔɔ, aru vishaanɛ binyatɔ̃nɛ a zɔni. Kɛɗɔn Bulus nwariyi shɔ nyarɛ yɛnɛ tete zɨmba, aru gbete a dii ɓuru yɛ yaikɛtɔ. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Si Pitila aɗɔn waanɛ a wɛrɛ gbete shɔ maa wɔɔ au yuuni yɛ, a ɗɔgbete u si ɔ̃ yɛni. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Jakasa wɔɔ si a ɗɔuni u niinɛ Yutiku u si ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ a shojàá, Aɗagbete Bulus u ɗɔgbeteu yɛ ɗekɨn a nyanwanɛniyɛ, noroo pɛli Yutikurɛ waanɛ, kɛɗɔn noroo seurɛ a nweserɛ a shojaa au shɔ maa wɔɔ au yuu taati, shɔ turɛ si vɔtɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Ama Bulus noorɛ a sɔ̃sirɛ a kɔ̃tiu jaau naa bi, a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔkɔɔ yɔri yuunɛ u doo a suruniǃ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Kɛɗɔn a sɔɔ jaa gbete shɔ maa wɔɔ a lapaurɛ, a dali borodi rɛ shaarɛ. Akɨnti gbete Bulus nwanyatɛ ayini dɔkɔkɔ yɛ, dii kaarɛ a yaa ɗourɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Shɔ tuu jakasaurɛ a suruni yɛnɛ wɛrɛ, i nta sisɨn purutɔ waanɛ.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus yuu Toruwa a yɛ Militu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Bulus rarɛ a tipi a yɛ komoo shɔ ɓaanɛ Asu, ɗɔ gbete kasiyɛ nɛ shɔ kpang aɗɔnyɛ nɛ shɔu tuurɛ, kɛɗɔn u to latosirɛ a yɛ ɗɔurɛ au to ɗɔurɛ u yau knti. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Naa Bulus kpautɛ a Asu, u turɛ a latosi yɛnɛ Militu. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Aɗɔwakɔ u yɛ dekɨn a ranɛni a latosi. Adii gadi u shɛrɛ a tipi Kiyo. Adii gadi wɔɔ u shɛ sɔ̃n a tipi Samo, adii gadi wɔɔ tot, u shɛ sɔ̃n a tipi Militu. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Si Bulus ji pɔ̃ sisɨn ɓa nɛn yɛ noo a tipi Afisa ɓa, aru nɛn yisi ɗarɛ a tipi Asiya. Nɛsirɛ au sisɨn nɛkɛ pɛlinɛtɔ nɛn kasi Urushalima tonɛ, a lee pentakos.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus Nyanwanɛ Dangdang a Shɔpẽni Afisayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />A Militu Bulus sho nya yɛnɛ Afisa, nɛ shɔ ɓaarin shɔpẽniyi ai sisɨn ãnɛ aɗɔn a Ɗabii nɛi kpaantɔ. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Naa i totɛ au Bulus ɗɔbi a geliyi nɛ, Ɔ zɛ tɛttɔ nɔgbete n nyo dii nɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ a ɔkɔɔni kpai, sãnɛ dii gbete n to tipi Asiya yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />N bassi Uɓeyelapatɔ a yuroorinɛni a muruni waanɛ, n pɛli n vishonɛ naa Uɓeyelapa jawɛrɛ, a vikɔ̃linɛ gbete gãsi Yahudawayi marɛ ang yuu n shi tɔ adɔɔ kaziti aru tari gbete i ɗasɨnɛyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Ɔ zɛ tɛttɔ n ji ɓusɔɔ vigbete tɔ̃vɨn geli ɓa, a ɗagbete n nwarɔɔ Ɗa nyaruubii n matɔɔ vi a ɓili ko wɛrɛ- wɛrɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />N nwari shɔ yahudawa a shɔ gbeteyi ɓa yahudawa ɓa nyatɔ kpai aru i yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛtɔ i a Ɗa ɗɔbii, i ã sisɨn au Uɓyelapa Yesu nii. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Dɔdɔrim n gɨn vigbete Ɗa suru ãsin-nyayɛ, n yɛkɛ Urushalima, n ji zɛ vigbete yɛ kpang a ɗɔwani ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Ama n zɛ tɛtɔ a komoo pɛ̃niba gbete n rakiyɛ kpai Ɗa suru gelin nɛ, jaahɨm a raɓoonɛ ni a ɗɔgbete gaan yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Ama n ji tun suru ɓa naa viwɔ ɓa; vigbete n kasi dɔdɔrim sheeli, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ n yisinya vishonɛ gbete Uɓeyelapa Yesu ãng nɛn pɛliyɛ, wɔsɔ̃n n tasi shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn aru Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />&lt;&lt;N raki tɛttɔ awɔ tetteni kpai, n ɗɔgbete n nwarɔɔ ruu Ɗa kpati roonɛ. A dɔdɔrim n zɛtɛ shɔ wɔɔ yɛ zɛn toti awɔ tetteni ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Aru nankɔ nɛm gelɔɔtɛ: Shɔ wɔɔ kɛ niinɛ awɔ tetem, n naa ɓa ɗɔmɓa. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Aru ɔ kpai n nwarɔɔ nya tɛttɔ aru Ɗa ruubiini.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Ɔ Kɔyuutɔ awɔ jàà vivaani gbete Ɗa suru ãwɔ yɛ nɛu ɔ̃ awɔ nɔsisɨn, ɔ ɔ̃kɛ jagamɛrɛ shɔ gbeteyi ãsisɨn a Ɗa biiyɛ, gbete au woo a ɓɛɛ jaa kpaayɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />N zɛtɛ naa nkɛ yaa ɗɔnnɛ, shɔ kɔ̃linɛyi i yɛ towɔ tetetɔ, ama i yɛ yawɔɔ tetteu sɔ̃n ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Ɗaa kaanɛ shɔ gãsiyi awɔ tete i yurɛ a yelinya aru i ɗaki shɔ gbeteyi ãsisɨn i gɨnrɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Ɔ shi dɔɔ kaziti, ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ, saa taati n ɗɔ muru tɛ̃ɛ̃nɛ zɨmba a niti ni, n mati kopiya vi tɛttɔ.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Dɔdɔrim n ãwɔtɛ a Ɗa naa, au ruu tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛni, gbete yɛ pɔ̃rɛ ɔ sisɨn ãnɛ u barɛ u awɔ Ɗa vɔɔ susãri tasinɛ abi, shɔgbete Ɗalapa ãu shɔbiiyi kpai yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />N ji pɔ̃ sisɨn ɓa a shɔ wɔɔ saa ko fãrã biini ɓa <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Ɔ zɛ tɛttɔ nɛ, n pɛli vishonɛ ang naa n kpari n yuu vigbete n kasiyɛ ang shɔ dɔranɛyini kpai <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />N tasɔɔ a vim tɛttɔ kpai, ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u pɔ̃si shɔ gbeteyi kaka vishonɛ ɓayɛ naatɔ, ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ aru gbete Uɓeyelapa Yesu au yuu shayɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ gbeteyi ã shɔ vi Ɗa tasiyi susãritɔ bi fɛ̃ɛ̃m u tɛɛ shɔ gbeteyi viyɛtɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Naa Bulus yisi nyanwanɛtɛ a ta a yugboti a gaki Ɗarɛ ayini. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Kɛɗɔn kopiya sɨnɛrɛ waanɛ, i kɔ̃ti Bulus naarɛ abi i vasiu-nyarɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />I kpai i sisɨn lɛsitɔ waanɛ aru gbete geliyinɛ i zɛu tokɨn ɓa dangdang. Kɛɗɔn i dɔ̃u dɔɔ rɛ yɛnɛ ɓuzɨn latosi.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Bulus Yɛnɛ Urushalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />U vasiyinya u sãu nyabarɛ. u to latosi u tɛrɛ yɛnɛ tipi kos; A dii ɓuru u yɛkɛ Rodes, a ɗɔukɔ u yurɛ yɛnɛ Patara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Ji ɗɔwakɔ u kpaa latosi yɛnɛ tipi Fonishiya, kɛɗɔn u to latosirɛ u yɛrɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />U zɛ tipi Sayipuru, kɛɗɔn u ka a nagang yɛnɛ tipi Suriya, au nokɛ a tipi Taya, a ɗɔ gbete u latosi yɛ nɔsiu viyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Ji ɗɔukɔ u kpaa shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗa bi wɔyirɛ au ɔ̃ ayini lee maanzii. Kɛɗɔn Ɗa suru kaka pɔ̃yirɛ i geli Bulus nɛ ukɔ yɛ Urushalimanɛ <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Naa u ɗaa yɛnɛ pɛlitɛ u sã nyabarɛ u yɛrɛ. i piti kpai a ɓesoyini a jaayini, i dɔ̃u dɔɔ a nyaba shɛnɛ komouni, a ɗɔukɔ u ta yugboti piti kpai u gaki Ɗa rɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Kɛɗɔn u vasi zɔ nyarɛ, u to ɓuzɨn latosirɛ u yɛrɛ, ikɔma i sã nyaba i sɔɔ wɛrɛ rɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />U yɛ ɗekɨn a ranɛni yunɛ Taya yɛnɛ Tolemayi a ɓuzɨn latosi, a ɗɔ gbete u gee shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a Ɗa bi nyayɛ, au ɔ̃ ayini lee gbete. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />A dii ɓuru u yurɛ u tokɛ tipi Kasariya, u yɛrɛ u ɔ̃ a Filibu wɛrɛ shɔ Ɗa nyaruubii nwanɛ, shɔ gbete shɔ lɔyiyɛ atette shɔzɛ maazii nɛu ɔ̃ shɔnaapɔ̃nɛ a Urushalima. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />U jasoroyi aɗɔn nɛ̃ɛ̃ti gbeteyi ji tɛɛ vɔshɔ ɓa, i nwari shɔ Ɗa nyaruubii. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Akɨnti gbete naa u ɔ̃tɛ a ɗɔu dɔɔ ziti, kɛɗɔn janyagadi wɔɔ siɗɔn u niinɛ Agabu gbete shɛ a tipi Yahudiya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Agabu arɛ au ɗɔbii, a tuu Bulus visãn maanɛrɛ, a mau dɔɔ au naayini a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shompɛ vigbete Ɗa suru shayɛ: Shɔ visãm Yahudawayi yɛ maujo nankɔ a Urushalimani, ai yɛ ãu shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa a naa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />U a shɔ gãsiyini naa u ntatɛ nam, u gaki Bulus rɛ ukɔ yɛ Urushalimanɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Ama Bulus kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt; Ɔ pɛli ivi ɔ nyavɔ kɛ sang sisɨn nɛ viya? N mabii tɛttɔ ɓanɛ aru shɔu mang a Urushalima ko sheeli ɓa, ama n mabiitɛ ko shɔu nyong vɔrɔ a Urushalima a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ yuu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />U ji zɛunɔɔ sisɨn kosinɛ dɔɔɓa, kɛɗɔn u zɨnnyarɛ, au shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Mɛnɛ u ɔ̃pɛ nɔgbete Uɓeyelapa kasi pɛlinɛyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Naa u ɔ̃tɛ a ɗɔu dɔɔ ziti kɛɗɔn u mabii au yɛ Urushalimarɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Gãsi Jadɔɔyi gbete i shɛ a tipi Kasariya i dɔ̃u dɔɔ sɔ̃njo, ai tuurɛ yɛnɛ jawɔ wɛrɛ Maason au yɛ ɔ̃ a wuniyɛ, a Sayipuru, shɔu ãsisɨn tɛttɔ a Ɗa bi tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus a Yakubu ɗɔbii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Naa u to Urushalimatɛ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a Ɗa bi i tɛu nakaziti. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />A dii ɓuru Bulus yɛ a ukɔuni nɛn kasi Yakubu zɛnɛ; si shɔpẽniyi wɛrɛ Ɗa i ji aɗɔn kpai. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Akɨnti gbete Bulus geeyi nyatɛ, a Bulus tasiyidɔɔ vigbete Ɗalapa pɛli atette shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa wasa-wasa. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Naa i nta vigbete Bulus geliyitɛ, i piti i bassi Ɗa niitɔ. Kɛɗɔn i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Mazɔ̃ Bulus, kɨnnɔɔ pɛ shɔzɛ waanɛ a atette Yahudawayi i ã sisɨntɛ a Ɗa nyaruubiini, i kpai i ã yuu tɛttɔ a nya-ãsinɛni. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Shɔ geliyi a ruubii tɛttɔ, nɛ aɗɔ gbete a mati Yahudawa vi shɔ gbeteyi ɓa atette Yahudawa i tipi ɓa, nɛi yaa Musa nya ãsinɛ gɨnnɛtɔ, a geliyinɛ shɔkɔ yeeri jaa shaa nɛ, ko nɛ ikɔi gɨn Yahudawayi nakoonɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />I yɛ ntatɔ nɛ a atɛ nizɛ. Kɛɗɔn shɔ yɛ pɛli kɛpikoviya? <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Nkɔ vi gbete u kasirɛ a pɛliyɛ yɛm. Shɔzɛ nɛ̃ɛ̃ti aɗɔm shɔ gbeteyi i tɛɛ tɛttɔyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Yɛ ayini ai ɗɔ yumusinɛ yusɔɔnɛ naa Musa nya-ãsinɛ shayɛ, a shoriyi saa yusɔɔnɛtɔ, kɛɗɔn i yɛ kpaa nyaba yuumonɛ kɛkn. A nyabankɔ shɔyɛ zɛ kɛkn nɛ vigbete shɔ sha aa yuu yɛ, ɓa nizɛ ɓa, ama shɔyɛ zɛ kɛkn nɛ mɔkaa yuu a gɨn Musa nya ãsinɛtɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Ama aru shɔ gbete ɓa Yahudawa ai rii shɔ sisɨn-ãtɛ a Ɗabii, u beeriyi sẽkoo tɛttɔ u ãyitɛ nɛ ɔ̃riyitɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ikɔi shaa vishaanɛ gbete shɔ ã vigbeteyi i suru ɓa, ko kpaa, ko vivaa gbete shɔ zaukɔrɔyɛ, wɔsɔ̃n nɛ ɔ̃ryitɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ikɔi roonɛ a shɔ soni ko shɔ vɔshɔni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Kɛɗɔn adii ɓuru Bulus tuu shɔwiyirɛ i yɛrɛ i sɔɔyurɛ. A Bulus to wɛrɛ Ɗa rɛ a geliyi dii gbete yɛ tuuyi yɛ yɛnɛ lee gbete yusɔɔnɛ yɛ i si nyayɛ, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ lee gbete shɔyɛ ã viyuu ãnɛ a kopiya yuu.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ Sã Bulus A Wɛrɛ Ɗa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Ama naa dii maazii atɛ lee yisinɛ, gãsi Yahudawayi gbete i shɛ a tipi Asiya i zɛ Bulus a wɛrɛ Ɗa. Kɛɗɔn i shɔli moorɛ ai sã Bulus rɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />I ɗɔɔ shaati nyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ Israila! Ɔ pɔ̃siunaa joǃ Shompɛ jaa gbete ra koɗɔpiya u ɗɔgbete mati shɔ vikɔ̃linɛ aru Israila yɛ, aru nya-ãsinɛ Musa, wɔsɔ̃n au wɛrɛ Ɗa. Dɔdɔrim n ti gãsi shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa tɛ a wɛrɛ Ɗa, lɛsi ɗɔ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔmtɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />I sha vim aru si zɛ Bulus tɛttɔ a komoo a Toropimuni a Asiya, ai ɓuzɨn kɔmɔɔ. I tɔnɛ mɛnɛ Bulus tuutɛ yɛnɛ wɛrɛ Ɗa).<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Kɛɗɔn shɔwi rãɗɔu piti kũri, a shɔwi yurɛ kpai i sã Bulus rɛ i shɛshiurɛ ai wɛrɛ Ɗa. Shɔ ku nyaba wɛrɛ Ɗaurɛ tɛ̃ɛ̃ti. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Mooyi i kã Bulus nyonɛ, kɛɗɔn ruum to yupɛ̃ni sojayi shorɛ, nɛ ba raa tipi Urushalimatɛ kpai. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Yupɛ̃ni sojau yuu tɛ̃ɛ̃ti a siu yupɛ̃ni gãsiyi a sojayini i yɛ mooyi ɗɔbiirɛ gbãgbã. Naa mooyi zɛutɛ a sojayini, i yaa Bulus waanɛrɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Yupɛ̃ni sojau arɛ a sã Bulus rɛ, a ãsi-nyarɛ nɛ shɔ mau a saganya ziti, Kɛɗɔn a hɨ kɛkn nɛ, Jaam ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ piya? Pɛli iviya? <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Atette mooyi shɔ sha vi tot-tot. Aru shɔ nwalinya bang vim pɔ̃ yupɛ̃ni sɔjaurɛ ji zɛ vigbete a ɗɔ yɛnɛ ɓa, kɛɗɔn ãsiu shɔbiiyi nyarɛ nɛi tuu Bulus rɛ yɛnɛ i wɛrɛ soja gbeteyi i ɔ̃ aɗɔnyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Naa Bulus atɛ ɗɔɔli ai wɛrɛ gbeteyi ɔ̃ni, sojayi i tuu kɛtɔ aru mooyi i nyayusinɛ si bang. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Aru mooyi waanɛ i gɨn Bulus akɨnti i shati nyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ nyɔu nɛǃ &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus Rau Yuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Naa sojayi ikɛ tuu Bulus nɛ yɛnɛ i wɛrɛ ɔ̃nɛni kɛɗɔn Bulus geli yupɛ̃ni sɔjau nɛː&lt;&lt;A yɛ yantɔ n nwanya a mɔkɔni ya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">Yupɛ̃ni sɔjau hɨ Bulus nɛː &lt;&lt;A zɛnɔɔ nya Helina nwanɛ tɛya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />&lt;&lt;Ɓa moko ɔ̃rɛ jaa gbete au n ti yuyɔrinɛ saa gbete tɛɛyɛ si tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃ a tipi Masar ɓaya, ɓa mɔkɔ a tɛɛsi shɔ yuvɔnyonɛyi ɗekɨn i laa ziti atu kopi ɓa nɛ̃ɛ̃ti a ɗɔgbete laa ɓa ɗɔnni ɓayɛ baya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Bulus kasi yupɛ̃ni soja nyanɛ, &lt;&lt; N ɓɛɛ shɔ Yahudawa, shɔ yeen a tarsu a tipi Kilikiya, n pɛ jaa tipi komoo tɔ̃vɨn. N gakaatɔ yan pɛ n nwari mooyi nyapɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Kɛɗɔn yupɛ̃ni sojau ãu naarɛ, kɛɗɔn Bulus yurɛ a shi a dodo a deri mooyi naa nɛi zɨnnya pɛ. Naa mooyi i zɨnnyatɛ, kɛɗɔn Bulus nwariyinyarɛ a nya Aramaya.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />N shɔbii Yahudawayi, ɔ weshopɛ ang nyam dɔdɔrim n tasɔɔdɔɔ ruu pɛ, n ɓa shɔ ruuvini ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Naa mooyi ntatɛ Bulus nwariyinya a nya Aramaya i ɔ̃kɛ nyani shok; kɛɗɔn Bulus shanɛː<verse eid="ACT 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />N pɛ Yahudawa, shɔ yeen a Tarsu gbete a tipi Kilikiya, ama n ba aɗɔm a Urushalima, n tɛ nyaãsinɛ tɛtɔ fɛ̃ɛm ang mati vi a Gamaliya dɔɔ, matin ko pi nya-ãsinɛ shɔpiya tɛttɔ a mauruyi nakooni, n ãsisɨn tɛttɔ Ɗalapa gɨnnɛni, nagbete ɔ kpai aɗɔm dɔdɔrim ɔ pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Shɔ gbeteyi gɨn nyaban yɛ n tasiyi raa tɛttɔ. N sã vɔshɔyi tɛttɔ a soroyini ang lokiyi a jaahm <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Yupɛ̃ni lansi a wɛrɛ Ɗa a mooyi shɔruunwanɛi kpai i yɛ shitɔ ang kɨnti ni nɛn shapɛ vinizɛ. N tɛ sẽkoo jiyi nakɔ gbete shɔ beeri Yahudawayi a Damasku, kɛɗɔn n yɛrɛ n sã shɔ gbeteyi gɨn nyabauyɛ n n-tiyi Urushalima aru shɔ gɔ̃yi yusho.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus nwanya au ruu sisɨn kɔsinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />Sin a ɗɔranɛ n atɛ ɗɔɔli a Damasku ni, atette niti, ɗɔsẽsẽ a kunyasi kolirɛ ang yuu nyau. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />N nwesi a tipi ang nta yeenya gelin nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shawuluǃ -Shawuluǃ A tasin ra pi aru-iviya? <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />N hɨ nɛ, Mokaa piya Uɓeyelapa? A risinnya nɛ, Nkɔ Yesɔ shɔ nazara gbete akɛ tasiu raanɛyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Vɔshɔyi gbete si ang ɗɔbi yɛ i zɛ ɗɔsẽsẽ utɔ ama i ji nta yeenya gbete nwanya a nkɔni ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />N hɨnɛ,&lt;&lt;N pɛlikɛ iviya Uɓeyelapa? Uɓeyelapa gelin nɛ, Yunɛ a yɛ ɓuzɨn Damasku, a ɗɔwakɔ shɔyɛ gelaa vigbete Ɗalapa pɔ̃rɛ naa pɛliyɛ ji ɗɔukɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />N ji zɛ ɗɔ tɔɓa aru ɗɔsẽsẽ gbete si waanɛyɛ, kɛɗɔn shɔ gbeteyi si nkɔniyɛ i sãn naarɛ yɛnɛ ɓuzɨn Damasku.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />&lt;&lt;A ɓuzɨn komooukɔ jaa wɔɔ siɗɔn u niinɛ Hananiya arɛ ang ɗɔbii. Upɛ shɔ Ɗalapa gɨnnɛ nagbete Musa labeenɛ vimatinɛ shayɛ, shɔ Yahudawa gbete i a ɗɔuni kpai i ntau nyatɔ waanɛ. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Arɛ a shi ang ɗɔbii a gelin nɛ, Mazɔɔ Shawulu zɛ ɗɔ sɔ̃n nɛ tokɨn.&gt;&gt;A ɗaukɔ tɛ̃ɛ̃ti n zɛɗɔrɛ ang kɨnriu nɔbii. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Gelin nɛ, u ɓɛuriyi Ɗalapa lɔ atɛ naa zɛ u vigbete kasiyɛtɔ, a zɛ u jawɛrɛ tɔ̃vɨn a nta vigbete yɛ gelaayɛ. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Mɔkɔ yɛ ɔ̃rɛ u shɔshinɛkɨnti gbete yɛ geli shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn au yuu vigbete a zɛrɛ a ntayɛni kpai. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Dɔdɔrim a gaa kɛ iviya? Yunɛ shɔ pɛlaa batizima shɔu sɔkaa ruuvini pɛ a nyaba aa gakiu yɛ.<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus Nya Ɓaanɛ U Nwari Shɔ Ɗa Nyaruubii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />Naa n sɔɔ Urushalimatɛ, a ɗagbete n si ɗɔɔ Ɗa gakinɛ a wɛrɛ Ɗa, n nɔrirɛ. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Ang zɛ Uɓeyelapa kɛ nyanwanɛ, a gelin nɛ, &lt;&lt;Pɛlinɛ tɛ̃ɛti a yaa Urushalima gbãgbã, aruviya shɔ ɗɔmiyi i yɛ weshoo ɓa aa nyani ɓa a shinɛ gbete a shi ang kɨnti ni ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />N kasinɛ, &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa &gt;&gt;I zɛ tɛttɔ fɛ̃ɛm a Yahuadwayi ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛ n yɛ tɛttɔ n sã shɔ gbeteyi ãsisɨn aa nii n wayirɛ. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />A ɗagbete shɔ nyo Istifanu vɔrɔ a shɔshinɛkɨnti, n ang yuu n si jo ɗɔuni, n si jo ai kɨntikɔ, a nkɔng ga shɔ gbete shɔ nyokiyi vɔrɔ fãrã rɛ. <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Uɓeyelapa gelinɛ, &lt;&lt;yɛnɛ, aruiviya n yɛn sho atɔ a ɗɔkpɛlɛ a shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa ɗɔbii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Mooyi weshoo a Bulus nya anɛ ɗagbete sha rumyɛ; ama i ɗee yeenya lapa a gaa nya shaatinɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ yɛnɛ a wuniǃ ɔ nyo vɔrɔrɛǃ Ji tɔ̃ɓa shɔ ɗɔmiyi i ɔ̃ a suruni ɓaǃ &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />I yɛ ɗekɨn a nya shaatinɛni, i ɗɔ gbete i lɔri fãrã rɛ, a zaburu yusinɛni. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Arumkɔ yupɛ̃ni soja Roman ãsiu sojayi nyanɛ nɛi tuu Bulus yɛnɛi wɛrɛ ɔ̃nɛ, nɛi wautɔ nɔgbete yɛ geliyi kɛkn aru ivi Yahudawayi shaati nya au yuu nankɔ viya. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Naa i mautɛ nɛi waukɛtɔ, Bulus geli yupɛ̃ni soja gbete shi ɗɔuyɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;A nɔgbete nya ãsinɛ shayɛ pɛ tɔ̃vɨn ya, shɔu waa jaa tipi Roma gbete u nyanwanɛ aɗɔn a tipiu, shɔ ji nwa ruuɓa au yuuni ɓa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Naa sojau ntatɛ nam a yɛ u yupɛ̃ni ɗɔbii a hɨunɛ, &lt;&lt;A pɛli iviya? Jaam u pɛ jaa tipi Roma! &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Kɛɗɔn yupɛ̃ni sojau yɛ Bulus ɗɔbii a hɨunɛ, &lt;&lt; Gelin nɛ a pɛ jaa tipi Roma ya?&gt;&gt; Bulus kasiunya nɛ</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Nn<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Yupɛ̃ni sojau geli Bulus nɛ, &lt;&lt; N kpaa nyanwanɛ tipin n shopɛ saa pẽniba.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Bulus kasiunya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ama shɔ yeen ɓɛɛjo a tipimkɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Aru nankɔ sojayi gbeteyi kasi Bulus ruu hɨlinɛ siyɛ i sɔɔkɛ knti tɛ̃ɛti, kɛɗɔn yupɛ̃ni sojau naa zɛtɛ nɛ Bulus u pɛ jaa tipi Roma yɛ seeti pɛliu kɛtɔ, aru pɔ̃ sɔ̃ntɛ shɔ ma Bulus a saganya.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus A Yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi ɗekɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Yupɛ̃ni sojau kasinɛn nta Yahudawayi nyayenɛ gbeteyi sha a Bulus yuu yɛ; kɛɗɔn a kali Bulus saganya rɛ a geli shɔlansi wɛrɛ Ɗa a yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi a gãsi mooyini nɛi arɛ nɛi kpazɔɔ, a n ti Bulus rɛ ai ɗekɨn.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Bulus taari yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi nɔɔ abi a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;N shɔbii Israilayiǃ Anɛ naa nam ang sisɨn n yuuyɔrinɛ ɓa ang ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn ni ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Yupɛ̃ni Hananiya a ãsi shɔ gbeteyi shili maani a Bulus ɗɔbii nya nɛi wau naa nɛ a nya. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Bulus geliunɛ, &lt;&lt;Mɔkɔ shɔ kɔ̃nɛlinɛmiǃ A pɛ bi jaa gbete shɔ yo penti puru ɗɔnyɛǃ Mɔkɔ ma Ɗalapa yɛ waatɔ! A ɔ̃tɛ ɗɔgbete a yeerin ruu ayuu nɔgbete laabeenɛ Musa matɔɔ yɛ, a shomni piti a naa Musa nya ãsinɛutɛ a nɛ shɔu waantɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Shɔ gbeteyi shi a Bulus ɗɔbii maani i geliunɛ, &lt;&lt;A ɗɔgbete a ɗãa Ɗalapa, yupɛ̃ni shɔlansi a wɛrɛ Ɗa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Bulus risinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;N shɔbii Israila i ji zɛ ɓa nɛu pɛ yupɛ̃ni shɔlansi wɛrɛ Ɗa ɓa. Ɗalapa nyaruubii shanɛ, Mɔkɔ sha ruukɔ̃linɛ a shɔgbete sãwɔ yɛ yuu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Naa Bulus zɛtɛ nɛ shɔ dɔlaawɔ i shɔ Sadukiyawayi shɔ dɔlaa wɔsɔ̃n Farasiyayi, a nwnya a farasiyayi tete a kaka a shanɛ, &lt;&lt; N shɔbii shɔ Israilayi, n jo shɔ tipi Farasiya kɔ, Farasiyayi jaa, aru gbete n ã sisɨntɛ, ntɛ vɔrɔyi yɛ yulapatɔ a sàà suruni arumkɔ shɔ yeerin ruu kɛkn a yuu! &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Naa sha ruumtɛ tɛ̃ɛ̃ti, Farasiya a Sadukiyawa ni i gaa zɔ nyamasinɛ, kɛdɔn i kɨnwu vasirɛ. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Aru shɔ Sadukiyawayi i shanɛ shɔyɛ yuu ɓa a sàà ni ɓa, nɛ viwɔ sɔ̃n ɓa naa Ɗajashonɛlapa ko suruni ɓa; Ama shɔ Farasiyayi i ã ɓɛɛ sisɨn tɛttɔ ayuu vi taatimini piti kpai. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Kɛɗɔn yuyɔrinɛ pẽniba yurɛ atette shɔmala nya ãsinɛ Musa a shɔ dɔlaa Farasiyayi ni, i gaa nya masinɛ i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;U ji kpaa jam ɓa a ruu kɔ̃linɛ wɔni ɓa. Mɛnɛ Ɗa suru ko Ɗajashonɛlapa wɔyi ikɔyi nwanyarɛ awuni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Naa yupɛ̃ni sojau zɛtɛ nɛ ruu nwatɛ waanɛ, seeti pɛliutɔ nɛ shɔwiyi i yɛ ntali Bulus rɛ sekɛ-sekɛ. Kɛɗɔn yupɛ̃ni sojau ãsiu sojayi nyanɛ, sojawiyi nodiinɛ i raa Bulus a shɔwiyi naa a kaka i n tiu sojayi wɛrɛ.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />A zɨmbauni Uɓeyelapa arɛ a shi Bulus ɗɔbii ageliunɛ, &lt;&lt;Mɔkɔ nta seetinɛ! A shi tɛttɔ ang yuu a Urushalimani, ɔ̃raatɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ a pɛli sɔ̃nji nankɔ a tipi Roomani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yahudawayi i manya nɛi nyɔ Bulus vɔrɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />a dii ɓuru Yahudawayi gãsiyi i toli nya i maruu nɛ yɛ nyo Bulus vɔrɔ. I tɛɛrɛ nɛ yɛ shaavi ɓa, nɛ yɛ ɓoo ɓa setɛyi nyo Bulus vɔrɔtɛ. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Shɔzɛ gbeteyi maruu kɔ̃linɛu i tɛɛ shɔzɛ lazititɔ. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Kɛɗɔn i yurɛ i yɛ shɔlansi wɛrɛ Ɗa a gãsi shɔ shɔpẽni dɔlaayi ɗɔbii i geliyinɛ, &lt;&lt; U teetɛ kpai nɛ, u yɛ shaa viwu ɓa setɛ u nyo Bulus vɔrɔtɛ <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Dɔdɔrim ɔkɔ a shɔpẽniyini ɔ shonya a yupɛ̃ni Roman ɗɔbii nɛu ntiɔ Bulus arɛ, ɔ pɛli naa ɔ kasiu ruuwɔ ntanɛ au yuuni totti, ama u maa ɓɛɛ bitɛtɔ u yɛ nyou vɔrɔ si ji towɔ ɗɔbii ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Ama naa Bulus ɓɛɛnaa jaa nta vigbeteyi maa yɛtɛ, yurɛ a yɛ sojayi wɛrɛ pẽnibau a geli Bulus ruurɛ. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Kɛɗɔn Bulus ɓaa yupɛ̃ni sojawɔ nya ageliunɛ, &lt;&lt;Tu jakasam pɛ a n-tiu a yupɛ̃ni ɗɔbii u ruuwɔ dɔni kasiu gelinɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Sojau tu jakasaurɛ a n-tiu u yupɛ̃ni soja ɗɔbii a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ jaahm Bulus ɓanya a gaking rɛ nɛn n ti jakasam pɛ aa ɗɔbii, aru gbete u nya shanɛ wɔɔ ɗɔn au kasaa gelinɛyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Yupɛ̃ni sojau sã jakasau naarɛ a gɔ̃u kagbete a hɨunɛ, &lt;&lt;A kasin ivi gelinɛ viya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Jakasau geliunɛ, &lt;&lt;Yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi maruu tɛttɔ nɛ a gadi ɓuru i yɛ arɛ i gakaa rɛ nɛ shɔ n ti Bulus pɛ ai yupɛ̃niyi ɗekɨn, nɛi yɛ pɛli naa mɛnɛ yupɛ̃niyi kasiu ruuwɔ hɨlinɛtɔ tot-tot. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Ama mɔkɔ weshoonɛ ai nyani, aru shɔzɛ gbeteyi tɛɛ lazititɔ shɔ gbeteyi yɛ ɓu a nyaba i ɗɔgbeteyi gauyɛ. I tee tɛttɔ nɛi yɛ shaa vi ɓa nɛi ɓoo ɓa setɛ i nyou vɔrɔtɛ, i maabii tɛttɔ nɛi pɛlitɔ, ama dɔdɔrim i gaakɛ vigbete aa nya ntanɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Yupɛ̃ni sojau geli jakasau nɛ, &lt;&lt; Mɔkɔ geli shɔwɔnɛ nɛn gelin ruumtɛ.&gt;&gt;A ã jakasau naarɛ yarɛ.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ n ti Bulus gɔmna Felis ɗɔbii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Kɛɗɔn yupɛ̃ni sojau ɓau yupɛ̃ni sojawɔyi ziti nya a gelinɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ mabiinɛ ɔ tu soja laa kopi ɔ yɛ tipi Kaisariya a shɔ gbentɛ̃yini laataa atu kopi, a shɔ shalaayini laa kop, ɔ mabiirɛ ɔ yɛ yaa ɗɔm a zɨmɓa si gɨnɗadɔɔ yɛtɛ maanɛ̃ɛ̃. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Ɔ kã gbentẽ gãsiyi gbete Bulus yɛ gẽ aɗɔnyɛ yɛnɛ gɔmna Felis ɗɔbii a yukɔnɛ yɛ kpau ɓa nyabani yɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Kɛɗɔn yupɛ̃ni sojau beeri gɔmna Felis sẽkoo naa shɔmː<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />Yunɛ kalaudiyus Lisiyasi, yɛnɛ yupɛ̃niba gɔmna Felis, n gee a nyatɛ fɛ̃ɛm.<verse eid="ACT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Jaam shɔ Yahudawayi sãurɛ si ɓauvɔrɔ nyotɛ maani, n yurɛ ang sojayini gbãgbã n raurɛ, aru n ntarɛ nɛu pɛ jaa tipi Rooma. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Si n kasirɛ n zɛ vigbete i sãu au yuuni pɛ, ama n turɛ n n-tiu ai yupɛ̃niyi ɗekɨn. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />N kpaarɛ u vigbete pɛliyɛ au yɛ pɔ̃rɛ shɔu nyo vɔrɔ ko shɔ ɓau a jaahm yɛ ɓa, vigbete i ɗãu au yuuni yɛ jo ai ruu nya-ãsinɛ.<verse eid="ACT 23:29" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />&lt;&lt;Naa gelintɛ nɛi manyatɛ au yuu nɛi kasiu vɔrɔ nyonɛ, n dɔ̃u naa kɛkɨn aa ɗɔbii gbãgbã, n geliu shɔnɔpɔ̃yi tɛttɔ n-tɛ i yeeriu ruujo aa ɗekɨnkɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Arumkɔ sojayi i tuu Bulus rɛ naa gbete shɔ ãsiyinyayɛ yɛnɛ Antipatiri a zɨmba. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />A dii ɓuru soja gbeteyi raa a dɔɔ yɛ i yaa soja gbeteyi shɔ gbentẽ gẽnɛi nɛi yɛ ɗekɨn awuni, ikɔma i sɔɔ sɔ̃npɛ i wɛrɛ soja pẽniɓa. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />I tuurɛ yɛnɛ tipi Kaisariya, i ã gɔmna Felis sẽkoourɛ, i yasiu Bulus rɛ a naa.<verse eid="ACT 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Naa gɔmna Felis ɓali sẽkooutɛ a hɨ Bulus nɛ, a pi jaa tipi shɔpiya? Naa ntatɛ nɛu pɛ jaa tipi Kilikiya, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;N yɛn weshootɔ aa nyani aɗagbete a shɔnɔpɔ̃yi kaanɛ.&gt;&gt;Kɛɗɔn gɔmna ãsi nyarɛ nɛ shɔu pɔ̃u a ɗɔ gbete gɔmna Hirudu ɔ̃yɛ.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Felis Yeeruu a Bulus Yuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Akɨnti dii maanzii yupɛ̃ni lansi a wɛrɛ Ɗa a ɗɔzɔɔ a Hananiya a shɔpẽni dɔlaayini wɔsɔ̃n lawuya u niinɛ Tartulus i yɛ Kaseriyarɛ, aru i wuli Bulus a gomna Felis ɗɔbii. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ ɓaa Bulus nyarɛ a ɓuzɨn, a Tartulus gaa nyanwanɛrɛ a Felis ni wuliu nɛ,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">Yupɛ̃ni, a nyaba vigbete a pɛliyɛ u nta ɔ̃nɛbinyatɔnɛtɛ ɗaa ɗɔkɔkɔ, a sẽrɛ̃ pɔ̃tɛ shɔ tɔ̃ri vitɛ fɛ̃ɛm au n ti i ɔ̃nɛbinyatɔnɛ aru tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ a koo. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />U tɛ vimtɛ nakaziti ko ɗaviya a ko ɗɔpiya. au dɔ̃raatɛ fɛ̃ɛm. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Ama n ji kasi ɓa n yisaa ɗaarɛ ɓa, n gakaatɔ, a tasi tɔ̃vɨn a weshopɛ au vi dɔkaa gbete u gelaami. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />U kɨnnɔɔ u zɛrɛ jaam u pɛ shɔ yukɔnɛ n tinɛ, gaa yuyɔrinɛ a Yahudawayi tete piti a kootipini kpai, a uku ɔ̃rɛ yupɛ̃ni nyayelinɛ a shɔ ɓaanɛ Nazarawa yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Kasinɛn lɛsi wɛrɛ Ɗa tɔ, ama au sãurɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Ama kpati Lisiya arɛ a raurɛ au naa a kaka bi. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />&lt;&lt;A kɛ hɨli jaam ruunɛ, aa yuu a yɛ zɛtɔ au ɗɔbii nɛ vi gbeteu wuliuyɛ au yuum pɛ nizɛ kɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Yahudawayi i sha sɔ̃njo nankɔ nɛ, vim kpai pɛ nizɛ.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus Rau Yuu A Felis Ɗekɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Kɛɗɔn gomna ã Bulus naarɛ nɛu nyanwanɛ, a Bulus a shanɛ,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:10">N zɛ tɛttɔ a ɔ̃ shɔ ruuyeerinɛtɛ a tipim saa waanɛ, n nta binyatɔ̃nɛtɛ n ran yuu aa ɗekɨn. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />A kɛ hɨlinɛ ji tɛɛ lee kopi atu ziti ɓa ang yɛ Urushalima ɗɔ Ɗa basinɛ yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Yahudawdayi i ji kpang ɓa a ɗɔ nyamasinɛ a shɔwɔni a wɛrɛ Ɗa niɓa, i ji kpang ɓa n aɗɔ mooyi dãlinɛ ɓa, ko ai ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛ koɗɔpiya a komooni ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Vigbeteyi sha ang yuu yɛ, i yɛ zɛ a nɔɔ tasinɛ dɔdɔrim dɔɔɓa. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />N ã sisɨn ɓɛɛjo a vi gbete sheeliː u ɔ̃rɛ n gɨn mauriyi Ɗalapa a nyaba gbeteyi shanɛ, nɛ nyaba nyayeelinɛ, ama n ã sisɨn wɔsɔn a ko-iviya gbete shɔ bee a labeenɛ Musa nya-ãsinɛ a labeenɛ janyagadiyi. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />N pɔ̃ sisɨn Ɗalapa bi nagbete shɔmiyi pɔ̃yɛ, nɛ shɔ yɛ yuutɔ sàà ni a suruni shɔ tɔ̃vɨn a shɔ kɔ̃linɛyini kpai. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Arumkɔ kopiɗaviya n pɛli nɔgbete n yɛn zɛnɔtɛyɛ n ɔ̃ ɓa a yuyɔrinɛni a Ɗalapa a shɔzɛ ɗekɨn ni ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />Akɨnti gbete n ɔ̃tɛ saa waanɛ ang sɔɔ wɛrɛ Urushalimarɛ, aru n n ti n shɔbiiyi saa a viyuu ãnɛni. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />N a ɗɔ pɛlinɛ i kpanrɛ a wɛrɛ Ɗa, sin yisi n yuu sɔɔkinɛtɛ, mooyi i si ɓa ang ɗɔbiini ɓa ang ji pɔ̃ shɔ yuyɔrinɛ sɔ̃n ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Ama Yahudawayi gãsi a tipi Asiya i si ɗɔuni, ikɔi yuu i arɛ aa ɗɔbii i wulinrɛ naa i vi shanɛ wɔɔkɛ ɔ̃nɛ a ɗɔni ang yuuni. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Ko shɔ gbeteyi a ɗɔm i sha ruukɔ̃linɛ pɛ gbete i kpang a wuniyɛ aɗagbete i n a Yahudawayi yupɛ̃ni ɗekɨn yɛ, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />see ruugbete n shayɛ aɗagbete n shi ai ɗekɨn yɛː Ang shanɛ&lt;&lt;Aru n ãsisɨn nɛ Ɗalapa yɛ pɔrɛ shɔu yuu a sàà a suruni aruukɔ shɔ yeerin ruurɛ awɔ ɗekɨn ni nɛm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Kɛɗɔn Felis zɛ vi tɛttɔ a nyabani fɛ̃ɛm, a shiriyirɛ a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Setɛ yupɛ̃ni soja Lisiya atɛ&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;N nwa nyarɛ aa ruunni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Felis ãsi yupɛ̃ni soja rooma nyanɛ u ga Bulus tɔ, ama nɛ ukɔ bɔ̃unɛ ɓang, wɔsɔ̃n nɛi yaa ɓɛsayitɔ i au ɗɔbii i ãu vigbete kasiyɛtɔ.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus a Felis a Durusila Ɗekɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Akɨnti dɔɔ ziti Felis arɛ a ɓeso Durusila ni, ɓeso u si pɛ Yahudawa, kɛɗɔn Felis shonya nɛ shɔu ɓarin Bulus nya a weshoorɛ au nyani, aɗagbete nwanya aru sisɨn-ãnɛ a Kirisi Yesɔ bi. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Aɗagbete Bulus yɛ ɗekɨn a nyanwanɛni aru tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ, a yuu sãnɛ a lee ruuyeenɛ gbete kaanɛyɛ, kɛɗɔn seeti pɛli Felis rɛ a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɔdɔrim a sɔɔnɛ, n kɛ kpaa nyabanɛ n ɓaa nyarɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Au sisɨn nɛ mɛnɛ Bulus yɛ ã saa tɔ, aruukɔ ɓaliu nya a zɔng-zɔng.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Akɨnti saa ziti pokiyu Festu tɛ laa gomna roonɛrɛ a Felis naa. Felis yaa Bulus rɛ a jaahm aru kasinɛn kpaa bassinɛ a Yahudawayi ɗekɨn.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Bulus wuli shɔ a Kayisar ɗɔbii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Akɨnti lee taati Festu to tipi Yahudiyarɛ, a yurɛ a Kasariya yɛnɛ Urushalima. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Aɗɔwakɔ shɔlansi a wɛrɛ Ɗa a yupɛ̃ni Farasiyayi i wuli Bulus rɛ au ɗɔbii, i gaki Festu rɛ nɛu <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />pɔ̃rɛ shɔu sɔɔri Bulus Urushalimarɛ, aru si matɛttɔ nɛ shɔ wɔɔyi i nyou vɔrɔ a nyaba. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Festu kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Bulus ɔ̃ shɔ jaahɨm a Kaseriya, yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa ɗɔkɔkɔ ɓa n ang yuu n yɛn yɛ ji ɗɔwakɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Aru nankɔ ɔ yupɛ̃niyi i a pɛ a nkɔni, i wuluurɛ naa kɛ pɛli viwɔɔ nɛ kɔ̃linɛni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Akɨnti gbete Festu ɔ̃tɛ lee maantaa yɛnɛ kopi ai ɗɔbii, a sɔɔ tipi Kasariyarɛ. A dii ɓuru a ɔ̃rɛ la-ɔ̃nɛ ruuyeerinɛ, kɛɗɔn ãsi-nyarɛ nɛ shɔu n ti Bulus nɛ ang ɗekɨn. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Naa Bulus totɛ, a Yupɛ̃ni Yahudawa gbeteyi shɛ a Urushalima i kɨntiurɛ atette, i ɗɔgbete wuli ruukɔ̃linɛ au yuu fɛ̃ɛm, gbete i ai yuu i ji zɛnɔɔ tasinɛ dɔɔɓa.<verse eid="ACT 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Ama Bulus rau yuu a shanɛː &lt;&lt;N ji pɛli nya ãsinɛ Yahudawayi ruuvini ji ɓa, ko wɛrɛ Ɗa n ji pɛliyi ruuvini ɓa, ko tipi kayisar n ji pɛliyi ruuvini ji ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Ama Festu kasinɛ Yahudawayi nɛi nta sisɨn puru, a hɨ Bulus nɛ, &lt;&lt;A kasitɛ a yɛ Urushalima shɔu yeeraa ruu ang ɗekɨn a ɗɔwakɔ aru vimiyi ya? &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Ama Bulus shanɛ, &lt;&lt;N shi a kayisar jaa ruuyeenɛ, pɛ tɔ̃vɨn shɔu yeering ruu jo a ɗɔnkɔ, n ji pɛli Yahudawayi ruukɔ̃linɛ wɔɔ ji ɓa, moko a yuu a zɛ tɛjitɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />N kɛ ka nya-ãnɛ Musa nɛ ang pɛli vigbete yɛtɛ nɔgbete shɔu nyon vɔrɔyɛ, n yɛn ɓɛ̃ɛ̃ ɓa shɔu nyonrɛ ɓa, ama ruu tɔ̃vɨn ji ɔ̃ ɓa a vi gbeteyi i wulingni ɓa, shɔ wɔɔ yɛ ãng dɔɔɓa ai naani ɓa, a gakitɔ shɔu turɛn a wuling a kayisar ɗɔbii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Akɨnti gbete Festu naki-ruutɛ au shɔruu gelinɛyini, a kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt; A gakitɛ nɛn n ting a kayisar ɗekɨn nya, dɔdɔrim a yɛ yɛkɛ kayisar ɗɔbiikɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ N ti Bulus a Agiripa a Banis ɗekɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />A lewɔɔ kpati Agiripa a kpati Banis i a Kasariya nɛi tɛ Festu naa. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Akɨnti gbeteyi ɔ̃tɛ lee waanɛ a ɗɔuni, kɛɗɔn Festu tasi kpati dɔɔ Bulus ruubiirɛ: a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Jaa wɔɔ aɗɔn gbete Felis yasin a jaahm. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Aɗagbete n si a Urushalimayɛ shɔlansi a wɛrɛ Ɗa a Yahudawayi yupɛ̃ni dɔlaa i wuli jaaurɛ ang ɗɔbii, i gaking rɛ nɛn yeeriu au yuu. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Ama n geliyi n-tɛ au nakoo Rooma u ji yeruu jo a yuu shããni ɓa, naa shɔ gbete shɔ wuluurɛ ji ɔ̃ ɓa a ɗɔmni ɓa, setɛ shɔ ntiutɛ a shɔ gbete i wulu ɗekɨn, i ɗɔ gbeteyi zɛ zɔɔ a nɔɔ, kɛɗɔn shɔu ãu naarɛ u nwanya naa kɛ zɛnɔɔ u yuu raanɛnɛ u raarɛ. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Naa i aa ɗɔmtɛ, n ji yisi ɗaa ɓa, a dii ɓuru n ɔ̃rɛ ayuu la-ɔ̃nɛ ruyeenɛ ang pɔ̃rɛ shɔ n ti jaaurɛ. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Naa shɔ gbeteyi wuli ruu i yutɛ, ama i ji wuliu ɓa ayuu vi tɔ̃vɨn gbete n pɔ̃ ang sisɨn yɛɓa. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Ama i masinya a Bulus ayuu vi wɔɔ ai nyaba gɨnnɛ, aru shɔ gbete vɔ tɛttɔ au niinɛ Yesɔ, ama Bulus tasinɛu doo a suruniyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Si nkɔng ma n ang yuu n ji zɛ vigbete n yɛn pɛli aru ruumni ɓa, kɛɗɔn n hɨ Bulus rɛ kasitɛya u yɛ Urushalima shɔu yeeriu ruu aɗɔwakɔ aru vigbete shɔ wuli au yuuni yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Ama Bulus gaki rɛ nɛ shɔu shiri ruum pɛtɔ, shɔu gantɔ see ɗagbete kpati kayisar nwarin ruutɛ, kɛɗɔn n ãsi-nyarɛ n-tɛ shɔu pɔ̃unɛ a ɗɔ ganɛ yɛnɛ ɗagbete shɔ n-tiu kayisar ɗɔbiiyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Kpati Agiripa geli Festu nɛ, &lt;&lt;N kɔma n yɛn kasitɔ n nta jaam ruu ang yuu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Festu kasiunya nɛ, &lt;&lt;I yɛ ntau ɓuru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />A dii ɓuru kpati Agiripa a Banisni i to ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛurɛ a bassinɛni kirim-kirim, i a a nyazɔ a yupɛ̃ni dɔlaawini wɔsɔ̃n yupɛ̃ni gbeteyi sã komoou yɛ. Kɛɗɔn Festu ãsi shɔ nyarɛ nɛ shɔu n ti Bulus nɛ, shɔ n-tiurɛ. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Kɛɗɔn Festu shanɛ, kpati Agiripa a shɔ gbeteyi aɗɔm a ukɔuni kpai, a zɛ jaa gbete aa ɗekɨn tɛya, shɔ Yahudawa gbeteyi aɗɔm a shɔ Urushalimani kpai, i wuliu ang ɗɔbii. i shaati nya nɛ ji tɔ̃ɓa shɔu yau a suruni ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Ama n ji zɛ vi gbete pɛliyɛ au yɛtɛ nɔgbete shɔu nyou vɔrɔyɛ ɓa. Ama aru u au yuu gaki rɛ nɛ shɔu n ting ruu kayisar ɗɔbii, ang kasirɛ n-tɛ shɔu n tinɛ yɛnɛu ɗɔbii. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />N ruu wɔɔ gbete n zɛnɔɔ kpati Roma beerinɛ au yuuni ɓa. arumkɔ n-tiurɛ awɔ ɗekɨn, Kpati Agiripa, aru akɨnti gbete ɔ kɛ hɨliu ruunɛyɛ, n kpaa vigbete n yɛn bee yɛkɨn. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Ang zɛnɛ ɓa tɔ̃vɨn ɓa shɔu dɔ̃ shɔ jaahɨm shɔ ji tasiu ruuvini ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s1">Bulus rau yuu a Agiripa ɗekɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Agiripa geli Bulus nɛ, &lt;&lt;N ã naatɛ a nwanya aru a raa yuu.&gt;&gt;Kɛɗɔn Bulus ɗee naarɛ a nwanya shanɛ:<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />Kpati Agiripa! N ãsisɨntɛ a pɛlin vitɔvɨng nɛm aa ɗekɨnkɔ n yɛn ran yuuyɛ, aru nyanwalinɛ gbete Yahudawayi sha ang yuuyɛ, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Pɛ vitɔvɨng ang ɗɔbiini aru a zɛ Yahudawayi nakootɛ ai yuuyɔrinɛni kpai, aru nankɔ n gakaatɔ Ɗau ã nyamɛrɛ a shoo gbete aa wee ang nyani. <verse eid="ACT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />&lt;&lt;Yahudawayi kpai i zɛn ɔ̃nɛ tɛttɔ sin doo jakasa. I zɛ nɔ gbete n ɔ̃yɛ tɛttɔ kpai, gaanɛ ang tipi a Urushalimani. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />I zɛ tɛttɔ tɛ̃ɛ̃-tɛ̃ɛ̃, i kɛ kasinɛ i yɛ shitɔ ang kɨnti ni nɛn ɔ̃jo atette yumusinɛ au dɔlaa gbeteu tɛɛtɛttɔ a raɓoonɛni au nyaba gɨnnɛ Farasiyayi ni. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Dɔdɔrim n shitɛ awɔ dekɨn shɔu nwa ruu ang yuu, aru n sisɨn ãnɛ gbete n awuni a Ɗalapa ma a mauruyi yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Shɔm ji ruumanɛ gbete u nyakoo kop atu zitiyi i pɔ̃ sisɨn nɛi zɛyɛkɔ, i mabii i bassi Ɗalapa niti a zɨmbani, Kpati ji aru gbete n sisɨn pɔ̃nɛnkɔ Yahudawayi i wulunrɛǃ <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Aru ivi ɓa vi pɛlaa awɔ ɗɔbiini aɗɔm, ɔ ãsisɨn nɛ Ɗalapa yɛ zɛnɔɔ shɔ gbete vɔtɛ yusinɛ dɔɔɓa sàà ni ɓa viya?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />&lt;&lt;N ang yuu si tɛ̃ɛtɛ̃ɛ n-tɔɔ n-tɛ n pɛli ko-iviyatɔ aru n zãri Yesɔ shɔ nazara ruubii dekɨn yɛnɛtɔ. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Shom vigbete n pɛli a Urushalima kɔ. N kpaa kaka a shɔlansiyi a wɛrɛ Ɗa i bi ang mali shɔ tɔ̃vɨn a jaahm; Naa Yahudawayi kɛ yeruunɛ a shɔ tɔ̃vɨn i yuu nɛ shɔ nyoyi vɔrɔ, n pɔ̃naatɔ n-tɛ shɔ pɛlinɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />N raki a Yahudawayi ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛ kpai n tasiyi raarɛ wɔsɔ̃n n pɔ̃rɛ i nwali ruukɔ̃linɛ a Yesɔ yuu. N lɛsi sisɨn a ikɔyi ni fɛ̃ɛm, n gɨnrɛ yɛnɛ tipi ɓili n tasiyi raarɛ.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus Nwanya Aru u Sisɨn Kɔsinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />&lt;&lt;Kɛɗɔn sin aɗɔ Damasku yɛnɛ aru n tasi shɔ gbeteyi a ɗɔu raa, shɔlansi wɛrɛ Ɗa i ang kakaurɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Kpati, si a nyaba a tete niti, n zɛ ɗɔsẽsẽ ɓoloɓolo au tɛɛ ɗaatɔ yɛ, shɛ a kunyasi a kukinrɛ a shɔ gbeteyi radɔɔ a nkɔniyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />U kpai u nwesi a tipi kɛɗɔn n nta yeenya a nya Ibiraniyawa nɛ, &lt;Shawulu, Shawuluǃ A tasin-raa pi aru-iviya? A tasipɛ ayuu raa akɛ ɔ̃nɛ n shɔnɔpɔ̃.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />N hɨnɛ&lt;Uɓeyelapa mokaa piya?&gt; A Uɓeyelapa kasinya nɛ, &lt;Nkɔ ɔ̃rɛ Yesɔ, shɔ gbete a tasi-raayɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Ama yulapa nɛ a shi dɔɔ, n shɛ aa bi n lɔɔarɛ a ɔ̃ n jashonɛ, a geli shɔ wɔyitɔ vigbete a zɛrɛ ang yuu nɛm a vi gbete a yɛn tasaa yɛ a ɗekɨn. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />N yɛn raatɔ a shɔ Israila i naani a shɔ Yahudawa i naani, shɔ gbete n yɛn sho-a ai ɗɔbiiyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />A ɓeliyi nɔɔ a shɛshi a ɗɔkɨnri anɛ ɗɔsẽsẽ, a raayi kati a japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ naani anɛ Ɗalapa ɗɔbii, nɔgbete Ɗalapa u yaasiyi ruuvini kɛkɨn, wɔsɔ̃n i yɛ vɔsi vi gbete Ɗalapa marɛ nɛn ãyɛ a shɔ wɔyini gbete Ɗalapa sɔɔyi tɛttɔ aru i ãsisɨntɛ au bi.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus nwanya au vishonɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />&lt;&lt;Kpati Agiripa aru nankɔ n ji ɓɛ̃ɛ̃ vitasinɛ gbete n zɛ a kolapa nya gɨnnɛ tɔɓa. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />N gaapɛ shɔ Ɗa Damasku i Ɗa nyaruubii nwarinɛ ang yɛ Urushalimarɛ kɛɗɔn yɛ tipi Yahudiya piti, a shɔ gbeteyi i ɓa Yahudawa ɓani kpai, n nwariyi Ɗa nyaruubii n-tɛ ɔ̃riyi kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ i yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛtɔ i sɔɔ Ɗalapa ɗɔbii, aruumkɔ i pɛlikɛ vi gbete yɛ tasinɛi yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛtɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Ji arumkɔ shɔ Yahudawa miyi i sãnrɛ a wɛrɛ Ɗa i ɗɔ gbeteyi kãlin nyaba nyonɛyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Ama Ɗalapa pɔ̃sinnaatɛ anɛ dɔdɔrim, aruukɔ n yurɛ n nwanya a shɔ ɗekɨn shɔpẽniyi a jajajni ayuu Yesɔ ruubiini. Vi gbete n shayɛ ji vi gbete janyagadiyi a Musa vi gbeteyi sha sinɛ yɛ ɔ̃yɛkɔ, <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Nɛ ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ shɔshɔranɛ u ɓoraatɔ, ukɔ yɛ gaa yunɛ a suru ni a sàà, aru u n ti Yahudawayi ɗɔsẽsẽ a shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓayɛ kpai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Aɗagbete Bulus u ɗɔu rau yuu a nyabamyɛ, Festu sha nya a gãgãni nɛ, &lt;&lt;Bulus a rii rãn yaǃ A vi gbete a ɓaliɓa waanɛm risaa yuutɛ zitiǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Bulus kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpatiǃ n ɓa rãn ɓa, n shapɛ vitɔ̃vɨng ang tete sisɨn gbete. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Kpati Agiripa! n nwanyatɔ a moni seeti ɓa ɗɔmɓa a zɛ tɛttɔ aru vimni. N ãsisɨntɛ a yɛ kpaa sisɨntɔ ko shɔpiyani, aru vim ji pɛli ɓa a ɗɔ ɓusinɛ ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Kpati Agiripa a ã sisɨntɛ a janyagadiyi biini ya? N zɛ tɛttɔ a ãtɛǃ &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Agiripa geli Bulus nɛ, &lt;&lt; Nkɛ aa zɛnɛ a ɗaa dokaa nkɔ a kasinɛn ɗakinkɛ nɛn ri kirisatɛ ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Bulus kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ko ɗaa dokaa ko raki, N gaki Ɗa ɓa mokɔ sheeli ɓa ama shɔ gbeteyi weshoo nɛm ang nya kpai, i ɔ̃ ji na gbete n ɔ̃ ɓamkɔ, see mɔkaa ɔ̃nɛ shɔ jaahm naa n ɔɓam,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Kɛɗɔn kpati, yulaparɛ a gomna, Banis a shɔ gbeteyi i ɗɔuni kpai i yulaparɛ, <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />I yaa ɗɔurɛ i ɗɔ nyanwanɛ a zɔɔni nɛ, &lt;&lt;Jaam ji pɛli vikɔ̃linɛ wɔɔ ɓa gbete yɛtɛ nɔgbete shɔ mau a jaahm ko shɔu nyou vɔrɔrɛ ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />A Agiripa geli Festu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Si ɓanɛ jaam wuli ruum tɛttɔ a kayisar ɗɔbii ɓa, shɔ si yau naatɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s1">Bulus to latosi yɛnɛ Rooma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Naa shɔ matɛ nɛu to latosi yɛnɛ tipi Italiya, Bulus a gãsi shɔ gbeteyi a jaahmni shɔ ã soja Rooma wɔɔ a naa u niinɛ Juliyu, &lt;&lt; Shɔzɛ gbete atete Kayisar Ɔgɔstu soja dɔlaayi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />U to latosi Adiramitum, gbete si mabiitɛ yɛnɛ tipi wɔyi aka tipi Asiya, au gaa yɛnɛrɛ. Aristaku, shɔ tipi Tasalonika a tipi Makidoniya siu a ukuni nyazɔɔ.<verse eid="ACT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Adii ɓuru u to Sɔdom rɛ. Juliyu pɛli Bulus vitɔ̃vɨng a yau naarɛ nɛu zɛ ɓɛusayirɛ, i pɛliu vigbete kasiyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Naa u yuutɛ a latosi a sɔrɔ dusi au bi naakɛ lɛsiunɛ, aruukɔ u zaakɛ knti doddo tete mii Sayipuru ɗɔ gbete sɔrɔ kaka ɓa ɗɔmɓayɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Akɨnti gbete u tɛɛ wapo gbete ɗɔɔli a tipi Kilikiyatɛ a pampiliyani, u to Mirarɛ a tipi Likiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />A ɗɔukɔ yupɛ̃ni soja Rooma kpaa latosi Alezandariya au yɛkɛ tipi Italiya, a tosiurɛ a ɓuzɨn ni<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />U pɛli lee waanɛ u ɗɔranɛ kali-kali raɓoonɛ fɛ̃ɛm, a kɨnti ni kpai u to komoo Kinidurɛ vaanyaɓoo. Naa sɔrɔ zãriu tɛnɛtɛ, kɛɗɔn u zaakɛ ka gbete sɔrɔ ɓa ɗɔmɓayɛ, a knti doddo tete mii Kirit ɗɔɔli a komoo Salimoni ni. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />U tɛɛurɛ vaanyaɓoo, au to ɗɔgbete shɔ ɓaanɛ Amintaciya ɗɔɔli a komoo Lasiyani.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Aru u yisi ɗaa a nyaba waanɛ, yɛnɛ ɗɛkɨn a latosi ɔ̃kɛ sisɨn anɛ a Ɗa naa, si saa yɛtɛ kpɛlɛ, lee gbete Yahudawayi i ã vi yuu ãnɛ aru Ɗalapa u yasiyi ruuvini si tɛɛtɛ, kɛɗɔn Bulus geliyi ruu nɛː <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />&lt;&lt;Masayi, n zɛrɛ ukɛ yɛ ɗekɨn nɛ a yɛnɛni a latosim yukɔnɛ yɛ ɔ̃ ɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm, vi gbete u siiɓam yɛ lɛsitɔ fɛ̃ɛm a latosini kpai, ɓaukɔ sheeli ɓa, ama au suruni kpai yɛ rariunaatɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Ama yupɛ̃ni sojau ji wesho ɓa vigbete Bulus geliu yɛni ɓa, a gɨn ɓɛɛji shɔ latosi zaanɛm nyakɔ a shɔ latosiu nya shanɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Si ɗɔu ji kɔri ɓa nɔgbete latosiyi ɔ̃ a goosi ɗɔnni ɓa, kɛɗɔn shɔzɛ gãsiyi waanɛ i kasirɛ nɛ shɔ yɛ ɗekɨn a yɛnɛni, nɛ shɔu mabiitɔ shɔ to Fɔ̃nis tɔ, nɛkɛ pɛlinɛtɔ yɛ, i pɛli goosi a ɗɔwakɔ. Fɔ̃nis pɛ ɗɔgbete shɔ to latosi yɛ a Kirit gbete riinɔɔ a ka gɨnri a ka paa, wɔsɔ̃n ka nagang a ka paa.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mii buu pẽniba a wapo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Naa sɔrɔ gaa dusunɛtɛ fɛ̃ɛfɛ̃ɛ a ka nagãng, kɛɗɔn shɔwiyi tɔnɛ mɛnɛ vigbete i kãyɛ nɛi kpaatɛ, ai gɔ̃ lasaa gbete sã latosiurɛ, ai zaakɛ ka doddo tete mii Kirit, ɗɔɔli a nya waponi. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Ama ji ɔ̃ ɓa dɔkɔkɔ ɓa sɔrɔ pɛ̃niba arɛ aka nagãng aka gɨnri a dusirɛ a doddo tete miiu. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Sɔrɔu dusirɛ a wa latosiurɛ, a latosiu ji zɛnɔɔ ranɛ ɓa a sɔrɔni ɓa, au yaarɛ sɔrɔ u dɔ̃urɛ yɛnɛ ɗɔgbete yɛ yɛ́yɛ̀. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Naa u zaatɛ a kɨnti jaa doddo tete mii wɔɔ, shɔ ɓaanɛ Kauda, a ɗɔukɔ sɔrɔu gaa shinɛrɛ, vaanyaɓoo u gɔ̃ latosi pɛ̃tɛ̃rɛ̃ a pɔ̃rɛ au yuu pɛ̃nibauni. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Akɨnti gbeteyi gɔ̃ latosi pɛ̃tɛ̃rɛ̃ tɛ yɛnɛ ɓuzɨn pɛ̃nibauni, i mali riirɛ i zaa latosi pɛnibau awuni kpai aru ukɔ sãkinɛ. I nta seeti nɛi latosi yɛ lokirɛ a seseli Siriti gbete mɛli vi kpaiyɛ, kɛɗɔn i nɔsi latosi u sisɨn rɛ ai yaa latosiurɛ nɛ sɔrɔu turɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Sɔrɔ miibuu yɛ ɗekɨn, kɛɗɔn a dii ɓuru i gaa vi gbete a ɓuzɨn latosiuni lorinɛ a ɓuzɨn mii, <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Sɔ̃n a dii taati, i lɔri gãsi vi-vishonɛrɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Akɨnti gbete nyasi kuki ɗaatɛ a sɛyini piti u ji zɛyi ɓa lee waanɛ, a miibuu u ɗɔ gbeteu nyouyɛ, u ji pɔ̃ sisɨn toti nɛu yɛ ranaatɔ ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Akɨnti gbete kopiya ɔ̃tɛ waanɛ vishaanɛ shaanɛ ɓa, kɛɗɔn Bulus yulaparɛ a shi ai ɗekɨn a gelinɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ si tɔnɛn weshootɔ ang nyani, nɛ ɔkɔɔ yaa Kirit nɛ, ɔ si ji kpaa yuyɔrinɛm ɓa a vi gbete lɛsiɓanni ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Ama dɔdɔrim n gakɔɔtɔ ɔ ɔ̃ a tete sisɨn-manɛ! Shɔzɛ gbete awɔ atetem u suru yɛ rariunaa ɓa, ji latosikɔ sheeli yɛ rariunaarɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Aru a zɨmba a si ɓuru Ɗalapa Ɗajashonɛlapa gbete nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ u ɓɛɛ ang basiuyɛ, a arɛ ang ɗɔbii, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />A gelin nɛ, mokɔ nta seetinɛ Bulusǃ ɔ̃raatɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ a shi a kayisar ɗekɨn, ji aa yuukɔ Ɗalapa au tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ yɛ raa shɔdɔranɛyitɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Ɔ ɔ̃ shɔ sisɨn-manɛ masayi! Aru n ãsisɨntɛ a Ɗa bi ayuu vigbete shɔ gelin mini yɛ ɔ̃ ji nankɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />&lt;&lt;Ama ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ sɔrɔu tuurɛ u lokiu a seseli wapo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />A zɨmba kopi atu nɛ̃ɛ̃ti, sɔrɔ pɛ̃niba dɔ̃liurɛ a wapo Mediteniya. Si mɛnɛ atette zɨmba shɔ latosi zaanɛ i tɔnɛ mɛnɛ u atɛ ɗɔɔli tipi ni. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />I nta miiu jamba i zɛrɛ u jambau yɛtɛ dɔɔ laa maangbete. Naa u yɛ ɗekɨn tɛ fɛ̃ɛ, Kɛɗɔn i nta miiu jambarɛ toti, i kpaakɛ dɔɔ laa nɛ̃ɛ̃ atu kopi. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />I nta seti nɛmɛnɛ latosi yɛ kpaarɛ a tari, kɛɗɔn i yaa lasaka nɛ̃ɛ̃ti kpete-kpete naa aka knti latosi, aru nɛu zãri latosiu yɛnɛ, ai gaki Ɗa nɛ dii u kaarɛ tɛ̃ɛ̃ti. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ latosi zaanɛwiyi kãkɛ nyaba naranɛ a latosiu ni, ai nɔsi latosi fɛ̃ɛ̃ rɛ a mii i pɛlipɛ naa i nɔsi lasaka kpetinɛ a ɗekɨn latosi pɛ̃nibaukɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Ama Bulus geli yupɛ̃ni soja a sojayini nɛ, &lt;&lt;Naa shɔ latosi zaanɛyi i ji ɔ̃ ɓa ɓuzɨn latosini ɓa ɔ ranaa ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Kɛɗɔn naa sojayi ntatɛ nam i yeeli rii latosi gbete pɔ̃si latosi naarɛ i yaunaarɛ mii.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Naa dii yaa kaanɛtɛ fɛ̃ɛ, Bulus gakiyi rɛ nɛi shaa vishaanɛ pɛtɔ, a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Dii nɛm kopi atu ziti, ɔ ɗɔsisɨnpɔ̃nɛ ɔ ji shaa vi wɔɔ ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />N gakɔɔtɔ ɔ shaa vishaanɛtɔ aru ɔ kpaa kakabi, ko shɔzɛ gbete awɔ tete u suyuu yɛ ranaa ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Akɨnti gbete sha vimtɛ, Bulus tuu borodi a dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa rɛ ai ɗekɨnkɔ kpai a dalirɛ, a gaa shaanɛrɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />I kpai i mabiirɛ, kopiya shaavi shaanɛrɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />U si latosi ɓuzɨn shɔzɛ laa kopi atu taati au jaa kopi atu maangbete (276). <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Akɨnti gbete kopiya i shaatɛ ɓuru yiitɛ, kɛɗɔn i lɔri gãsi visha kɛ mii latosi ɔ̃kɛ pɛlaa.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Riimii Sãki Latosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Naa dii kaatɛ shɔ latosi zaanɛyi i ji zɛ tipi gbete i ɗɔmɓa, ama i zɛ ɓooti gbeteu seseli ɗɔnyɛ, kɛɗɔn i mabiirɛ aru i n ti latosi aɗɔn naa yɛ pɛlitɔyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Kɛɗɔn i yeeli rii lasaka kpetinɛwiyirɛ kpai, i yainaarɛ a mii. Ji ɗaaukɔ i kali vi gbete shɔ rii latosi a wuni rɛ, kɛɗɔn i yusi fãrã gbete adekɨn latosiurɛ lapa nɔgbete sɔrɔ yɛ dɔ̃u yɛnɛ dekɨn. kɛɗɔn i pɔ̃ latosiurɛ yɛnɛ ka wapo. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Ama latosiu to ɗɔgbete miiyi toli aɗɔnyɛ, kɛɗɔn latosiu shɔ-rɛ seseli, a latosiu yuu torɛ a ɓuzɨn seseli ji guli dɔɔɓa. A latosiu gaa sãkinɛrɛ au kakɨnti aru jagɔɔ gbete mii gbãyɛ.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Sojayi marɛ nɛi nyoki shɔ jaahmyi kpai aru i yɛ to miirɛ i ranaarɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Ama yupɛ̃ni soja Roma kasi Bulus raanɛtɔ a zãriirɛ. A ãsinyanɛ shɔ gbeteyi zɛnɔɔ mii tɛ nɛ gaa dasinɛ a ɓuzɨn mii i wadɔɔzaa yɛnɛ nya wapo da; <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />shɔ gãsiyi i gẽli laa katako ko i gẽli gãsi dalinɛ latosi, ji ɗɔkɔ kpai u yɛli nya wapo darɛ kpai.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Bulus a Doddo Tete Mii a Malita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Akɨnti gbete u raanaayɛ, u zɛ kɛkn nɛ doddo tete mii shɔ ɓaanɛ Malita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Shɔ ɗɔwiyi a nɔgbete u si shɔzati kpai i pɛliu vi tɔ̃vɨntɔ fɛ̃ɛm, i tɛunaatɔ si mii aɗɔ anɛ a sɔrɔ baanɛni i wusiu yaarɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Bulus toli layaa wunɛ u ɗɔ tɛ̃ɛnɛ a yaa, kɛɗɔn sɔɔ shɛrɛ au zɔ̃pɔ̃ aɗɔni aru yaa shɛ̃shɛ̃, a rɛɛ au naa. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Naa shɔ koowiyi zɛ sɔɔutɛ u ɗɔɔ rotinɛ a Bulus naa i geli zɔnɛ, &lt;&lt; Ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ Jaam u pɛ shɔshɔnyonɛ, ko ranaatɛ a mii waponi, ama Ɗalapa sisɨn lɛsinɛ yɛ yau ɓa u ɔ̃ a suru ni ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Ama Bulus zɨnti naa a loki sɔɔurɛ a yaa, ji pɛliu viwɔɔ ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Shɔwiyi gaurɛ, i tɔnɛ mɛnɛ yɛ puutɔ, ko yɛ nwesi a tipi u vɔrɛ. ama a knti gbeteyi gatɛ fɛ̃ɛm, i zɛrɛ yukɔnɛ wɔɔ ji kpau ɓa, ai kɔsi sisɨnrɛ ai shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Bulus u pɛ jaaɗa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Ɓa kpɛlɛ a ɗɔuni ɓa ɗɔ wɔɔ siɗɔn jaa wɔɔ ɓɛɛ shɔ ɓaunɛ Pubilu, si ukɔ yupɛ̃ni a doddo tete mii. A tɛu naarɛ au wɛrɛ tɔ̃vɨn lee taati u gbete shaarurɛ aru u shɔzati. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Pubilu ɓeye u si a ɗɔroonɛ, nɔri a yɛti sonɛ pɛliutɔ. kɛɗɔn Bulus to au jaa a gakiu Ɗarɛ pɔ̃siunaa a yuu, a jaau gatirɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Naa vim pɛlitɛ, kɛɗɔn gãsi shɔvɔrɔyi a doddo tete mii kpai i arɛ a Bulus gatiyirɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />I ãu vi waanɛ, naa u tokɛ latosi u yɛrɛ, ai toli vigbete u kasiyɛ kpai i tɛ̃ɛriurɛ a latosi.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus Yaa Malita a Yɛ Rooma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Akɨnti shɛlɛ taati u to latosi a Ɛlizandiriya, shɔ ɓaanɛ,&lt;&lt;Jabɔ̃nɛ Ɗalapayi,&gt;&gt; U shaa goosi ji a doddo tete miiukɔ. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />U to komoo a Siraku au ɔ̃rɛ ɗɔukɔ lee taati. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />A ɗɔwakɔ u to latosirɛ yɛnɛ komoo Regiyum. A dii ɓuru sɔrɔ gaa ɗusunɛrɛ aka dii, a lee ziti u to komoo pitiyoli-rɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />U kpaa gãsi shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a Ɗabii a ɗɔwakɔ, i gakiu rɛ nɛu ɔ̃ pɛ ayini dɔɔ maanzii, ji nankɔ au to tipi Roomarɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Naa shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a Ɗa bi a Rooma i ntau ruubiitɛ, ai arɛ nɛi tɛunaa pɛ a tolimoo Apiyu wɔsɔ̃n a ɗɔ gbete shɔ ɓaanɛ ɗɔsusunɛ taati. Naa Bulus zɛ shɔwiyitɛ a dɔ̃ri Ɗalaparɛ, u kaka lakirɛ fɛ̃ɛm.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus nwari Shɔ Ɗa nyaruubii a Rooma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Naa u to Roomatɛ shɔ yaa Bulus rɛ nɛu ɔ̃ au yuu, a soja gbete gauyɛni.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Akɨnti lee taati Bulus ɓaa yupɛ̃ni yahudawayi nya kpai aru ɔ̃nɛ, naa i tolinyatɛ a geliyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;N shɔbii Israilayi, ko n ji pɛli n shɔbiiyi ruukɔ̃linɛ wɔɔ ɓa, ko ruukɔ̃linɛ aru u nakoo gbete u tɛ a mauruyi naa n ji pɛliɓa, a shɔmni kpai shɔ sãn a Urushalima a shɔ ãn Roomayi a naa nɛi mang a jaahm. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Naa shɔ Roomayi hɨlin ruutɛ i kasin naa yaanɛtɔ, aruviya i ji kpang ɓa a ruukɔ̃linɛni gbete yɛtɛ a nɔgbete shɔu nyo vɔrɔyɛni ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Ama naa yahudawayi i ɓɛ̃ɛ̃ vimtɛ, kɛɗɔn ɔ̃rinkɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ n gaki rɛ shɔ n ting ruu yɛnɛ kayisar ɗekɨn, ɓa nɛ n wuli mashɔzɛyi tɔ ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Arumkɔ n kasɔɔ zɛnɛrɛ n nwanya a ɔkɔɔni, nizɛ kɔ n pɛ jaahm aru gbete n ã sisɨn a shɔ gbete u shɔ Israilayi i pɔ̃-sisɨn nɛ kaanɛyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />I geliunɛ, &lt;&lt;U ji kpaa sẽkoo wɔɔ ji au shɛ a tipi Yahudawa aa yuuni ɓa, ko u shɔbii wɔɔ ji a ɗɔmɓa ko gbete aru u sha ruukɔ̃linɛ ko viwɔɔ kɔ̃linɛ aa yuuni ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Ama u kasirɛ u nta vigbete aa nyatɔ, aruviya u zɛ tɛtɔ kopiɗɔpiya shɔ sha ruu kɔ̃linɛtɔ aru kɨn gbete a ɗɔnni ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Kɛɗɔn i pɔ̃ lee gbete i yɛ a Bulus ɗɔbiirɛ, i waanɛ i arɛ a leeukɔ a ɗɔ gbete Bulus ɔ̃yɛ, a Bulus gai dɔɔ ruu Ɗa kpati roonɛ tasinɛrɛ yuunɛ a gadi anɛ ɗarɛ, a kasinɛn kɔsiyi sisɨntɔ nɛi Yesɔ kɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔshɔranɛ, ama pɛli vishonɛ labeenɛ Musa nya-ãsinɛ a janyagadiyi vibeenɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Shɔ gãsiyi ã sisɨntɔ au nya shanɛni, ama i shɔ gãsiyi ji ãsisɨn ɓa. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Ai yaa ɗɔurɛ, arumkɔ ai nɔɔ Yahudawayi i ji tɛ zɔ ruu tɔɓa, a kɨnti gbete Bulus sha vimtɛː &lt;&lt;Ɗa suru sha si pɛ vitɔ̃vɨng a mɛuruyi yuuni, gbete sha a janyagadi Ishaya nya! <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />Aru shanɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">&lt;&lt;Yɛnɛ a geli shɔmiyi nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">ɔ yɛ weshoo a weshoo ama ɔ yɛ zɛ ruu dɔɔ ɓa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">ɔ yɛ kɨnnɔɔ a kɨnnɔɔ ama ɔ yɛ zɛ ɗɔ ɓa<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Aru shɔmiyi sisɨn nɔɔtɛttɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">i nɔliyi shootɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">ai kukiyi nɔɔtɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">aru nɛi yɛ zɛ ɗɔrɛ ai nɔɔni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">i yɛ nta ruurɛ ai shooni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">i yɛ zɛ ruurɛ ai sisɨni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">i sɔɔn ɗɔbiirɛ, Ɗalapa sharɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">aru n yɛn gatirɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Bulus yisinyanwanɛ nɛ:&lt;&lt; Ɔ zɛtɔ nɛ, Ɗa ruu shɔraanɛ, shɔ sho tɛttɔ yɛnɛ shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa i ɗɔbiini i yɛ weshootɔ ɗɔnǃ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Naa Bulus sha vimtɛ nankɔ kɛɗɔn Yahudawayi yuurɛ a ɗɔuni i ɗɔ nyamasinɛ a kakani ai nɔɔ, aɗa gbeteyi kɛ yɛnɛyɛ.<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Bulus ɔ̃ saa ziti a wɛrɛ au tɛ a saa, a tɛ shɔ gbeteyi au ɗɔbii nɛi zɛuyɛ naarɛ <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Nwari shɔ nya aru Ɗa kpati roonɛ, wɔsɔ̃n mati shɔ vi ayuu Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ kirisi nii, sha nya a kakani ji nta seeti ɓa.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>